<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">Ezekiel</book>
  <para style="h">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezekiel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawmthum kum a tha li na a ni nga ni in Babylon ngam Chebar ngunhui ah keima Buzi ii tapa thiampi Ezekiel in Judah mi saltaangte taw ka teang khawm hi. Van kihong a, tuaciang Pathian ii lak mukholna khat ka mu hi. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hun sia Jehoiachin kumpipa sal in a kipaipui zawk a kum nga kum ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chebar ngunhui tua Babylon ngamah, Topa hong paupuina ka za a, ama ii vaangletna ka phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua ka dakto le saksang pan vuipi suangval hong pai ka mu hi. Meeikaai lian pui khat sung pan khualeng vazak a, a kiimkot van taang hi. Khualeng tee vazalna munah taau bang khat taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vuipi suangval laizang ah mihing pianlim bang ahi cherubim li ka mu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahihang tuate khat simin maitang li le tha li tek nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A peangte maam a, amate in khuital peangcin bang nei uh hi. Tuate sia taau nawt thiang bang keakin tee uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maitang li le tha li te bek hi ngawlin, amate in a tha khat tek ii nuai ah mihing khut li tek nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cherub te khat simin, a tha te nii tek phalhin, a tha dawn veve tek kiphasak a, king li nei khat suak hi. Amate tungin a kikhiin nop ciang, a pum uh kiheak kul ngawlin a hon in kikhiin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cherub khat simin a kibang ngawl maitang nam li nei uh hi: tuate sia a maisang ah mihing maitang, a ziatsang ah tawpi maitang, a veisang ah khuital maitang le a nungsangah muvanlai maitang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nganhing khat sim a thate nii tek kilaamto a, a hui pan a dang khat ii thadawnte taw kisisak hi, tuaciang amate ii a tha dangte nii tek sia a pum tung tek ah zep uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nganhing khat simin a mun li teng nga ahiciang lu heak kul ngawlin a uuk na po ah a hon in pai thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cherub te sungah meisip kuang bang khat om a, tua meikuang sia a tawntungin kikhiin hi. Tua meikuang sia leng vazak in khua lengsak vazal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua cherub te sia khualeng manlangza in nung le mai ah a manlangin tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nganhing lite ka et ciangin khat ii pangh ah khat a om lei taw kipha a mui li teng ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua a mui li teng kibang siat hi; tuate khat simin suangmanpha bangin taang hi. Tuaciang a muite khat simin, a sungah a mui dang khat tang takin a kiphaa in kithua hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuabangin a muite sia mun li ah a ukna sang pawpo pai thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua a muite ii kiil teng sia mittangte taw kidim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cherub te a kikhiin simin leangte taw kikhiin khawm a, cherub te lei panin a kikhaanto ciangin, a muite zongh a kikhaangto uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cherub te sia amate ukna po ah pai uh a, a muite zongh a cherub te bang tatak ma in pai uh hi, banghang ziam cile cherub te in a muite uk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom cherub te a kikhiin sim a tawlngak sim ahibuale vui sungah a kikhaangto simin a muite zongh in tuabang tatak ma in zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua cherub te lu ii tung san ah a tee vazal limlangh taw a kivawt kikhupsiin in a kikoi taw a kibang khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua a kikhup siin sia ii nuai ah cherub te dingin, khat simin a thate nii tek a hui a om sia ii sang ah phalh a, a dang tha niite taw a pumpi seal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A len uh ciang a thaphil nging ka za hi; tua awnging sia tuipi hawk bang hi a, ngalkap honpui lampai nging bang, Vaanglianbelpa Pathian ii aw bang ahi hi. A len a tawlngak ciang, a thate khup uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang amate lu tungah a om a kikhup siin sia ii tung panin aw nging khat om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua a kikhup siin sia ii tungah Sapphire suangmanpha taw a kivawt kumpi tokhum taw a kibang khat om a, tua tokhum tungah mihing taw a kibang lim khat to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua lim sia meikhuk laizang ah a om taau bangin taang hi. Tua in a kiim a paam theampo nasia takin khuavak taangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ii sungah sangun ii meal namcin om hi. Tuasia in Topa ii ompuina a kilanghsak khuavak taang velvol sia ahi hi. Hisia ka mu ciangin ka maisang ah ka puksuk hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang aw khat ka za a, “A thithei mihing awng, ding in. Nang hong paupui nuam khi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua aw ii pau laitakin Pathian ii thaa ka sungah hong tum a, hong phong in ka peang taw ka dingto hi; tuaciang tua aw in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, Israel mite kungah kong puak tu hi. Amate in hong langpan a, a taanghpupite bangma in hong langpanin tualngalte suak lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a thinpui in kei hong zakta bua uh hi, tua ahikom keima Vaanglianpipa Topa in amate tungah ka cinopte a son tu in nang kong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua tualngalte in nang thu hong ngai zong hong ngai bua zong, amate sungah kamsaang khat om ci sia he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ahihang a thithei mihing awng, amate ahizong, amate hong ci pawpo ahizong, na kiita bua het tu hi. Amate in nang hong nalh in hong zawngsak tu hi; aikam hon kawm a teen bang hi tu hi. Tuabang ahihang tua tualngalte ahizong, amate ii cite ahizong kiita peang heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in hong ngai zong hong ngai bua zong son tu a kong sawl babang na son tu hi. Amate sia bangbang tualngalte ziam cisia ciamtee ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, kong sonte hong ngai ta'n. Amate bangin tualngal suak heak in. Na kam kaa in a, kong piak tu sia ne ta'n,” a ci sia ka za thua lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khut khat kei sang hong kithaak ka mu a, laizial khat a toai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua khut in tua laizial sia phalh a, tuaciang a lang le lang ah lai ki at te — khuangai a kaana te le mauna taunate a ki at ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in, “A thithei mihing awng, laizial hisia ne in; tua zawkciang Israel mite kungah pai in paupui ta'n,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka kam ka kaa a, tuasia ciangin ama in laizial sia ka neak tu in hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, kong piak hi laizial sia ne in; tua taw na ngil vasak in,” hong ci hi. Ka neak ciang, khuaitui bangin thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Pathian in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel mite kungah va pai ta'n a, son a kong sawl po va son ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A telhak ngamdang kam haksa khat a pauna ngam ah kong paisak bua a, Israel te kungah kong paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tel ngawl kam haksa a pau ngamliante kungah hong paisak hi leng, amate in nang thu hong ngai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Israel mite khat zongh in hong ngai nuam ngawl tu hi, amate in kei pau ngawngawn hong ngai ngawl tu hi. Amate theampo sia thinpui in nalh nopna thin vive nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu in nang sia amate bangma in na thin kong puisak tu a, na thin kong khosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suangpi bangin kong kipsak tu a, diamond suang manpha bangin kong saksak tu hi; tua tualngalte kiita vet heak in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in, “A thithei mihing awng, pha takin hong ngai ta'n, kong son pawpo ciamtee in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang saltaang a om, na ngammipuite kungah pai in, na pau hong ngai zong hong ngai bua zong, kei Vaanglianpipa Topa ii amate tungah ka ci teng va son ta'n,” hong ci thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Pathian thaa in kei hong laamto a, tuaciang ka nung pan a hawk, awnging vazak khat ka za a, “Vantung ah a om Topa minthanna pok vun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vui sungah cherub te thaphil khopna aw le zinliing nging za in a nging, a muite aw ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa ii vaangletna sia ka tungah thahatna lianpi taw hong theng a, tuaciang ama thaa in kei hong paipui ciangin dik ka sa bua a ka thin a uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom, saltaangte teenna Chebar ngunhui Tel Abib ah pai in tua munah ni sali sung ka taam a, ka mu ka zaak thu in hong ngawtcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni sali a cin zawkciang, Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in “A thithei mihing awng, Israel minam atu ngalvil khat in nang kong koi tu hi. Kidop natu nang tungah kong piak thute, amate tungah sonsawn tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing ngilo khat a thi tu in ka taangko a, ahihang a nuntakna a ngup natu in a ngamtatna kikheal natu na son bua ahile, ama sia mimaw ma in a thi tu hi, tuaciang ama ii thina sia nang tungah hong kisiik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing ngilo khat kidop natu thu na pia a, ahihang ama in mawna kikheal ngawlin mawnei ma in thi tu hi, ahihang nang nuntakna hong kikhoaikhe tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihing pha takpi khat sia ngitlo nasep hong kipan a, tuaciangin a lauhuai dinmun ah ka koi ciang, a kidop natu thu na pia buale ama thi tu hi. Ama ii mawnate hu in ama thi tu hi — a pha a septe ka tepteesak buatu hi; tuaciangin ama ii thina hu in nangma in mawpu tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing pha khat a maw ngawl natu in na hil a, na thu hong ngai in mawna a vawt buale ama nungta tan tu hi, tuaciang nangma nuntakna zong hong kikhoaikheetsak tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa hong ompuina ii vaang neina ka phawk a, ama in, “Ding in a, ngamkuam sungah pai in, tua munah nang kong paupui tu hi,” hong cina aw ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom ngamkuam sungah ka pai a, Chebar Ngunhui ah ka mu sa bangma in tua munah Topa vaangletna ka mu hi. Ka maisang ah ka puksuk hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ahihang Topa thaa sia ka sungah hong tum in, hong phong a ka dingto hi. Topa in kei tungah, “Inn ah cia in a, inn sungah nangma le nangma kikhabil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khauzeen taw nang hong kiheencip tu a, a thithei mihing awng, mipi sungah na pai thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi tualngal a tho nuam mihingte kidop natu na son thei ngawl natu in na leei ka zawsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawk kong paupui kik ciang le, pau theina vaang kong piak kik ciangin, keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka ci teng amate tungah na son tu hi. Amate pawlkhat in hong ngai tu a, ahihang pawlkhat te in nang hong melsia tu hi; banghang ziam cile amate sia tualngal a tho minam ahi uh hi.” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in, “A thithei mihing awng, uksuang khat la in a, na mai ah koi in, tuaciang a tungah Jerusalem khuapi lakna in lam ngiit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Jerusalem khuapi a ki uumci na lim lak natu in, kanhte, leiciante, ngiaphual te le kulh sukthapna moltumte a kiimkot ah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thik daalkuang khat la in, nang le khuapi kilaklaw ah pang khat bangin koi in. Khuapi maingat in. Tua khuapi sia ki uumci a, a uumci sia nangma ni hi. Hisia in Israel ngammite atu in lim khat a hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang, na siiklam veisang delpha in lum in, tuaciangin Israel minam ii mawna sia nang tungah kong koi tu hi. Ni 390 sung tua munah na om tu a, amate mawna hu in na thuak tu hi. Amate daan thuak tu, kum khat ai atu in, ni khat veu daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua teng na man zawkciang, na ziatsang pangh delpha in a, Judah mite mawna hu in ni 40 sung thuak in -- amate daan thuakna kum khat ciang ni khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Jerusalem khuapi a ki uumci sia mitsuan nginge in. Khuapi sia na khuttum ngat in vau in a, tua khuapi siat natu thu sonkhol in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua khuapi a ki uumci hun a bo mateng na pangh langkhat pan a langkhat ah na kiheak thei ngawl natu in kong heencip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tu in mangtaang, zungtaang ham, benaang, be, taangzik le mangtaang nam dang pawlkhat veu la in. A vekpi hel in anluum vawt in. Tua anluum sia ni 390 sung na siiklam veisang delpha in na lup hun sung na neak tu an ahi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni khat in anluum gram 230 veu hong kipia tu a, a zing ciang dong na khom tu hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui zongh a kiciangtan in na ne tu a, ni khat in hai nii veu na ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing eakko taw mei na thut tu a, na anluumte a kaam tungah em in mihing theampo ii nang hong mu theina munah na ne tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Hisia sia a ngam uh pan ngamdangte ah ka thethaang hun ciang, thukham ii a khaam an sia Israel te ii a neak natu lim ahi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang ka zo kik a, “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, hi ngawl hi, tuabang hong hisak heak in! Bangma hun in keima le keima kininsak ngeingawl khi hi. Ka no a kipan, ama thu in a thi thawthong nganhing sa ahibuale ngamsate thalup peuma ii sa ka ne ngei bua hi. A nin in a kingaisun an peuma ne ngawl khi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in, “Pha mama hi, khui eak kong zanghsak zaw tu a, tua tungah na anluum na em thei tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Jerusalem atu anluum hong paina ka khaktan tu hi. A anneak a tuidawn lealte vathiam in hong om uh ciang, tua munah mihingte sia khuangai in a thinngim tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in neak tu le dawn tu an le tui hong nei ngawl tu a; a thin uh kiamin, a mawnate hu in a ci a sa hingkiam tu uh hi,” hong ci thua lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “A thithei mihing awng, namsau hiam khat la in a, na khamul le na sam teng meet kol in. Tuaciang tua na sam le multe la in, khaikhin taw na tee zawkciang, khen thum in khen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khen thum sua khen khat sia hong uumcina a ven ciang, khuapi sungah hal in. A dang khen thum a khen khat sia khuapi puasang na va kawkoaina ah na namsau taw tan neen in. A om lai khen thum teng sia vui sungah the in a, ka namsau taw ka delkot tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samzam tawm keam in a, na puan mong ah tun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang samzam tawm la leleau in a, mei sungah vawk in kaanghtumsak in. Tuate panin Israel ngam bup ah kaanghmei hong kizel tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Jerusalem en in, Ama sia leitung bup ii laizang ah ka koi a, a dang ngamte sia a kiimkot ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Jerusalem in ka thupiakte hong langpan a, a dang ngamte sangin a ngitlo zawkna hong lak a, kiim le paam ngamte sangin thuni ngawl zaw hi. Jerusalem in ka thupiakte nial a, ka thukhamte zui ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in Jerusalem awng, kei Vaanglianpipa pauna hong ngai ta'n. Ka thukhamte ni ngawl a ka thupiakte na zui ngawl ciang, na kiim na paam ngamte sangin ngimna tam piangsak zaw ni hi. Ngamdangte ngeinate na zui zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom Vaanglianpipa Topa keima in na ngal khi hi ci in kong son hi. Minam theampo ii mu thei tu in na tungah thu kong khen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngaimawk nate theampo na vawt hu in, Jerusalem sia nidang a ka piak ngeingawl, mai sang zongh ah ka piak nawn ngawl tu daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua hu in Jerusalem a om nute pate in tate ii sa ne tu uh a, tate in nute pate ii sa ne tu uh hi. No daan kong pia tu a, a nungta lai sun zongh mun theampo ah kong thethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tua ahikom keima in a nungta Pathian ka hi bangma in — hisia in Vaanglianpipa Topa ii kammal hi — nangma in ka Biakinnpi sia, a sia le a kiihuai ngamtatnate theampo taw ninsak na hikomin, hong hesuak ngawlin kong saatvawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mite sung pan khen thum sua khen khat sia khuapi sungah natna taw le ngilkialna taw in thi tu hi; a dang khen thum sua khen khat sia khuapi pua sangah namsau taw kisaatvawk tu hi; tuaciang a khakbel khen thum sua khen khat sia hui sungah ka thethaang tu a, namsau taw ka zuizen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka lung a kim dong ka thin uukna le ka thangsiatna te na tel tu hi. Hite theampo a pian ciang, na thumaan ngawlna hu in ka thinso a, Topa keima in na tungah thu hong son zo ka hi hunlam na tel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kiim na paam pan a minamte, nang hong kaantan pawpo in nang hong selno tu a, a kiheam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nang tungah ka thin uuk in ka thinso a daan kong piak ciang, na kiim a om minamte lau vadil tu uh hi. Amate in nang sia hong kii et tu a, hong nunau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na anneak tu hong paina ka khaktan tu a, kong pukthisak tu hi. Nang hong lalsak tu in, a kikap thaltang hiamte ii khak bangin, ngilkialna ii a natzia sia na thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tate thatlum tu in ngilkialna le ngamsa ngilote kong puak tu a, tuaciangin nangma thatlum tu in natna, ngoltolna le ngalte kong puak tu hi, Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel mualte sang en in a, amate tungah kong thupuak sia son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa kammal sia Israel mualte ii zaak tu in — Vaanglianpipa Topa keima ii mualpite mualnote, luamthukte le lei kuamte tungah ka son thute a zaak tu in na son in: mihingte ii milim te a biakna munte susia tu in namsau khat kong puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />biaknataute kinuaitham tu a, ngimnamtui halna biaknataute kisutan tu hi. Tua munah om mihingte theampo a milimte mai ah kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mite ii mithi luangte ka thethaang tu hi; amate ii ngu le taangte biaknatau kiim theampo ah ka thethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A biaknataute theampo le a milimte a kisukthap natu, a ngimnamtui halna biaknataute a kisaatthapsak natu le, a vawtsa uh theampo a bo cimit natu in Israel khuapite theampo kilalthamsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihingte sia mun theampo ah kithatlum tu hi, tuaciang a nungta laiteng in keima sia Topa ka hina hong tel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kithalupna pan pawlkhatte ka suaktasak tu a, ngam tuatuamte ah kithethaang tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua munah amate saltaang in teang tu uh hi. Tua munah amate in kei hong phawk tu uh a, daan pia in maizum ka piak sia he tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate ii upna sel lungtang in kei hong taisan a, kei sangin milimte deizaw uh hi. Amate tatsiatna le a etthawk huai nate a vawt hu in amate le amate kiihuai kisa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in keima sia Topa ka hina le kidop natu a ka thupiakte sia kitawnna thawthong ahi ngawl hunlam he tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Na khut meak in! Na peang taw khuasiik in. Israel te ii tatsiatna theampo le a thasiathuai na te a vawt hu in khuangai in kap in. Amate sia ngal sung ahizong ngilkialna taw ahizong, natna taw ahizong thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khualana ah a omte a ciina in thi tu uh hi; a naina a omte sia ngal sungah kithatlum tu hi. A thimong teng sia ngilkial in thi tu uh hi. Amate in ka thin uukna ii thahatna theampo phawk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mithi luangte sia milimte kawm le biaknataute kiimkot, tuaciang mualno saang theampo tung le mualpi dawn theampo, thingkung hingte le, oak thingkung lian theampo ii nuai, milim meihal biakpiakna mun theampo ah kithethaang tu hi. Tua zawkciangin mihing theampo in keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi hi, keima in ka khut ka vaan tu a, amate ngam ka lalthamsak tu hi. Thangsang sennealngam pan saksang Riblah khuapi dong, Israel mite teenna mun khat zongh khoaikhe ngawlin ngamtongta ka suaksak tu hi. Tuasia ciangin, a kuama po in keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in “A thithei mihing awng, hisia in Vaanglianpipa Topa Keima ii Israel ngam tungah ka son ahi hi: hisia in ngam bup atu in a bona ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Israel awng, bona hun hong theng zo hi. Nang in ka thin uukna na phawk tu hi, banghang ziam cile na sep na vawt tungtaang ah thukhenna hong pia khi hi. A thasiathuai na ngamtatna theampo hong thuk kik tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang hong khoaikhe ngawl tu khi hi, tua ahibuale nang tungah hesuakna hong lak ngawl tu khi hi. Keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam na heak natu in a thasiathuai na ngamtatna te hu in, daan kong pia tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hisia in Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi: “Na tungah tuasiatna khat zawkciang khat hong tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A vekpi kiman zo hi. Hisia in bona ahi hi. Nang sia a mansa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngam sungah a teang no mihingte atu in bona hong thetheng hi. Mual tung biakpiakna munte ah poai kikhaam nawn ngawlin buaina bek a om tu hun hong nai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hai ngawlin ka thin uukna ii thahatna na phawk tu hi. Na sepna sate tungah thu kong khen tu a, a thasiathuai na ngamtat nate theampo kong thuk kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang kong khoaikhe buatu a, kong hesuak buatu hi. Keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam le nangma daan hong pia sia ka hi hunlam na heak natu in, a thasiathuai na ngamtatnate hu in daan kong pia tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel atu in tuasiatna ni hong theng tu hi. Ngoltol ngamtatna pung vaial hi. Kiphatsakna sia a saangbel mun theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngoltol ngamtatna in khansiat seksolna tam piangsak vaial hi. Amate ii neisa a hauna a phatna, ahibuale a minthannate bangma a kikhe nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hun hong theng hi. Vanh lei vanh zuak sia khiakna a nei nawn ngawl tu ni hong nai hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian ii daan piakna sia a kuama theampo tungah a kibangin tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sumvawt a kuama po in, a supsa teng a nga kik dong a nungta buatu hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian thin uukna sia a kuama theampo tungah theng hi. A ngilote luhai thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lemle kitum a mihing theampo kithoai khol hi; ahihang kuama ngalsim tu in kuan ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian ii thin uukna sia a kibangin mihing sim tungah tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lampite ah ngal kisimna om a, innte sungah natna le ngilkialna om hi. Ngam pua sangah a om khat pawpo sia ngal kisimna ah thi tu a, khuapi sung a om khat pawpo sia natna le ngilkialna taw thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawlkhatte sia leikuamte pan a lau vakhute bangin mual tungah suakta to tu hi. A mawna uh hu in amate theampo mau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kuama po ii khutte sia thazawm tu a, a khupte huang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in khau-ip puan silhin liing ngawp tu uh hi. A lute uh kimeet tol tu a, kimaizumsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a khamh le a ngunnte lampi ah ninteak bangin vawk tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ii thin uuk ciangin, khamh le ngunn in amate hun zo ngawl hi. Khamh le ngunn in amate deina lungkimsak thei ngawl a, a ngil uh vasak thei ngawl hi. Khamh le ngunn in amate sia mawna sung zotpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khatvei lai in amate ii a et hoi suang manphate kiphatsakpui hikale tu in amate in tuate sia a kiihuai milimte vawtna in zangh uh hi. Tua hu in Topa in amate haunate huatsasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Ngamdangmite in amate ka suttolsak tu a, thukham paltante in amate hauna theampo la in, a ninsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Manpha ka sak Biakinnpi a mindaisak a, phalakte in sulet in a nitsak ciangin ka kamkumh buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na theampo buai a, ngamsung sia kithalupna taw kidim a, khuapite sia ngoltol ngamtatna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ngilobel minamte hi munah kong paipui tu a, na innte uh amate in ka tangsak tu hi. Na biakpiakna munte tua minamte in a nitsak ciang, na mi a thahat belte in a kimuanna uh bosua tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thin kiamna hong theng tu hi. Thinnopna na zong tu uh a, ahihang na mu ngei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuasiatna khat zawkciang khat hong kizui tu a, thusia lasia zongh piangin tui bang hong luang tu hi. A mu kholnate hong pualaak natu in kamsaangte tungah na ngen tu uh hi. Thiampite in mite a hil tu bangma nei ngawl tu uh a, tuaciang upate in ngaisutna a piak tu nei ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa khuangai in mau tu a, kumpipa tapa sia lametna bo in, tuaciang mite lau in liing tu uh hi. Na sepsa na vawtsate theampo hu in nang daan kong pia tu a, ngual tungah thu na khen bangin, na tungah thu kong khen tu hi. Hisia in, Keima sia Topa ka hina nang hong lak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saltan zawk a kum lukna, tha luk tha, a ni nga ni in, Judah mi saltaangte ii lampuite taw ka inn sungah ka tokhawm uh hi. Thakhat thu in Vaanglianpipa Topa vaang ka tungah hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka etto ciang meikuang bang mihing pianlim khat mangmuna ka nei hi. A kawng nuai sia teng sia meikuang taw kibang a, a kawng tungsia teng sia taau nawt thiang bangin taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in khut taw a kibang khat hong zanin ka sam pan hong zamh hi. Tua zawkciang hi mang muna sungah Pathian ii thaa in vui sung a saangna ah kei hong khaito a Jerusalem ah hong paipui hi. Ama in Pathian a thin uuksak milim khat omna Biakinnpi ii saksang kongpi tumna sungnung ah hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua mun Cheber Ngunhui ah ka om lai a ka mu bangma in, Israel ii Pathian ompuina a lak khuavak taang velvol sia ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in kei tungah “A thithei mihing awng, saksang en in,” hong ci hi. Ka et ciang, kongpi tumna hui ah a om biaknatau kungah Pathian a thin uuksak milim sia ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in kei tungah hong ci hi, “A thithei mihing awng, a piang nate na mu ziam? Ka mun thiangtho pan a khuala vaial na ah hong not keak Israel mite ii hi sungah a vawt a kiihuai ngamtatna en in. Hi sangin a mindai huai zaw nate ngawngawn na mu tu hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in suumsung puanung tumna ah hong paipui a, panghawng khat hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, hi sung pan pang sulet in,” hong ci hi. Pang ka sulet a, kongkha khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Tum in amate ii tua munah a sia le a kiihuai na a septe en in,” ci in hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom tumin ka en hi. Pangte tungah ngul limte le a dang a thiangtho ngawl nganhing limte, tuaciang Israel mite ii a biak a dang nate ii lim a kisuai teng ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite lampui sawmsalite tua munah om a, tuate ii sungah Shaphan ii tapa Jaazaniah zongh kihel hi. Amate khat simin ngimnamtui halna khat tek toai a, ngimnamtui a hal sia panin meikhu suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian in hong dongh hi, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel lampuite ii a sepkute na mu ziam? Amate a vekpi in limte taw a kidim inndoi sungah biakna vawt uh hi. Amate kam zonna hisia hi: ‘Topa in hong mu ngawl hi! Ama in hi ngam taisan zo hi.’ ” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Topa in kei tungah, “Tuate sangin a kiihuai zaw lai a vawtte na mu tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in Biakinnpi ii saksang kongpi ah hong paipui a, Tammuz pathian a thi hu in a kap nupite hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, tuasia na mu ziam? Tuasia sang a kiihuai zaw lai nate mu tu ni hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in Biakinnpi suum, a sungnung ah hong paipui hi. Tua mun thiangtho tumna nai, biaknatau le kongzin kilaklaw ah pasal kul le nga khawng a om hi. Amate in biakmun thiangtho sia nungngat in, nisuana sang nga in kunsuk a, nisuak sia bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, tua sia na mu ziam? Hi Judah mite in hi sungah na mu a kiihuai a vawt thawthongte theampo le ngamsung theampo a, a kizel ngoltol ngamtatna teng taw a lung a kim bua uh hi. Tua teng bek dom ngawlin amate Biakinn sung mama ah hong pai hamtang in tuate hong seam a, ka thin hong uuksak seseam uh hi. En in amate in thuak zawk mama ngawl tu za dongin kei hong selno hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in ka thin uuk tutna theampo thuak tu hi. Amate ka khoaikhe buatu a, ka hesuak buatu hi. Amate in a nging thei zaza au in ka tungah thu hong ngen tu uh hi, ahihang amate aw ka ngai buatu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Pathian sia hi bangin a au ka za hi, “No, khuapi daan a pia tute awng, hi sungah hong pai tavun. Na ngalhiamte hong keng tavun” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thakhatin pasal luk sia Biakinnpi ii saksang kongpi puanung pan hong pai a ngalhiam khat tek toai uh hi. Amate taw lai at natu khat toai a, puanneal a silh pasal khat om hi. Amate a vekpi hong pai in, taau biaknatau hui ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel te ii Pathian ompuina a lak, khuavak taang velvol sia a om ngeina ah a om cherub te kung panin kikhaangto in, Biakinnpi tumna ah kikhiin hi. Topa in puanneal a silh pasalpa sam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Jerusalem khuapi bup sungah va pai ta'n a, khuapi sungah a kivawt, a kiihuai nate theampo hu in, a khuangai a thinngim theampo ii talki tungah tepteena vawt ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciangin a dang pasalte munah Pathian in, “Khuapi sung theampo ah ama zui in that tavun. Kuama khoaikhe heak vun; kuama hesuak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasal huaite, tangvalte, ngaknute, nute le patangte thatlum siat vun. Ahihang a talki tungah tepteena a om pawpote thutha heak vun. Hi lai ka Biakinnpi panin pan vun,” a ci ka za hi. Tua ahikom amate in tua Biakinnpi ah a ding lampuite panin pan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in amate tungah, “Biakinnpi ninsak vun. A suumsung sia mithi luang taw kidimsak vun. Nasep kipan vun!” ci hi. Tua ahikom, amate in khuapi sungah khua mite thatlum tu in kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kithalup saan hun sung tengin, tua munah keima bek ka om hi. Thakhatin lei ah pukin ka boksuk a, “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, Israel ngam sungah a kinusia mite theampo thalup tu dongin Jerusalem tungah na thin uuk ziam?” ci in ka au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in, “Israel le Judah mite in a lauhuai mama mawna khialnate nei uh hi. Amate in ngamsung theampo ah mihing that a, Jerusalem sia khialna lian taw kidimsak hi. Amate in Keima Topa in amate ngam nusia zo a, amate mu ngawl hi hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang amate tungah hesuakna nei ngawl tu khi hi; amate ii ngual tungah a vawt uh bangin, amate tungah ka vawt tu hi,” ci in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, puanneal silh pa heak kik a, Topa tungah, “Nong thupiak bangin ka seam zo hi,” ci in thu puak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cherub te ii lu tung san ah a kikhup siin sia ka en a, a tungah sapphire suang manpha taw a kivawt kumpi tokhum bang khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in puanneal a silh pa tungah “Cherub te ii nuai, a muite ii kawm ah pai in na khut dimin suang meihol kamte toai ta'n. Tua zawkciang khuapi tungah the suk in,” ci hi. Ama ii paikhiat ka en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cherub te sia ama ii tum laitakin Biakinnpi thang sangah ding uh hi, tuaciang a suumsung sungnung sia meeikaai in tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa ii omna po ah khuavak taang velvol sia cherub te kung pan kikhaangto a Biakinn tumna ah kikhiin hi. Tua zawkciang meeikaai in Biakinnpi tuam a, leitual sia taang pempom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cherub te thaphil nging sia a suumsung puanung ngawngawn dongin kiza hi. Tua awnging sia Vaanglianpipa Pathian ii aw bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in puanneal a silh pa tungah cherub te ii nuai a muite kawm pan meikuang la tu in sawl hi. Tua pa pai in tua a mui khat ii hui ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cherub te sung pan khat in, amate sungah a om mei sia a khut taw sawkin, meikam pawlkhat la in, puanneal silh pa ii khut sungah koisak hi. Tua pa in meikamte toai in, tuaciang a paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cherub khat simin a thakhui nuai tek ah mihing khut bang veu a nei ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kibang linlian mui li zongh ka mu hi, tuate sia kibang a, cherub khat ii pangh ah khat tek om hi. A muite sia suang manpha bangin taang a, tuaciang khat ii sungah a mui dang khat a king kitangin kithua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherub te a kikhiin uh ciang, a kiheak kul ngawlin a pai nopna pawpo ah pai thei uh hi. Amate sia a pai nopna san tek ah paikhawm tek a, kiheak a kul bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate ii pumte, nungzaangte, khutte, thate le a muite sia mittang taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi a muite sia ka mangmu maksak sungah ka mute taw ma kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cherub sim in maitang li veu nei uh hi. A masa phitbel sia khuital maitang, a niina sia mihing maitang, a thumna sia tawpi maitang le a lina sia muvanlai maitang ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />(Tuate sia Chebar Ngunhui ah ka mu cherub te ma ahi uh hi). Cherub te vui sungah kikhaangto in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a kikhiin uh ciangin a muite in zui uh hi. Amate in leang tu in a thate a phil uh simin a muite in a zui lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cherub te a tawlngak uh ciang a muite zongh tawlnga uh hi; tuaciang cherub te a len uh ciang a muite in zui uh hi; banghang ziam cile cherub te in a muite a uk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang Topa ii ompuina po ah khuavak taang velvol sia in Biakinnpi tumna mun nusia in cherub te ii tungsia mun khat ah kikhiin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a thate phalhin, lei panin ka mu tangin a lento ciang, a muite in zui uh hi. Amate sia Biakinnpi ii nisuana sang kongpi ah tawlnga zii a, khuavak taang velvol sia amate tungsia ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chebar Ngunhui Israel ii Pathian nuai ah ka mu sa cherub te ma hi ci sia ka tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate sim in maitang li tek, tha li tek le, thakhui nuai tek ah mihing khut taw a kibang khat tek nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A maitangte sia Chedar Ngunhui ah ka mu maitang te taw kibang linlian hi. Cherub sim in a maisang tek ah tang takin kikhiin uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii thaa in kei hong laamto a, Biakinnpi kongpi nisuana sangah hong paipui hi. Tua kongpi naina ah mihing kul le nga ka mu hi, tuate sungah ngam lampui nii ahi, Azzur ii tapa Jaazaniah le Benaiah ii tapa Pelatiah te kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, hi pasalte in a sia vawt tu ngaisutna tupna nei a, khuapi sungah ngaisutna pha ngawl a pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in ‘Eite in hai ngawlin innte ih sa kik tu hi. Khuapi sia an huanna beal bang hi a, tuaciangin, ei sia a sungah a omsa taw ih kibang hi. Ahihang tua beal in ei sia meisa panin hong dal hi,’ a ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, tu in a thithei mihing awng, amate phat ngawlna son keak in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa ii thaa in kei hong uk a, Topa in mihingte tungah hi kam vaithakte son tu in hong sawl hi: “Israel mite awng, bang veu son a bang veu tupna nei ci sia kong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />No in hi khuapi sungah mihing tam mama na that zo uh a, lampite sia mithi luang taw a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tua ahikom hisia Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa in nangma tungah kong son hi. Hi khuapi sia an huanna beal hi takpi hi, ahihang tua sa sia bang sa ziam? Na thalup sate ii luangte ahi hi! Hi lai ah om ngawl tu nu hi — Khuapi pua sangah hong vawk tu khi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Namsaute na kiita uh ziam? Namsau taw hong sim tu kong puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuapi pua sangah kong lakeak tu a, ngamdangmite kong aap tu hi. A thi tu in thu kong khen zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciangin note sia noma ngamsung ngal kisimna ah hong kithatlum tu hi. Tuasia ciang mihing theampo in Keima, Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sung a omsa sia beal in a dal bangin hi khuapi in no hong dal ngawl tu hi. Israel ngam koisung po na om uh zongin, daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kiimkot ngamte ii thukhamte ni a, kei thukhamte paltan in, ka thupiakte na nit ngawl uh hang ahi hi. Tuasia ciangin, Kei sia Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kamsaanna ka son laitakin, Pelatiah topsuk in thi hi. Thakhatin lei ah pukin ka boksuk a, “Hi heak in Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, Israel ngam sungah a kinusia theampo thatlum siat tu ni ziam?” ci in ka au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, Jerusalem ah a teang mite in nang le saltaang a om na Israel mipuite ii thu a son uh hi. Amate in, ‘Saltaangte sia Topa a bia tu in a omna khuala lei hi. Topa in hi ngam sia ei tan tu in hong pia zo hi,’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tu in kong son teng sia na saltanpui teng tungah son in. Ngamdang a khuala na minamte sungah a teang tu in, a puak sia pa le ngamdangte ah amate a thethaang pa sia keima ka hi hi. Ahitazong tu hun sung sia amate paina ngam ah ka ompui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in ka ci teng amate tungah son in. Ngamdang ah ka thethaang na munte panin amate ka khawmtua kik tu a, Israel ngam ka pia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate hong heak kik uh ciangin, a ninnoi a kiihuai milim a mu theampo a vawk keak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thin thak lung thak le ngaisutna thak amate ka pia tu hi. A thinpui suang lungtang ka lakeak tu a, thunit theina thin le lung ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia ciang amate in ka thukhamte zui tu a, ka thupiak theampo thumaanna taw zui tu hi. Amate sia ka mihingte hi tu a, keima sia a Pathian ka hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang a ninnoi, a kiihuai milimte a bia nuam mite daan ka pia tu hi. A sepnasa tungah amate daan ka pia tu hi,” hong ci hi. Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua Cherub te leang tu in hong kithoai a, a muite in a lenna a zui uh hi. Israel te ii Pathian ii ompuina ahi khuavak taang velvol sia amate ii tungsia ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin tua khuavak taang velvol sia in khuapi nusia in, tua ii nisuana sangah a om mual ah kikhiin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mukholna sungah Pathian ii thaa in kei hong laamto a, saltaangte kung Babylon ah hong paipui kik hi. Tua zawkciang mukholna hong bo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuaciangin saltaangte munah Topa ii hong lak sa theampo ka son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, nang sia tualngal thin neite sungah teang ni hi. Amate in mit nei ahihang khuamu ngawl uh hi; bil nei ahihang khua za ngawl uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in tualngal thin a nei hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tu in, a thithei mihing awng, ngaltai khat ii vawt tu bangin vanh khat heang in khuazin ma in ding in. Mun khat nusia in mundang khat na zot sia a kuama theampo in musak in. Tua hile a langpante in nang hong phawk tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in nang hong mu thei natu in, khuavak lai in saltaang tu bangin na vanh heang in, tuaciangin saltaang tu bangin nitak a na din sia ensak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in hong etcik laitakin, na inn pang tungah a hawng khat vutlet in, na vanh sia tuasung panin la keak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na vanhte na liangko ah kisuanhin, na pai natu lampi na mu thei ngawl natu in na mit sawm in, khuazing sungah na pai sia musak in. Na vawt teng sia Israel te kidop natu hi tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa ii vawt a hong sawl teng ka vawt hi. Tua ni in ngaltai tu khat bangin ka vanhte ka heang hi. Tua nitak khuazin ciang, ka khut taw pang hawng khat ka vut a, ka pusuak hi. Mihing theampo mu tangin ka liangko ah ka vanh kisuanhin ka ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zingsang ciang Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in “A thithei mihing awng, tu in Israel tualngalte in bang vawt ni ziam ci in nang hong dongh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa , Keima ii amate tungah ka ci teng son in. Hi kam vaithak sia Jerusalem a uk kumpipa le tua munah a teangte theampo atu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na vawt teng sia amate tungah a piang tu thute limlakna ahi sia va son ta'n — amate sia ngaltaite le ngalmatte hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate kumpipa in khuazing sungah a liangko ah a vanh pua in, ama atu a kitolet panghawng panin a suakta tu hi. Ama in a mit hong sawm tu a, a pai natu mun a mu buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang ka ngeen ka phalh tu a, a sungah ama ka awksak tu hi. Tua zawkciang ama sia Babylon khuapi ah ka paipui tu a, tua khuapi mu ngawlin a thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zum naseppuite, ngaisutna a piate le ama a cingte theampo, mun theampo ah ka thethaang tu a, mihingte in thalup tu in amate zong tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A dang minamte sung le ngamdang te ah ka thethaang tak ciang amate in Kei, Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate sungah tawmno khat sia ngal kidona, kialpi le natnate pan ka luhaisak tu hi, tuasia ciangin, tua mun minamte sungah amate in a ngamtatnate sia bangza in thasiathuai ci sia phawk tu a, Kei Topa ka hi hunlam hong tel tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, an na neak ciang liing in a, tui na dawn ciang launa taw na ci ngawksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ngam ah a teang lai Jerusalem mite tungah Vaanglianpipa Topa ii kam vaithak sia hisia hi, ci in ngam bup ah son in: amate in an a neak uh ciangin a ci liing tu a, tui a dawn uh ciangin launa taw a ci ngawk tu uh hi. A ngam uh sia bangma om nawn ngawl dongin kithiak kilkel tu hi, banghang ziam cile tua munah a teang teng theampo in thukham a palsat hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu laitak mihing a dim omna khuapite sia kilalcipsak tu a, tuaciangin a ngam sia duisung ngampa kisuaksak tu hi. Tuasia ciangin, amate in Kei Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel mite in hi paunak; ‘Hunte papai a, thu a kison kholte taangtung ngawl hi,’ ci sia banghang lo kikik nuam hi tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu in Kei Vaanglianpipa Topa in tuasia huvau ka ci nop sia amate munah son in. Tua paunak sia ka bosak tu hi. Tuasia Israel ah kison kikik ngawl tu hi. Tuasia sangin hi bang sonzaw in: a hun hong theng zo hi, sonkholnate hong taangtung tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Israel mite sungah mukholna maan ngawl om nawn ngawl tu a, lam khialsak thei kamsaanna om nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima Topa in amate tungah son tu khi hi, tuaciangin ka son babangin kiseam tu hi. Hai nawn ngawl tu hi. No tualngalte awng, noma nuntakna hun sungah na kingaisut khol tu kong sonte vawt tatak tu khi hi, kei hong son zo khi hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in kong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, Israel te in na mukholnate le kamsaannate sia maisang a khuala mama hun atu hi, ci in a ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom, amate tungah va son ta'n, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in hi bangin ci zo khi hi: Haisaang nawn ngawl tu hi. Ka sonsate kiseam tu hi. Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo khi hi!” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, amate phuatawm kamsaanna a son Israel kamsaangte nalh in. Topa ii kammal a ngai natu in amate son in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi: “Hi a mawmaw kamsaangte a lal hi zo hi! Amate aituam ngaisut thiamna taw mu kholnate phuak tawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mite awng, na kamsaangte uh sia khuapi lalcipna sungah a teang ngiate bangma in mannung ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in luphung cimhna munte cing ngawl a, ciang zongh ciang kik ngawl hi. Tua ahiciang, Israel te sia Topa ii ni, ngal hong thet ciang kihuu zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate mukholna sia maan ngawl a, a thu sonkholte sia leilot thu hi. Amate in kei kam vaithak hi ci ahihang, keima in amate thataak ngawl khi hi. Tua hi napi in, amate in a kammalte taangtung tu in muangmaw uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate munah ka ci hi: Tua na mukhol uhte maan ngawl a, na sonkhol thute sia leilot thu hi. Tuate sia keima ii kammal na ci uh hi, ahihang no tungah hong son ngeingawl khi hi!”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom Vaanglianpipa Topa in amate tungah “Noma kammalte sia maan ngawl a, na mukholna uhte sia leilot thu hi. No hong langpan khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A maan ngawl mukholna te le lamkhialsak tu sonkholnate a nei no kamsaangte daan kong pia tu hi. Thukhen tu in ka mite a kikhop ciang, tua munah na om buatu hi; Israel ngammite tepteena lai sungah na min uh a kihel buatu hi. Na ngam uh ah na heak kik ngei buatu uh hi. Tuasia ciangin kei sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ka hi hunlam na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kamsaangte in ka mite sia na theampo pha hi a ci na taw lamkhialsak uh hi. Na theampo pha siat ngawl het hi! Ka mite in luphung sia suang thawthongte taw ciang a, tuaciang kamsaangte hong pai in, tua pang sia leikaang taw zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A luphung cimhtham tu hi ci in kamsaangte son vun. Buak bangin ngua ka zusak tu hi. A tungah ngialtangte hong kia tu a, vuipi thahat khat in seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Luphung sia topcip tu hi. Mihing theampo in leikaang tui ii kimanna sia bang ziam ci in nang hong dongh tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in hisia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii pauna hi: “Ka thin uukna taw luphung susia tu in vuipi thahat khat, biing a beal a sun bangin nguatui le ngialtangte ka buak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate ii leikaang taw a zut luphung sia vaat thapsak tu, semthap tu le a phungkawng suang teng nguak kheetsak lai tu ka sawm hi. A luphung sia puk tu a, note theampo hong dellum tu hi. Tuasia ciang a kuama po in kei sia Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Luphung le tua luphung leikaang taw a zutte in ka thin uukna ii thahatna a thuak tu uh hi. Tuasia ciangin, tua luphung bo zo a, tuasia bangma in leikaang taw a zutte —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />na theampo a phat ngawl laitakin, pha siat hi ci a Jerusalem a thinmuangsak kamsaangte sia bo siat zo hi,” ci in nang kong son tu hi. Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Tu in a thithei mihing awng, na mite sungah mailam thupiang tu a sonkhol numeite en in. Tuate nalh in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaciang, Vaanglianpipa Topa in amate tungah hi bang a ci sia son in: “No numeite a lal hi uh te! Note in midangte nuntakna ah vaang na nei thei natu uh in, a kuama theampo atu mitbum khut tuamnate na khuisak a, a kuama po ii lu tungah a khip tu in, mitbum dialnote na vawtsak uh hi. Ka mihingte tungah thina le nunna vaang na nei nuam uh a, tua vaang sia noma phattuamna tu in na zangh nuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangtaang tang tawm le anluum tawm na nga natu in, ka mite mai ah hong maimawlsak nu hi. Thi tu a, a kilawm ngawl mihingte na thatlum uh a, nungta tu a kilawm ngawl mihingte na nungtasak uh hi. Tua ahikomin, ka mite tungah leilot thu na son uh a, amate in no hong um uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu in hisia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng ahi hi: “Thina le nuntakna uk nuamin na hanciamna ah na zak uh khut tuamnate ngaimaw khi hi. Tuate na baan panin ka laaikeak tu a, na uk mihingte ka suaktasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Noma dialnote ka baltham tu a, ka mite na vaangletna nuai pan a tawntung atu in, khatvei lian ka suaktasak tu hi. Tuaciangin, kei sia Topa ka hi hunlam na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka liamsak nop ngawl mihing phate, na leilotna taw thinkiamsak nu hi. Mihing ngilote a siatna nusia in, a nuntakna uh a kihut natu pan na khaktan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom, tu in na mukholna a maan ngawlte le lam hong pialsak thu sonkholte bo zo hi. Keima, Topa ka hi hunlam na heak natu in na vaangletna pan ka mite ka suatak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel lampuite pawlkhat Topa ii deina dongh tu in hong haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, hi mite in a thinsung uh sia milimte pia zo a, milimte in amate mawna sung thet pui hi. Amate in tua thu keima in zo kik tu in hong um ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tu in amate tungah Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in hi bang ka ci sia son in: Israel milimte tungah a thinsung a pia peuma le tuate in mawna sung a thetpui zawkciang, kamsaang khat ii tungah thu a dongh te in, keima zo kikna khat a nga tu hi — tua in milim teng taw a kiphu zona hi tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua milimte in Israel te sia kei kung pan kiheaksak hi, ahihang ka zona taw amate ii citakna hong nei kik tu in ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tua ahikom tu in, kei Vaanglianpipa Topa ii Israel te tungah ka ci teng son in: Hong heak kik tavun a, a kiihuai milimte nusia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Israel te khat po ahibuale, Israel mite omna sungah a teang ngamdangmi khat po in kei kung pan kiheakin, milimte bia a, tua zawkciang, kamsaang khat thu a dongh le Keima, Topa in ama ii zona tu ka pia tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama ka nalh tu hi. Ama sia ettee tu khatin ka koi tu hi. Ama sia Kei, Topa ka hi hunlam nong heak natu in ka mite huamsung panin ka heam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kamsaang khat in theam thuakin, a maan ngawl zona a pia le Kei, Topa in ama ka theam hu a hi hi. Israel mite huamsung panin ama ka heam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kamsaangpa le a dongh pa sia daan a kibangin nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel te in kei hong taisat ngawl natu le a mawna a khialna te taw amate le amate a kininsak ngawl natu in hi bangin ka vawt tu hi. Amate sia ka mite hi tu a, Keima in a Pathian ka hi tu hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, ngam khat maw a, kei tungah hong thumaan buale, ka khut ka vaan tu a, a an ngana lampi sia ka susia tu hi. Kialpi ka tungsak tu a, mihing le ngannote a kibangin ka thatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Noah, Daniel, Job, mihing thumte tua munah a teang hial zong, a phatna in amate nuntakna bekma ngum tu hi,” ci hi. Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tua ahibuale mihing te a that tu in ngamsa te ka paisak tu a, kuama ngam sungah khualhaw in a kaantan ngam ngawl dongin ka lauhuaisak mama tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuaciang tua mihing thumte keak tua munah a teang hial zong — Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa , a nungta tatak Pathian ka hi bangma in — a tate ngawngawn zongh a hun zo buatu uh hi. Amate nuntakna bek ma kihun zo tu a, a ngam sia duipui suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tua ahibuale, tua ngam ah ngal ka thengsak thei tu a, tuaciang mihingte le ngannote a kibangin ka maaimot natu in a susia thei ngalhiamte ka puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua mihing thumte tua munah a teang hial zong — Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa , a nungta tatak Pathian ka hi bangma in, a tate uh zongh, a suatak zo buatu uh a, amate nuntakna bek a hung zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tua ngam ah a kilaw thei natna tungsak in, ka thin uukna taw nuntakna tam mama la a, mihing le ngannote ka thalup ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noah, Daniel le Job te keak tua munah a teang hial zongin, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa sia a nungta Pathian ka hi bangma, amate in a tate zongh, a hun zo buatu uh hi. Amate phatna in a nuntakna bek a hung zo tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii pauna ahi hi: ‘Jerusalem tungah a siabel daan nam li tungsak tu khi hi — ngal, kialpi, ngamsa ngilote le natna te — in mihingte le ngannote a kibangin susia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A suakta khat po om a, a tate a hun le na kungah hong pai ciang, na en in. Amate bangzata sia in ngilo ci sia na mu ciang Jerusalem tungah daan ka piakna sia piak tuak a hina thu tel in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuasia ciangin na ka vawt peuma sia ahang pha khat om ci sia na he tu hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, sapitkung le thingkung bangbangin kitee ngat thei tu ziam? Thingtaam sung a thingkungte le sapitbaak khat ih tee ngat ciang bang phatna om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang khat po vawt natu in zangh thei na ni ziam? Vanh khai natu thawnkoai khat beak in na sui thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua sia meitawna in pha bek hi. A mongte kaanghin a lai sia meihol a sua zawkciangin, tua taw bang vawt thei ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kihal ma ngawngawn in kimanna nei ngawl hi. Tu in mei in kaangh a, hol a sua seseam ciang kimanna nei ngawl zaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu in hisia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci nop teng ahi hi, “Thingtang sung pan khaungui kila in a kihal bangin, Jerusalem a teang ka mite ka la tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />daan ka pia tu hi. Amate meikuang khat panin suakta zo hi, ahihang tu in mei in kaanghtum tu hi. Amate daan ka piak ciangin Keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam nong tel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in kei tungah hong thumaan ngawl ahikom a ngam sia duisung ngampa ka suaksak tu hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Jerusalem ii a thasiathuai a sepnate lakin kawk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in Jerusalem tungah a ci teng son in: “Nang sia Canaan ngam ah piang ni hi. Na pa sia Amor mi hi a, na nu sia Hit mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na sua lai in kuama in na lai hong tan ngawl, hong sil ngawl, ci taw hong zut ngawl a, puan taw hong tun ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kuama in nang atu hite hong vawtsak za tu in hesuakna hong nei ngawl hi. Na sua lai in kuama in hong it ngawl hi. Nang sia lozau sung a hong kivawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuaciangin kei kong pai a, na chi sungah na kisaan kong mu hi. Chisan taw na kituam a, ahizong na thi tu kong oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thingno ciidam bangin kong khangsak hi. A thahatin na khang tawto a, ngaknuno na suak hi. Na noai pha takin hong bawk a, na mul zongh sau zo ahihang na pumnguak in na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nang kaantanin kong pai kik ciang, ngual taw a kidei thei tu na hi hun hong theng zo na hi sia kong mu hi. Na pumnguaktang sia ka laktong puasilh taw kong khu a, itna kamciam kong pia hi. Hi hi, nangma taw kiteenna thuciam kong pia a, nang sia keima aa na suak hi,” ci hi. Hisia Vaanglianpipa Topa son teng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang, tui la in na chisan teng kong silsak hi. Olive thau taw kong zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kizeam puantual kong silhsak a, savun phabel taw kivawt peangdap, puanneal dialkhip, naai laktong puasilh kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suang manphate — haak le khite taw kong zeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Naakbaa le bilbaate, tuaciang na khuk tu a hoi mama kumpilukhu kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khamh le ngunn taw kivawt kizepnate na nei a, a kizeam puanneal le naaipuan na silh tawntung hi. Anvui phabel taw a kivawt anluum na ne a, khuaitui le olive thau neak tu na nei hi. Na mealphat sia nasia mama a, kumpinu na suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngam theampo ah sitbaang ngawl mealphatna taw na minthang hi, banghang ziam cile a ithuai mama tu in hong vawt sia keima ka hi hang hi,” ci hi. Hi sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ahihang na mealphatna le na minthanna te suangin hong pai po na luppui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na puansilh pawlkhatte na biakpiakna munte zepna in na nei a, pumpi zuak numeite bangma in na pumpi sia na sik theampo na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngunn le khamh kizepna kong piakte la in, pa milimte vawtna in na nei a, tuate taw palngul mawna na vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kizeam puan kong piakte sia tua milimte na silhsak a, olive le ngimnamtui kong piakte milimte na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na neak tu an — anvui phabel, olive thau le khuaitui kong pia hi — ahihang milimte tung pan maipha na nga nopna taw milim biakpiak in na nei hi.” Hi sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tuaciangin kei taw na nei tapate tanute la in, milim biakna in na pia hi. Kei tungah na thumaan ngawl sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ka tate milim biakna in na nei bua zong, sia khop zo hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pumpi zuakin a thasiathuai na nuntak sungah na no lai hun — na chisan sungah na pumnguakin na kisasaan lai hun, khatvei beak na phawk ngei bua hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Nang sia a lal hi te! Lal ni hi! Tua siatna theampo na vawt zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />lampi hui sim ah milim biak natu mun le pumpi zuak natu mun na vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na mealphatnate buan na noai zo hi. Hong pai pawpo kungah nangma le nangma na ki aap a, ni simin pumpi zuak khat na hi vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lan mama na innpaam Egypt te taw na lumkhawm a, na paktatna taw kei nong thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tu in nang daan kong piak natu in ka khut ka laamto zo a, nang ii tel saan ka thupha teng ka la kik tu hi. Nang hong ensan a, na ngamtat nate kiihuai a sa, Philistine te tungah nang kong aap zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Banghang ziam cile midangte in hong lungkimsak ngawl a hikom Assyria te na del hi. Nang sia amate atu pumpi zuak na hi a, ahihang amate in nang sia hong lungkimsak peang bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sumvawt minam Babylon te a tu zongh pumpi zuak khat na hi hi, ahihang amate in nang hong lungkimsak tuan ngawl hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa pauna hisia hi: “Nang in a maizum maw pumpi zuak khat bangin hi teng na seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lampi lian theampo tungah milim biakna tu le pumpi kizuak natu omna munte na vawt hi. Ahihang pumpi kizuak pawpo bangin sum dei na hi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang sia na pasal na it taangin khualmite taw palngul mawna a vawvawt numei sia taw na kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pumpi zuak khat sia sum taw kithamh hi, ahihang nang in na lawmpate theampo letsong na pia a, nang taw lumkhawm tu in mun theampo panin amate hong pai natu in sumnguk na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nang sia a tumpian pumpi zuak nam na hi hi. Kuama in tuabang khat na sua natu in zawthawk thu taw hong vawt om ngawl hi. Nang hong kithamh ngawl a; nangma in amate na pia hi! Hi hi, nang sia lamdang ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu in, Jerusalem, nang pumpi zuak nu! Topa ii hong ci teng ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hi sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci hi: “Pumpi zuak numei khat bangin, na puan na sut khe a, na lawmpate le a kiihuai milimte tungah nang le nang kipia a, tua ciang, na tate thatlum in milimte tungah sangaw biakpiakna in na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hi sia hu in na lawmluite theampo — na etsat, na lawmpate kong khawmtua tu hi. Amate in a beamin kong kiim umsak tu hi, tua zawkciang na puante kong suut siatsak tu a, na nguaktang a na om sia kong ensak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Palngul mawna le mihing thana taw kong ningkhiin tu a, ka thin uukna le ka thinsona taw nang sia thi daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate ii thahatna nuai ah nang kong koi tu a, pumpi na zuakna le milim na biakna munte sia amate in nuaitham tu uh hi. Amate in na nikteen na puansilh te le na kizepna suangmanphate hong laaksak in, na pumnguak tatakin hong nusia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in nangma suang taw hong deang tu in mihonte thawn tu uh a, a namsau te taw hong neensem tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate in na innte hong haltumsak tu a, na daan thuakna sia numei honte in hong ensak tu uh hi. Na pumpi zuak sia kong tawlngasak tu a, na lawmpate letsong na piak sia kong tawlngasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin ka thin uukna hong veng tu a, ka thim tu hi. Ka thin a uuk nawn buatu a, kong eang nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na khanmoi lai in bangbangin hong phatvawt khi ziam ci sia na mangil zo hi, tua ciangin nasep na vawt theampo taw kei nong thin uuksak hi. Tua hangin na ngamtatnate theampo atu in nang kong liausak hi. A thasiathuai na dangte theampo na belapna in, banghangin numei le pa paktatnate vawt ni ziam?” Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Topa in, “Jerusalem awng, ‘Tanu in a Nu suun’ ci paunak hisia mihingte in nang huvau in hong zangh tu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nang sia na Nu ii tanu hi takpi ni hi. Ama in a pasal le a tate huatsa hi. Na suapuinumeite taw kibang ni hi, amate in a pasalte le a tate huatsa hi. Nang le na khuapi puite in Hit te nu khat nei a, Amor te pa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Na u nu sia saksang ah a om, Samaria le a khuanote ahi hi. Na naunu le a khuanote ahi Sodom sia thangsang ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amate paina a khuani te zui in a thasiathuai ngamtat bang na zui ciangin na lungkim ziam? Lungkim vet ngawl ni hi. Na ngamtatna theampo sia tawmvei zawkciang amate siatna sangin lawmawk zaw ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Keima sia a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma in na suapuinu Sodom le khuanote in siatna khaatna sia nang ii vawt za liangin vawt ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ama le a tanute sia kiphasak hi, banghang ziam cile amate in neak tu hau mama a, ngal kilemin dai takin nungta uh hi, ahihang amate in mizawngte le a hamsia mite a awlmaw bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Amate kiphasak in, thinpui a, ka ngaimawk teng veu vawt uh hi, tua ahikom na heaksa bangma amate susia khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Samaria in nangma ii vawt, mawna khialna a lang zongh a vawt bua hi. Ama sangin a thasiathuai zaw in na ngamta hi. Nang le na suapui te ih etkak ciangin, na huathuaina in amate maw hi napi mawna sel bangza in kimusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tu in min siatna na thuak kul tu hi. Nangma ii mawnate sia na suapuinumeite ii mawna taw tee ngat ciang, amate sia a maw ngawl taw kibang hi. Tu in na suapuinumeite sia a thiangtho bangin kimusak na hi ciang, maisan liangin, maizum nga ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem tungah, “Keima in amate — Sodom le a khuanote, Samaria le a khuanote khangto in, ka nuamsasak kik tu hi. Hi hi, nang zongh khangto in kong nuamsasak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Nangma le nangma na maizum tu a, tua na maimawlna in na suapuinumeite bangza in nuamsa ci sia lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Amate nuamsa kik tu a, tuaciang nang le na khuanote zongh kipuuapha kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na kiphatsak thei hun lai le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />a sia na vawtte hong kipholaak ma in, Sodom sia ciammuina in nei hi ngawl ni ziam? Tu in nang zongh ama bangma na hi hi — Edom te, Philistine te le nang hong ensan na innpaam dangte ii ciammuina na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A thasiathuai zummawk thute nasep hu in na thuak kul hi.” Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Na thuciamnate paltan a, na kamciamte ngaingon na hikom nang taw a kiphu bangin kong vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ahihang na khanmoi lai in kong thuciamna ka kholet a, tuaciang a tawntung a kip tu thuciamna khat nang taw ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Na unu le na naunu na nga kik ciangin, na ngamtatna sate phawk kik in, na maizum tu hi. Nang taw ih thuciamna sungah a kihel ngawl hangin, amate sia na tanute bangin ka omsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Nang taw ka kamciamte ka thaksua tu a, tuaciang Keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam na he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Na khialnate theampo kong maisak tu a, ahizong, na khialnate phawk kik in, maizum leilam in na kam zongh na kaa ngam buatu hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in “A thithei mihing awng, Israel mite tungah thu sonteena khat son in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka ci teng amate hesak in: muvanlai a lian mama khat om hi, a mul hoi in a thate lian mama a, zalh in a zai in phalh hi. Ama in Lebanon Mualte ah leangin cedar thingkung khat ii dawn tutan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />sumvawtna ngam ah len pui in, sumvawtte khuapi khat ii sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in thingno moi khat Israel ngam panin la a, a khangsak tu tui a tawntungin a omna lei phana lo khat ah suan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kung meang a, a niam, a zai a beakin a zaam sapitkung khat suak hi. A baakte muvanlai omna sangah khangto a, zung thukte tha hi. Sapitkung sia a baak le a teete taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“A lian mama, a tha a lian, a mul a saa mama muvanlai dang khat om hi. Tu in sapitkung pona huan sung sangin tui tamzaw muvanlai ii a piak natu lametna taw a zungte ama sang zaamsak a, a teete ama sang ngasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang sapitkung sia leiphana, a pha in tui kibuakna lo ah kisuan zo hi, a tee meang thei a, a nga nga thiam in a limci mama sapitkung a sua natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa in, hi bangin ka dongh hi: hi sapitkung sia hingin a khang tu ziam? Muvanlai masa sia in a zung longhin, sapitngate thongh keakin, a baakte tattan sakin, vulsak ngawl tu ziam? Sapitkung a kaikeak natu thahatna lianpi ahibuale minam lian kul ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi hi, hi sapitkung sia a kisuan ma hi, ahihang hingin a khang natu ziam? Nisuana sang vui in a nawk ciang vul ngawl tu ziam? A kisuanna munah vul ngawl tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hi a langpante munah thu sonteena ii a khiakna a he uh ziam, ci sia dongh in. Babylon kumpipa Jerusalem ah hong pai a, tuaciangin kumpipa le a uliante Babylon ah a ciapui kik sia amate tungah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in kumpipa innkuanpuite khat la in, thukimna khat vawt a, ama ii tungah a thumaan tu in kiciamsak hi. Ama in mi thupite luangkhaam tu in ciapui hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate in a kithukimna sia a kepcing natu le ngal thawkikna ngam ahi ngawl natu in, a khaamna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Judah kumpipa in leedo veve a, Egypt ngam ah siphu le ngalkap honpui khat sam tu in palai seamte paisak hi. Ama in a taangtun zo tu ziam? Ama in tuabang teng taw suakta zo tu ziam? Ama in a thukimna paltan thei ngawl tu a, daan thuakna peng thei ngawl tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Keima a nungta Pathian ka hi takpi bangma hi kumpipa in a kiciamna le ama kumpi tokhum tungah a koi Babylon kumpipa taw a vawt thukimna paltan ahi hu in Babylon ah thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babylon te in mihing tam mama a thalup natu in, kulhte vawt a, kanhte to ahikom a thahat Egypt kumpipa ngalkaphonpi ngawngawn in ngalsimna ah ama panpui zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a kiciamna le a thukimna uh paltan hi. Hite theampo ama in vawt ahiciangin tu in ama a suakta buatu hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Kei a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma in a kepcing tu in ka min taw kamciam a piaksa thukimna paltan ahikom daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Savaipa ngeen ka khak tu a, ama ka man tu hi. Babylon ah ka paipui tu a, kei tungah hong thumaan ngawl ahikom tua munah daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngal sungah ama ngalkap phabelte kithatlum tu hi, tuaciang a thi mong teng mun theampo ah kithethaang tu hi. Tuaciang Kei, Topa ka hi sia na he tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in hi bangin ci hi: “Cedar thingkung saang khat ii dawn ka zamh tu a, tuaciang a meang moino khat ka thongh tu hi, tuasia mualsaang khat ii tung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel mualsaangbel sia tungah ka suan tu hi. A baakte hong khangin a ci hong nei tu a, tuaciangin a mu nop huai mama cedar kung suak tu hi. Vacim namcin tua ii tungah teang tu a, a lim bealh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngamsung thingkung theampo in Keima, Topa ka hi sia hong he tu uh hi. Thingkung saangte ka phuk tu a, tuaciang thingkung niamte a saangin ka khangsak tu hi. Thingkung hingte ka vulsak tu a, tuaciang thingkung kote, a hing ka suaksak tu hi. Keima, Topa in son zo khi hi. Vawt tu ka ci sa te ka vawt tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang “Israel ngam sungah mite ii paunak a law kikik sia bang ziam? ‘Nu le pate in a thuk sapitngate ne a, Ahihang a tate a ha uh khim hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Keima a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma in, Israel ngam ah hi paunak sia na lo kikik nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing theampo ii nuntakna sia keima neisa hi a, nute pate nuntakna le a ta nuntakna sia zongh keima neisa hi. Mihing a maw sia, a thi tu sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mihing a pha takpi khat om ci in ngaisun tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Israel te ii milimte bia ngawl hi, ahibuale a kikhaam biakna munte ah a kipia sate ne ngawl hi. Ama in ngualdang khat ii zi sia zolsak ngawl hi, ahibuale numei khat a nin nei laitak ompui ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in kuama theam ngawl, a neisa suttol ngawl hi. Sum a pu khat ii a vanh aapte pia kik hi; ngilkialte anvaak in, a pumnguak omte puansilh pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a meet deina in sum pukthaak ngawl hi. A sia vawt tu nial a, thu kituu na po ah a maan in thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuabang mihing khat in ka thupiakte zui a, ka thukhamte pha takin tang hi. Ama sia thutang a, tua ahiciang nungta tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang, hi mi pa in tapa khat nei a tua tapa in ngual na suttol in that a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a pa ii vawt ngeingawl hi bang phat ngawlnate vawt hi ci in ngaisun tawng. Ama in a kikhaam biakna munte ah, a kipia sangaw biakpiakna sate ne in, ngualdang zite zol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a zawngte theam a, suttol in, sum a pu khat ii a aap vanhte tang paih hi. Ama doai biakna munah pai in, a kiihuai milimte bia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuaciang, a meet deina taw sum pukthaak hi. Ama a nungta tu ziam? Nungta vet ngawl tu hi. Ama in hi a kiihuai nate theampo vawt ahikom thi tu hi. Ama ii thina tungtaang ama kimawsiat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tu in mihing a niina pa in tapa khat nei hi ci tawng. Ama in a pa ii vawt mawnate theampo mu hi, ahihang a pa ngamtat bang zui ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in Israel te ii milimte bia ngawl, a kikhaam biakna munah a kipia sate ne ngawl hi. Ama in ngualdang khat ii zi zolsak ngawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahibuale kuama nengcip ngawl, kuama suttol ngawl hi. Sumpupa ii aap vanhte pia kik hi. A ngilkialte anvaak a, a pumnguak omte puansilh pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siatna vawt tu nial a, a meet deina taw sum pukthaak ngawl hi. Ka thukhamte tang a, ka thupiakte zui hi. A pa mawnate hu in ama sia thi ngawl tu a, nungta tatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa ahile ngualtheam in, suttol a, mihing theampo tungah siatna vawt tawntung hi. Tua ahikom ama mama ii vawt mawnate hu in thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ahihang, ‘Banghangin a tapa in a pa mawnate hu in thuak ngawl tu ziam?’ ci in dongh tu nu hi. A zona sia tapa in a maan le a phate seam hi. Ama in ka thukhamte keamcing a, belcing takin zui ahikom ama sia nungta tatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A khial a maw pa sia a thi tu sia ahi hi. Tapa khat in a pa mawnate hu in thuak ngawl tu hi, pa zongh in tapa ii mawnate hu in thuak ngawl tu hi. Mipha khat sia a pha a vawtna hu in thaman kipia tu a, mi ngilo khat in a sia a vawtna hu in thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihing ngilo khat in mawna vawt nawn ngawlin, ka thukhamte tangin, a pha le a maan a seam le ama thi ngawl tu hi; ama nungta tatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mawna theampo kimaisak tu a, ama nungta tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama in a maan in ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihing pha ngawl khat a thi ciang dik sa tu nong um ziam?” ci in Vaanglianpipa Topa in dongh hi. “Dik sa ngawl khi hi, kisiik kikin nungta le oai zaw khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ahihang mihing thutang khat in, phatna a vawtte khealin, siatna theampo vawt tu hong kipan a, mi ngilote ii a thasiathuai ngamtatna te hong seam le a nungta tan lai tu ziam? Nungta ngawl tu hi! A pha a sepnate khat zongh kitepteesak ngawl tu hi. A thumaan ngawlna le a mawna khialnate hu in thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ahihang, ‘Topa sepna maan ngawl hi’ na ci uh hi. Israel te awng kei hong ngai tavun. Na ka sepzia sia maan ngawl hi ci in ngaisun nu ziam? A maan ngawl sia noma ngaisut zia hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihing thutang khat in a pha nasepte tawpin, a siate a vawt a kipat zawkciang a thi le ama ii thina sia a sia a vawt hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing ngilo khat in mawna a vawt sia khealin, a maan le a phate a vawt le ama in a nuntakna a huu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in a sep le a vawtte phawkin mawna a vawt sia kheal ahikom ama thi ngawl het in nungta tan lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaciang no Israel mite in, ‘Topa sep sia maan ngawl hi’ ci nu hi. Keima sepzia sia a maan ngawlin ngaisun takpi nu ziam? Noma ii ngaisut zia a maan ngawl hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tu in kei Vaanglianpipa Topa in, no Israel te tungah hong ci khi hi, note khat sim ii tungah na sep na vawt uh bangin thu kong khen tu hi. A sia a kha na vawt theampo nungngatin nusia vun, na mawna in noma susiasak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A sia a kha na vawt uh theampo kheal vun a, thinthak lungthak na nei tavun. No Israel mite banghang thi nuam nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kuama a thi tu dei ngawl khi hi. Na mawnate panin, kikheal vun a, nungta tavun,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel te kumpi tapate nii atu in hi khuangai lasa tu in Topa in kei hong sawl hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na nu uh sia tawpipui bangza ma a hi bua ziam! Ama in a note sia a kiitakhuai tawpi talte kawm ah khangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A no khat khangsakin savaizia hil hi; mihingte ii sa a ne thei khat suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minamte in a thu za in, vuum taw a sia uh hi. Thikkoai zum te taw ama sia Egypt ngam ah kaikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua nu in a lametna a bo dong ngak hi. Tua zawkciang a no dangkhat khangsak leleau a, tuasia a kiitakhuai tawpi tal khat suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hong khanthin tak ciang, tawpi dangte taw kithawlin vak hi. Ama zongh sa vai thei in mihing te sa ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in kulhte susia in khua te lalcipsak hi. Ama a hawk simin ngamsung mite lau mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minamte in ama do tu in mun tuatuam pan pai in kikhawm uh hi; mun theampo pan mite hong pai uh hi. Amate in a sa siana ngeen hong phalh a, tua thaang sungah ama man uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawm khat sungah khumin Babylon kumpipa kungah paipui uh hi. Amate in a hawk a kizaak kik ngei nawn ngawl natu in Israel mualte tungah cing uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na nu sia luihui ah a kisuan sapitkung khat taw kibang hi. Tui tam ahikom, a kung sia tee le nga taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A baakte sia takin kho a, kumpi ciangkhut te a suak tu in hong khang hi. A kung in meeikaai ban tu za ma a saangin khangto a; a kuama po in bangza saang a, a tee boai ziam cisia mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang a thin uuk khutte in a zung pan longhto in lei ah vawk uh hi. Nisuana vui in a ngate kosak hi. A baakte kithiaktan a; ko in kihaltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in tua sia sennealngamsung tui om ngawlna lei kona ah kisuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kung zikpi sia mei in kaangh a; a baakte le a ngate kaanghtum hi. A baakte bangma hunin takin kho kik ngeingawl tu a, kumpi ciangkhut suak ngeingawl tu hi. Hi sia khuangai la hi a; a kisa kikik la ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saltaang in ka om zawk uh a kum sali, tha nga le ni sawm ni ahi hi. Israel te lampui pawlkhat Topa deina huvau a dongh tu in hong pai a, ka mai ah a to uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, hi mihingte munah Vaanglianpipa Topa in hi teng hong son hi va ci ta'n: ka deina dongh tu hong pai ahi uh ziam? A nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma, kei tungah bangma donghsak ngawl tu khi hi. Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa in kong ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, amate tungah thu tan tu in na kinging zo ziam? Tua ahile thu tan in. A taanghpupite ii a kiihuai ngamtatna te phawksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ci teng son in. Israel ka teal lai in kamciam khat ka pia hi. Egypt ngam amate kungah ka kilangh a, amate mun ah: Keima in Topa na Pathian khi hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia lai in amate Egypt ngam pan pusuapui in leitang teng po pan a phabel, leihoi lei phana ngam, amate atu ka tealsak sa ngam ah paipui tu ka kamciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kiihuai milim a it te vawkin, Egypt te pathian theamte taw a kinitsak ngawl natu in ka son hi, banghang ziam cile Keima, Topa a Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang amate in kei hong nalh a, ka thuson hong ngai bua uh hi. Amate in a kiihuai milimte vawk ngawl, Egypt te pathiante nusia ngawl uh hi. Tua mun Egypt ngam ah ka thin uuk tutna theampo thuaksak tu in ka kinging zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang tua bangin ka ngamta bua hi, banghang ziam cile amate teenna mite zaakna ah Egypt ngam pan hong pusuapui tu khi hi ci in Israel te tungah thangsak zo ka hikom tuabangin ngamta leng keima min dai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tua ahikom Egypt ngam pan sennealngam ah ka paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama te tungah a zui pawpo nuntakna a pia thupiak te ka nei a, ka thukhamte ka hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koma kilaklaw thukimna limlakna in Sabbath tanna ka vawt a, keima Topa in amate a thiangthosak sia keima ka hi hunlam a phaw natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang sennealngamsung ngawngawn ah kei hong nalh uh hi. Ama te in a zui pawpo nuntakna a pia ka thukham te paltan a, ka thupiakte a nial uh hi. Amate in Sabbath sia niincipsak uh hi. Amate sennealngam ah ka thin uuk tutna taw sucip tu in ka kinging zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Egypt ngam pan Israel mite ka pusuapui hong mu minamte sungah ka mindai tu ahikom tuabangin ka ngamta bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom sennealngam ah kamciam khat ka pia a, leitang po pan a phabel, leihoi leiphana ngam, amate ka piaksa ngam ah kong then nawn buatu hi ci in ka kamciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kiciamna ka vawt sia banghang ziam cile amate in ka thupiakte nial in, ka thukhamte paltan hi, tuaciang Sabbath niinsak a — amate ii milim ma bia nuam zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ahihang amate hesuak huai ka sa hi. Tua mun sennealngam ah thalup ngawl tu in ka khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua taangin, amate sungah khangnote kidop natu thu ka pia hi: na taanghpupite vawt thukhamte tang heak vun; amate ngeinate zui heak vun, tua ahibuale a milimte taw noma na kininsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi. Ka thukhamte le ka thupiakte zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sabbath sia ni thiangtho khat hisak vun a, tua hile tuasia in ih vawt thuciamna ii lim khat hi tu hi, tuaciang keima sia Topa na Pathian ka hi hunlam hong phawksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ahihang tua khang kikte zongh in kei hong nalh uh hi. Amate in ka thukhamte paltan a, a zui pawpo nuntakna a pia ka thupiakte a zui bua uh hi. Sabbath niinsak uh hi. Amate sennealngam ah ka thin uuk tutna ka phawksak tu a, thalup siat tu in ka kinging zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Egypt ngam pan Israel mite ka pusuapui hong mu minamte mai ah ka mindai tu ahikom tuabangin ka ngamta bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom sennealngam ah kamciam dang khat ka pia hi. Amate leitung theampo ah thethaang tu in ka kiciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi bang a ka hi sia banghang ziam cile amate in ka thupiakte nial a, ka thukhamte paltan in ka Sabbath niinsak uh hi, tuaciang a taanghpupi te ii biak milimte ma bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang thukham pha ngawlte le nuntakna a piangsak ngawl thupiak te ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A biakpiakna te taw amate ka ninsak a, a tapa upa belte zongh sangaw biakpiakna in ka piasak hi. Hi sia amate daan ka piakna hi a, Keima Topa ka hi hunlam ka lakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang tu in a thithei mihing awng, Israel te munah Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka ci teng son in. Hi sia a taanghpupite ii a thumaan ngawlna taw hong zawnsak vawtna nam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka piak tu a kamciam ka piaksa ngam ah ka paipui hi. Mualsaangte le thingkung hing te a mu uh ciang amate in tuate theampo tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia uh hi. A sangaw meihal biakpiakna le sapittui biakpiakna te in kei hong thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Keima in na zot uh munsaangte bang hi kabel ziam ci in amate ka dongh hi. Tua ahikom tua hun pan kipan ‘Mun Saangte’ kici suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu in Israel mite munah Vaanglianpipa Topa keima ci teng son in: banghangin na taanghpupite mawna vawt teng ma vawt hamtang in a milimte ma dedel tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuni dong ngawngawn in na piak ngei tengma pia in, noma le noma tua milimte taw na tate uh sangaw biakpiakna in nei in, mei sungah na halna uh taw kininsak nu hi. Tuasia zawkciang no Israel mite in kei deina bang ziam ci sia dongh tu in nong pai lalai uh hi! Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa sia, a nungta takpi Pathian ka hikom kei tungah thu bangma hong donghsak nawn ngawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi nam dang te le ngamdang a teang mite taw kibangin thing le suang a bia te bang suak nuam in na thin uh khensat zo nu hi. Ahihang tuabang suak ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa sia a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma, na kidawm vun, ka thin uuk hu in a thahat khut le ka vaangletna theampo taw kong uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na kithethaang na ngam theampo pan kong khoptua kik tak ciang ka thin uukna le ka thahatna kong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Minamte ii Sennealngam’ a kici na ah kong paipui tu a, tua mun na mai ma ah kong ningkhiin tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sinai Sennealngam ah na taanghpupite ka puavawk bangin tu in kong puavawk tu hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Ngat takin no kong uk tu a, ka thuciamna kong zuisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />No sung pan hong langpan theite le mi mawte ka lakeak tu hi. Tu a, a teenna ngam le lei panin amate ka la khia tu a, ahizong Israel ngam ah ka heak kiksak buatu hi. Tuasia ciang Kei, Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Tu in no Israel mite awng, noma lungkim babangin om vun! Na milimte ma bia tan tavun. Ahihang kidawm tavun a, hisia zawkciang ka thu nong nit uh kul tu a, na milim biakpiaknate taw ka min thiangtho na daisak uh kheal tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ngamsung ka mual thiangtho Israel mual saang tungah no Israel mite theampo in kei nong bia tu uh hi. No tungah ka lungkim tu a, tuaciang sangaw biakpiakna a phabelte le a thiangtho letsongte nong paipui tu ka muangmaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Na kithethaang na ngamte panin kong kaikhop zawkciang, na sangaw meihal biakpiaknate kong saang tu a, tuaciang minam tuatuamte in a thiangtho ka hi na hong mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na taanghpupite tungah piak tu in ka ciamsa ngam, Israel ah kong ciapui kik ciang, Keima Topa ka hi hunlam na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a thasiathuai na vawt theampo taw noma le noma bangza in kininsak nu ziam ci sia na phawk kik tu uh hi. Siatna na vawtte theampo hu in noma le noma na kithasiat sua tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A zatak huai ka vaang ka huuk ciangin no Israel te in Kei, Topa ka hi sia na he tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile na seksolna, na ngitlona taw a kiphu in kong vawt bua hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, thangsang en in. Thangsang le thangsang taam ngam siat natu sonkhol in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Thangsang taam ngam tungah Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng a zaak tu in son in: En vun! Keima in kaanghmei khat kipansak khi hi, tuasia in na sungah a om a hing, a ko thingkung theampo kaanghtum tu hi. Bangma in tua kaanghmei sia sumit zo ngawl tu hi. Tua kaanghmei sia thangsang panin saksang dong kizel tu a, mihing theampo in meisa thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amate in keima Topa ii hal hi ci in a mu tu uh a, kuama in a sumit thei buatu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahihang keima in ka nial a, “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, tuabangin kei hong vawtsak heak in! Kei sia a telhak kam soaiheamte veu pau tawntung hi ci in ngual theampo phun zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Jerusalem siatson in. Mihingte biakpiakna munte siatson in. Israel ngam tungah a kidop natu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima, Topa in hi bang ci khi hi: Keima na ngal ka hi hi. Ka namsau ka dok tu a, mipha misia a kibangin na vekpi in kong that siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saksang pan thangsang dong a kuama theampo tungah ka namsau kong zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing theampo in Kei, Topa in ka namsau dok zo ka hina le sot kik nawn ngawl tu ka hi sia hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, na lungtang sia thinngimna taw a tamhtham bangin tau in. Mihing theampo ii hong et thei natu munah khuangaina taw tau in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in banghangin tau ni ziam hong ci ciangin, hong tung tu thu hang hi ci in. Tua thu hong tun tak ciang a mate launa taw kidim tu a, a khutte zaw in a thin letna bo tu a, a khupte liing tu uh hi. A hun hong theng zo hi; tu hun ahi hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, maisang thu tu sonkhol in. Mihingte tungah Kei, Topa ii ci teng va son tan: Namsau khat, namsau khat sia kitaat hiam in kinawtthiang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia kithalup natu in kitaat hiam zo a, khualeng bang a tee vazal tu in kinawtthiang zo hi. Thin lawp natu bangma om thei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile kidop tu sawlna le daan piak natu theampo ka mite in awlmawk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Namsau sia zak tawm thei tu in kinawtthiang zo hi. Mihing that pa khut sungah a ki aap tu in kitaat hiam a, kinawtthiang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thasiatna taw au in, a thithei mihing awng; hi namsau sia keima mite tung le Israel lampuite tungah a kizangh tu ahi hi. A taanglai ka mite theampo taw cipin amate kithatlum tu hi. Thinkiam in na awm beang in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite ka sitna hi, tuaciang amate a kisiik kik bua ahile hite theampo amate tungah tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tu in, a thithei mihing awng, maisang thu tu sonkhol in. Na khutbeang in, tua hile namsau in saat kikik tu hi. Tua namsau sia mihing a that, a lausak le a ngolum namsau ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuasia in ka mite lauthauhsak a lutusak hi. Amate khuapi sia khualeng bangin a tee vazal, a that tu in a kinging namsau khat taw in ka tawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hiam namsau awng, na ziat na vei vaat ngawpin! Na ngatna san pawpo vaat ngawpin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei zongh ka khut ka beang tu a, tuaciang ka thin uuk thai tu hi, Keima, Topa in son zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Babylon kumpipa a namsau taw hong pai thei natu lampi nii teptee sa in koi in. A nii ngealin, ngam khat sung panin kipan khawm tu hi. Lamkaabom ah lamlakna khuam khat phut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khat in Ammon te khuapi Rabbah paina lam hi ci in kumpipa lak tu hi, a dang khat sia in Judah te khuapi, kulh taw a ki uum Jerusalem paina lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa sia lamkaabom lamlakna khuam hui ah ding hi. Koi sia tawn zaw tu ci sia a tel natu in a thaltangte lok a; a milimte dongh hi; a sangaw biakpiakna nganhing ii a thin en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu in! A ziatsang khut in “Jerusalem” ci in a kiciamtee thaltang sia toai hi. Tua aisaanna in, va pai a, thingluangte taw a kithoai natu, ngal thotna aw au tu, thingluangte taw kongpite khaktan natu, kanhte to in kidalna vawt natu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jerusalem mite in hi bang thute a um bua uh hi, banghang ziam cile ngallem thukimnate a vawt uh hang ahi hi. Ahihang hi thu sonkholna sia in a mawnate phawksak tu le a kipummat tu thu a kidop khol natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang hisia in, Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka ci ahi hi: Na mawnate kipholaak zo hi. No bangza a mawnei na hi sia a kuama po in hong he hi. Na ngamtatnate pan na mawna uh kilak hi. No sia ningkhiin sa hi zo na hi uh kom na ngalte khut sungah kong aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nang a seksol a thiangtho ngawl Israel ngam ukpa awng, na ni, a khakbel daan na khak ni sia hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo khi hi. Na kumpilukhu le na dialkhip suut in. Khat zongh a ngei bang hi kik ngawl tu hi. Mizawngte a vaang nei tu in laamto in! A uk uliante khiasuk in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siatna, siatna vive! Hi hi, khuapi sia ka siacipsak tu hi. Ahihang khuapi daan a pia tu in ka teal pa hong pai mateng hi thu a piang buatu hi. Ama tungah tua nasep ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, kam saanna son in. Israel a zawngsak Ammon te tungah Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka ci teng taangko in. Amate munah hi bangin son in: Namsau khat sia a susia tu in kinging zo hi: Khualeng bangin a tee vazal tu, a that tu in kinawt thiang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na mu kholte a theam hi a, na thu sonkholte sia leilot thu hi. Nang sia seksol a ngilo ni hi, tuaciang a khakbel daan na khak ni, na ni sia hong pai tu hi. Na ngawng ah namsau hong ki ngat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“ ‘Namsau a paai sungah thun kik vun! Nang kong bitphuana mun, na pianna ngam ah nang thu kong khen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka thin uukna meikuang leang bangin kong tha ciang note in na phawk tu uh hi. Suksiat zia a thiam mihing cizat nei ngawl te tungah nang kong aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang sia meikuang in hong kaanghlum tu hi. Na chisan sia na ngam sungah kee tu a, kuama in nang hong phawk nawn ngawl tu hi;’ ” Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, mi thatte taw a kidim khuapi sia tungah thukhen tu in na kinging zo ziam? A kiihuai a vawt theampo ama in telthiangsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuapi tungah Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng son in: Na mite tam mama suamlum in nangma le nangma milim biakna taw kininsak na hikom, na hun hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua tual thana te tungtaang ah maw na hikom le na vawt sa milimte taw kininsak na hikom na ni hong pai a, na hun hong cing hi. Tua hu in minamte in kong selnosak a, ngam theampo in kong nunausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nai le a khuala ngamte in thukham na zui ngawl hu in hong nunau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel lampuite theampo in amate thahatna suangin tual a that uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuapi sungah om no mihingte in na nu na pa te na zakta bua uh hi. Ngamdangmite na theam uh a, meingongte le tangate tung pan hamphatna na zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mun thiangtho te na zakta bua uh a, Sabbath na tang bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mite pawlkhat in midangte thi daan a thuak natu in leilot thu a son uh hi. Pawlkhat te in milim biakpiakna sa a ne uh hi. Pawlkhat te sia cii le sa deinate a lungkimsak tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhatte in a pate ii zi taw lumkhawm uh hi. Mihing pawlkhat te in numei te a nin nei laitakin zawthawk thu taw ompui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawlkhatte in palngul mawna vawtin, a dangte in a mote ahibuale a suapuiseal numeite zol uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mite pawlkhat in sum ne in ngual that uh hi. Pawlkhatte sia, a Israel mipuite tungah summeet pukthaak a tua tungtawnin hau uh hi. Amate in kei hong mangil uh hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngual na suamlupna le ngual na sutolna uh tungah ka khuttum kong thasuk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tungah kong vawt tu teng ka man zawkciang na khut uh laamto zo tu in hanna, ahibuale hatna a khom nei lai tu in na ki um uh ziam? Keima, Topa in ka pau zo a, ka pau bangin ka ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na mite ngam sim le minam sim sungah ka thethaang tu a, na ngitlo ngamtatnate ka bosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia ciang minam dangte in no hong nomu tu a, ahihang Keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, Israel te sia kei atu bangma mannung ngawl hi. Amate sia pummei sungah ngunnte a kithiansak zawkciang a taanglai thik eakte — taausan, daan, thik, haak — taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in amate munah, tuasia bangma in man nei ngawl nu hi ka ci hi. Amate theampo Jerusalem ah ka paipui tu a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ngunn, taausan, thik, haak le daan te a kithiansakna pummei sungah a kikoi bangma hi tu hi. Ka thin uukna le ka thinsona in meikuang ii thiklom te a tuithapsak bangma in ka tuithamsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi hi, Jerusalem ah amate ka khawmtua tu a, a nuai uh ah mei thut in ka thin uukna taw ka tuithamsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate sia pummei sungah ngunn a tuithap bangma in, Jerusalem ah ka tuithamsak tu hi, tuasia ciang amate in Topa ii thin uukna a thuak hunlam hong he tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel te munah son in a, a leitang thiangtho ngawl ahikom ka thin uuk a ngim ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A lampuite sia a thalup sa nganhingte a hawk tawpite taw kibang hi. Amate in mihingte that a, a sum le a neisa te a laak thei theampo laaksakin a thalup hu in tam mama meingong suaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thiampite in ka thukham paltan a, a thiangtho na te ciliap ngawl hi. Amate in a thiangtho nate le a thiangtho ngawl nate a khen bua uh hi. Amate in na a thiangthote le a nin kilamdanna hil ngawlin, Sabbath a melsia uh hi. Tua taw kizui in Israel mite in kei hong zakta bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpi zum ulian te sia nganhing a mat sate a laaitham ngia te taw kibang uh hi. A hau natu in amate in mihing that uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihingte in pang sia a kaang taw a zut uh bangin kamsaangte in hi mawnate seal uh hi. Amate in mukholna a maan ngawlte mu a, thuson kholna maan ngawlte veu son uh hi. Amate in Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa kam pau hi hong ci a, ahihang Keima, Topa in amate ka paupui bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sumhaute in ngual theamin suttol uh hi. Amate in a zawngte vawtsia a, ngamdangmite tung pan hamphatna la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima in ka thin uukna taw ka suksiat ciang kulh a vawt zo tu, kulh a cipna munah ding a, amate ngam a hu zo tu khat ka zong hi, ahizong kuama ka mu zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate ii ngamtatna teng hu in ka thin uukna meikuang bangin a tungah ka thaa tu a, ka lalcipsak tu hi,” ci hi. Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, khatvei lai in numei unau nii om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khanmoi lai in Egypt ngam ah ngaknu thiangtho a hina bosua a, pumpi zuakte suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A u zaw ii min sia Oholah (ama sia Samaria taang) hi, tuaciang a nau zaw sia Oholibah (ama sia Jerusalem taang) hi. A nii in ka teenpui a, amate in tate hong hinpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oholah sia keima aa hi napi a pumpi zuak ma seam suakin Assyria pan a lawmpate taw omkhop tu lungngul mama hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate sia puan sandup a kibang a silh ngalkapte, kumpi uliante le za neite hi a; a vekpi in a mealhoi siphu ngalkap bute ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama sia Assyria uliante theampo ii zak pumpi zuak nu hi a, ama ii sikvilna in Assyria milimte a biak dongin ama le ama a kininsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah ngaknu thiangtho a hina bosua a, pumpi zuak khat in a kipat sia zom suak lai hi. A ngaknutno lai pan ma in, pate in luppui a, pumpi zuak khat bangma in a zak sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom a dei mama Assyria a lawmpate tungah ama ka aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a puan suutsakin a pumnguak a koi zawkciang, a tapate le a tanute matsakin ama sia namsau taw thatlum uh hi. Mun theampo ah numeite in tua nu ii thuakna teng nawnsem uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“A suapuinu Oholibah in mu ahihang ama sia Oholah sangin zongh khai zaw a, pumpi zuak hi kaan zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuanu zongh Assyria nampite, min nei za neite — a tee sitset puansilh kibang a silh ngalkapte — siphu ngalkap bute le a mealhoi khangmoite theampo atu in sikvil loklenna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama sia paktat cip a, a nii uh ma, a sia in ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ama sia paktatna sungah a thuksuk vaial in kidia hi. Ama sia Babylon uliante ii limte pang tungah kingelh a, a san sitset dialno khat a kawng ah sawm in, a lu tungah a kizeam dialkhipte in a thin khoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in tua limte a mu po ciang uukna taw kidim a, Babylon ah kamtai te paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babylon te sia ama taw omkhawm tu in hong pai uh hi. Amate in ama nasia zak mama in, niinsak ngawp ahikom a khakbel ciang ama in thasiathuai sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama le ama sia mipi mai ah kipholaak in pumpi zuak nu a hina a kuama theampo in hesak hi. A suapuinu kiihuai ka sak za ma in ama zongh kiihuai ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama sia a khai zaw seseam pumpi zuak khat hong suak a, a ngaknutno lai Egypt ngam ah pumpi zuak ahi bangma in om suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in siphu ahibuale laa tal te lanna taw a kidim pasalte taw omkhop tu lungngul hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />(Oholibah awng, Egypt ngam ah na ngaknutno lai in na paktat nate, pasalte ii na noai hong sawsak a, ngaknut thianthona bosua a na tat bangin na paktat kik nuam hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tu ahile Oholibah awng, hisia Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii nang tungah kong ci teng hi. Tua na lawmpate sia cimtak zo ni hi, ahihang nang tungah amate kong thin uuksak tu a, nang hong kiim uum tu in kong paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Babylon te le Chaldean te theampo, Pekod, Shoa, Koa le Assyria pasalte theampo kong paipui tu hi. Tua mealhoi namlian khangnote le zaliante, a thupi ulian theampo le a zalian siphu ngalkap bute kong khawmtua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in siphu ngalleang le vanh puakna leangte kengin ngalkaphonpi khat taw saksang pan hong sim tu uh hi. Lum le thik lukhu taw kidalin nang hong kiim uum tu hi. Nang sia amate tungah kong aap tu a, amate ii thukham te taw thu hong khen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang tungah thin uuk ka hikom amate zongh a thin uukna taw diangsak tu khi hi. Na naak le na bilte hong at tansak tu a, na tate hong thalupsak tu hi. Hi hi, na tapate na tanute na kung pan la in a hingtangin hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na puansilh lai hong laaikeaksak tu a, na suangmanphate hong laaksak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah na om lai pan kipan na sikvil na loklenna te le a maizumhuai na ngamtatnate kong khealsak tu hi. Milimte na en nawn buatu a, Egypt ngam na lungngul nawn buatu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hisia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi: “Na ngaimawk le kiihuai na sak mite khut sungah nang kong aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in nang hong ensan ahikom, na thalaw sa theampo hong laaksak tu a, tuaciang na puan hong suutsakin pumpi zuak khat bangin hong pholaak tu hi. Na sikvilna le na pumpi zuakna in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />hi teng na tungah hong tungsak hi. Nang sia ngam tuatuam te a tu pumpi zuak na hi a, milimte taw nangma le nangma na kininsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na suapuinu ii khuani teng ma zui na hikom, daan piakna hai a kibangin kong dawnsak tu hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Na suapuinu hai panin na dawn tu hi; tua hai sia lian in thuk hi. Mihing theampo in hong maisiat in, hong nunau tu hi; tua hai sia dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nang hong lungmangsak tu a, hong luvaisak tu hi. Tua kiitakna le lalna hai sia na suapuinu Samaria ii hai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na dawn tu a na dawnkang tu hi, tua hai tamhbekte taw na noai na at tu hi. Vaanglianpipa Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tu in hisia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi: “Kei hong mangil in hong nungngat na hi ciang na sikvilna le na pumpi zuakna hu in ngim na thuak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, Oholah le Oholibah tungah thukhen tu in na kinging ziam? A kiihuai a ngamtatna te taw amate mawsiat in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in palngul mawna le mihing thana vawt zo hi — palngul mawna sia milimte taw vawt a, kei a tu a hin tapate thatlum hi. Ka tapate milim biakpiakna in hong neisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua teng bek vawt ngawl hi. Ka Biakinnpi ninsakin, ka piansak sa Sabbath sia paltan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka tate milim biakpiakna in a thalup ni mama in ka Biakinnpi ah hong pai in ninsak uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Amate in ngam khualana ah a om pasalte tungah kamtaite pehialin paisak kikikin samsak uh a, amate hong pai tek hi. Unau numeite nii in kibual in mitkhu vom za kinoai in suangmanphate taw kizeam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate tokhum hoi khat tungah to in, a mai ah sabuai khat dim a koi naphate sungah ngimnamtui le olive thau ka piakte zongh koikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sennealngam panin hong kipaipui pasal honkhat ahi bangma thinngimna a nei ngawl mihon khat ii aw kiza thei hi. Amate in numeite ii baan ah haak bulsakin a lu tungah a hoi kumpi lukhute a khusak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Keima le keima ka kici na ah, palngul mawna taw a tul sa numei khat sia pumpi zuak te bangin zangh hi ta a, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amate in hi pumpi zuakte kungah pai kikik uh hi. Amate in tua a paktat Oholah le Oholibah te kung zuan kikik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mihing thutang te in amate sia palngul mawna le mihing thana vawt nu hi ci in a ningkhiin tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile palngul mawna vawt in a khut uh chisan baang hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hisia in Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi: “A lausak tu le a suttol tu in a ngilo nuam honkhat hong paipui tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua mi ngilote in suang taw deang tahen a, a namsaute taw simin a tate thalupsakin, a innte haltumsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amate paktat ngamtat bang palngul mawna vawt ngawlin numei a minpiang ii a kidop thei natu in ngamsung teng ah paktat nate ka khealsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaciang no unau numei niite — noma paktatna le milim biakna mawnate hu in daan kong pia tu hi. Tuasia ciang Keima sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sal ka tan zawk a kum kua kum, tha sawm le ni sawm ni in Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, tuni sia bang ni ziam ci sia at in, banghang ziam cile tuni sia Babylon kumpipa ii Jerusalem khua uumci tu a kipat ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hong langpan ka mite munah Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii amate atu ka sonteena sia va son tan: Mei tungah beal suang vun a tua ii sungah tui dimh vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sabak a phabel teng thasuk vun — saliangte le sapheite — a ngu limci belte zongh beal dim thasuk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A phabel tuute ii sa zangh vun; beal nuai ah thing thut vun. Tui sosak vun; a ngu le a sate sosak vun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hisia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci nop teng hi: “Mihing thatte ii khuapi sia a lal ahi hi! Ama sia a kinawt ngeingawl beal kaangh kheangh taw kibang hi. Sate bak khat zawkciang bak khat kithuuk a, khat zongh kikhe ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuapi sungah mihing kithat hi, ahihang chisan sia leivui ii seal thei natu lei ah keesak ngawl hi. Chisan sia suang nguak tungah keesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabang a kiseal thei ngawlna munah chisan ka nusia zo a, tua in thin uuk phulaak natu suaksak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hisia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi: “Mihing thatte ii khuapi sia a lal ahi hi! Keima mama in thingkangte ka sia to tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thingkang a tamzaw lai hong paipui tavun! Mei zaap vun! A sa huan vun! Satui so kangsak vun! A ngute kaanghthamsak vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu in taau bealhawm sia a san dongin meikam tungah suang vun. Tua hile a kheangh teng kaanghin, a kok zawkciang beal sia a ngeina bang thiang kik tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ahizong tua kheangh theampo meikuang sungah bo tuan ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem awng paktat ngamtatnate in nang hong niinsak zo hi. Thiansua tu in kong hanciam hangin na nin veve lai hi. Ka thin uukna a cingin na thuak mateng na thiangtho kik buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in ka son zo hi. Ka dian tu hun hong theng zo hi. Na maw na khialnate ka koithong buatu hi, ahibuale hesuakna ahizong, mulkimna ahizong kong nei buatu hi. Na ngamtatna sa tungah nang sia daan hong kipia tu hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, mihing na itbel khat sia thakhat thu in ka la tu hi. Phun thei ngawl tu, kap thei ngawl tu, thitui zongh taaksak thei ngawl tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Naang in na om hunlam kuama in zasak heak in. Khuangaina lim na lakna in lukhu khu ngawl, peangnguakin vak heak in. Na maitang seal heak in a, a khuangaite neak ante ne heak in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zing tuungin mite taw thu ka son hi. Tua nitakin ka zi hong thi a, a khuavak ni ciang hong sonsa bangin ka ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite in, “Banghang hi bangin ngamta ni ziam hong ci hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom, amate tungah, “ Topa in hong paupui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />no Israel te tungah hi kam vaithak son tu in hong sawl hi: Note in Biakinnpi ii a kip a khona sia kiphatsak pui nu hi. Mu nuamin a en tu na pai uh hi, ahizong, Topa in Biakinnpi sia minpaansak tu hi. Tuaciang Jerusalem ah na nusiat na innkuanpui khangmoite ngal sungah kithat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia ciang keima ngamtat sa bangma in na ngamta tu uh hi. Na maitang uh seal ngawlin, a khuangaite ii anneakte na ne buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lukhu khu ngawl ahibuale peangnguakin vak heak vun a, khuangai ahibuale kapin om heak vun. Na mawnate hu in na hingkiam tu a, na tau hon tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kei sia no atu lim lakna khat kong hi tu a; keima ngamtat babangin na ngamta tu uh hi. Topa in hite hong pian ciangin ama sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ahi hunlam he tu nu hi, hong ci hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in, “Tu in a thithei mihing awng, amate kisak thei pui, a lungdamna ahi, a et nop le a haw nop, a kho Biakinnpi sia, ka lakeak tu hi. Tuaciang, a tapate le a tanute ka laaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi bangin ka vawt ni in, lalna sung pan a suakta khat po hong pai in, thupiangte nang hong ko tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ni in na taan sa kampau theina vaang sia na nga kik tu a, ama taw thu na son tu uh hi. Hi bangin nang sia mihingte atu lim khat na hi tu a, amate in keima sia Topa ka hi hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Ammon ngam sonsia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng hong ngai natu in va son tan: Ka Biakinnpi minpaan a na mu tu, Israel ngam a lalthapna na mu tu le Judah mite sal in a pai na mu tu lawp nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabangin lawp na hi uh kom, nisuana sennealngam pan minamte in kong zothalsak tu hi. Amate in na ngam sungah ngiaphual hong saat tu a, tua munah teang tu uh hi. Noma neak tu noai le thingngate a ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rabbah khuapi sia kalaoh khoaina mun ka suaksak tu a, Ammon ngam bup sia tuu khoaina mun ka suaksak tu hi, tuasia ciang Keima, Topa ka hi sia nong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi: “Na khut beangin, lungdam in na kilawn uh hi. Israel ngam na zawngsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuabang na hi hu in minam dangte tungah kong aap tu a, amate in hong suttol in, hong phuulsak tu uh hi. Kong sucip tu a, ngam khat in na ding kik zo nawn buatu a, noma ngam na ci tu uh a om nawn buatu hi. Tuasia ciang Keima, Topa ka hi sia nong he tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Moab in Judah sia minam dangte theampo taw kibang hi a ci hu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab ii ngamngi a cing khuapite ngual in ka simsak tu a, khuapi phabel teng — Beth Jeshimoth, Baal Meon le Kiriathaim te ngawngawn kihel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nisuana sennealngam minamte in Moab le Ammon te ka zothalsak tu hi, tuasia ciang Moab sia ngam khatin ding zo nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab daan ka pia tu a, amate in Keima, Topa ka hi sia hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Edom mite in Judah tungah a tatkha phulamna nei a, tua phulamna in Edom tungah a kiphel thei ngawl mawna then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in ka taangko na ah Edom daan ka pia tu a, tua munah mihing le nganhing theampo ka that tu hi. Teman khuapi pan Dedan khuapi dong lei awng thong ka suaksak tu a, a mite ngal sungah kithatlum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel ka mite in kei atu in Edom tungah phulam tu a, tuaciang Edom sia ka thin uuk ka thinsona a phawksak tu uh hi. Kei ii phulamna a thuakte bangbang ziam ci sia Edom in he tu hi,” ci hi. Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Philistine te in a taangh ngalte tungah tatsia takin phula a, ngaimawkna taw susia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom Philistine ka sim tu a ka maaimot tu hi, ci in ka taangko hi. Philistine Zaangtam ah a nungta lai theampo ka lalcipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate nasia takin daan ka pia tu a, a kicing phulamna ka nei tu hi. Amate in ka thin uukna phawk tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang Keima, Topa ka hi sia he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sal ka tan zawk a kum sawm le kum khat kum, a ni khat ni in Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Tyre khuapi sungah a teang mite ii a lungdamin a au ngawpna thu in hisia hi. ‘Jerusalem kisaat tham zo hi! A sum vawt thahatna teng bo zo hi! Ama in ei kidempui hi nawn ngawl tu hi!’ ci in amate au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tua ahile tu in hisia Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka pauna ahi hi: Tyre khuapi awng, keima in na ngal ka hi hi. Nang hong sim tu minam tam mama kong kuansak tu a, tuaciangin amate tuihualte bangin hong pai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in na khuapi kulh luphungte siasak tu uh a, na tausaangte sia nuaitham tu uh hi. Tua zawkciang a leivui teng ka phiatkeak tu a, suangpi khat nguak bek ka nusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi sungah a dok tua suangpi sia tungah ngasa paaite in a ngeen uh a pho tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo khi hi. Minamte in Tyre khuapi suttol tu uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuaciang a namsau uh taw a ngam sungah a om khuate sungah a teang mite thatlum tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang Tyre in Topa ka hi sia hong he tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Kumpi theampo sung pan a lianbel kumpi — Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar — sia Tyre khua sim tu in kong kuansak tu hi. Ama in saksang panin ngalkap honpui khat taw siphu le siphu ngalleangte le siphu ngalkapte taw hong kuan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngam sungah a om khuate sungah a teangte ngal kidona sungah kithatlum tu uh hi. Ngalte in kanhte to in, phungciang in, kidal natu pangbitte vawt a, nang hong do, hong nang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in na kidalna kulhte sia sukthapna moltumte taw suu in na ngal vilna tausaangte thikpumte taw vaattan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A siphute ii peang pan a leang leivui khu in nang hong tuam tu hi. Siphu leangte le siphu ngalleangte paina a nging sia in a lalsa khuapi kongpite a kaantan ciang, note luphung liingsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A siphu ngalkapte in na lampite zui in hong nawk a, a namsau uh taw na mite that tu uh hi. Na khuam lianpite lei ah puksak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ngalte in noma hauna uh le na sumbuk vanh zuakte tang tu uh hi. Noma luphungte cimhthamsak in, innnuamte hong saat thapsak tu uh hi. Amate in a thing a suangte le suangsi theampo la in, tuipi sungah sung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lasak uhte ka tawlngasak tu a, na tum uh tengtongh music awte ka thimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngasa paaite ii ngeen a pho thei natu in suangpi khat bek kong nusiat tu hi. Khuapi sia kisa kik ngeingawl tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in Tyre tungah, hi bang teng ci nop nei hi: “No hong kizawthal ciang, tuipi vaalbo ah a teang mihingte in a kithatte ii ciik auna aw a zaak uh ciang lau vadil tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipi tungah a vak a cia minamte ii kumpi theampo in kumpi tokhum panin tuak tu uh hi. Amate in a puantual te le a kizepna puansilhte suutin, lei ah liingin to tu uh hi. Noma ii thuakna hu in a liinna thim thei ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in hi mithi vui la sia nang hong sak tu uh hi: Khuapi minthang sia kilalcipsak zo hi! A teambawte tuipi panin bocip zo hi. Hi khuapi ah a teang mite in tuipite uk hi, tuaciang tuipi vaalbo ah a teang theampo lausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu in ama ii bo ni in, Tuikulhte liing a, Tuaciang a mite in tuabang lalcip na a mu uh ciangin ingh uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi: “Nang sia kuama teen ngawlna khuapi lalcip sa te bang kong suaksak tu hi. Tuipi thukte in nang kong khuumsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mithi khua ah taanghlai a nungta mihingte kung kong puak tu hi. Tua leinuai ngam, tawntung siatna munah mithite taw kithawl tu in kong koi tu hi. Tua zawk nungsang in na sungah hong kiteang kik nawn ngawl tu a, a nungtate ngam sungah om mun na la buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A lauhuai mama ettee tu kong suaksak tu a, tua in na bocip natu hi tu hi. Mihingte in nang hong zong tu a, ahihang nang hong kimu ngeingawl tu hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, Tyre atu in mithi vuina la khat sa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua khuapi sia tuipi kiil ah kiphutin, tuipi vaal dung theampo ah a teang mihingte taw sum a vawt hi. Hi khuapi munah Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng son in: “Tyre awng, a kicing na meal phatna kisuangtaak ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na inn sia tuipi hi. Nang hong sate in teambaw hoi khat bangin hong sa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in Hermon Mual pan mangtaakthingte innthing tu in zangh hi. Tuaciang na teambaw laandial mung tu in, lamziikpi Lebanon panin Cedar thing zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in Bashan pan oak thingkungte ngunkuang haw natu in la uh hi; Na teambaw suat sia Cyprus pan a laak taakthing taw vawt a Tuaciang saiha taw zeam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na teambaw puankhak uh sia puanneal taw kivawt hi, Egypt pan a kitak a kingelh puan hi. A khuala na panin ol takin kitel thei paih hi. Na tuipuante sia puan phabel taw kivawt a, Cyprus tuikulh pan puan sandupte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ngunkuang hotte sia Sidon le Arvad khuapite pan ahi uh hi. Na teambaw naseamte sia noma mihing a thiambelte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Teambaw lettamate sia Byblos pan a kisinsak a thiam sate veu ahi uh hi. Tuipi tung a pai teambaw theampo ii teambaw naseamte sia, na sumbukte sungah vanh lei vanh zuakte veu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Persia, Lydia le Libya pan ngalkapte sia na ngalkaphonpi sungah hong seam uh hi. Amate in a lumte le a thik lukhute sia na ngalkap innte sungah khai uh hi. Amate sia na minthanna hong ngasakte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Arvad pan ngalkapte in na luphungte hong cinsak a, Gamad mite in na ngalvilna tausaangte hong cinsak hi. Amate ii lumte na luphung tungah khai uh hi. Amate in nang hong et hoi sakte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Spain ngam ah sum na vawt a, ngunn, thik, daan le haakte la in, vanh tam mamate thena in na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Greece, Tubal le Meshech ah sum na vawt a, na vanh zuakte sia silate le taau vanhte thena in na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth Togarmah panin Siphu, ngalsimna siphu le laate lei natu in na vanhte na zuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rhodes mite in nang taw sum vawt hi; tuipi hui ah a teang mihing tam mamate in saiha le na vanhte ebony thingvomte taw hong theak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Syria mite in na vanh zuakte le na vawtsa na tampite hong lei uh hi. Amate in emerald suang eng, puan sandup, paak kingelh puan, puanneal pha, tuipi muanpaak le ruby suangsante sia vanh manphate leina in hong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah le Israel mite in vanh leina in zungtaang, khuaitui, olive thau le hel namtuite hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Damascus mite in na vanh zuakte le na vawtsa nate hong leina in, Helbon pan sapittui le Sahar pan tuumulte hong pia hi. Amate in a kihuansa thik le hel namtuite taw na vanhte hong theak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dedan mihingte zongh in na vanhte sia siphukungh puandap hamte taw hong theak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arabia te le Kedar ngamukte in na vanh zuakte sia tuuno, tuu le kealte taw hong theak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sheba le Raamah pan sumvawtte in na vanhte sia suangmanpha, khamh le hel namtui phabelte taw hong theak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Haran khuapite ahi Canneh le Eden, Sheba sumvawtte, Asshur le Chilmad khuapite — tua teng theampo nang taw vanh zuak vanh lei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in puan hoi manhamte, puan sandupte, paak kingelh puante le a pawl iim-iam dappha puante le pha tak a kivawt khauhualte le khauzeente hong zuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na vanh zuakte sia vanh puakna teambaw lianbel honte taw kipua hi. Nang sia tuipi tungah a pai, vanh ngit a kiheang teambaw taw na kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na ngunkuang hotte in tuipi hong zotpui ciang, nisuana sang vuipi in lei taw kikhuala na ah hong lalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sumbuk vanh na neite theampo, teambaw sungah na seppui naseamte theampo, Na teambaw lettamate le sumvawtte, teambaw tungah ngalkapte theampo — tuipi sungah na teambaw a lal ciangin, a vekpi bo siat mang siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuitaa teambaw naseamte ii auna aw sia vaalbo tungah hawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Teambaw theampo, tu in kinusia hi. tuaciang teambaw naseam theampo, vaalbo tungah kaato zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in nasia tak khuangai in, nang atu mau uh hi. a lu tungah leivui kithe in, vuttun sungah kilumliik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nang atu in amate a lu uh meettol a, khau-ip puan silh uh hi. Amate kapin a thin na sa mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in nang atu mithi vuina la khat hong sak hi: ‘Tuipi sungah tu in a thimcip Tyre taw akua teengat thei tu hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuipi ngal ah na sumbuk vanhte a pai ciang, nang in minam theampo ii kitaangsapte na kicingsak hi. Sumbuk vanh na hauna taw kumpipate na hausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tu in nang tuipi sungah lalcip zo ni hi; Tuipi liante ii taw a thukna ah a taak na hi zo hi. Na vanhte le nang atu na a seam theampo nang taw tuipi sungah na bo siat zo uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Tuipivaalbo ah a teang theampo in na thuakna hu in liinglawng uh hi. A kumpipate ngawngawn lau in a maitang uh ah a launa lim kilak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nang sia a tawntungin, a mangthang na hi hi. Tuaciang leitung theampo ah sumvawtte patau siat a, nang thuakna bang a thuak thaak tu lau uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Tyre khua ukpa tungah Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka ci teng son in: Kiphatsakna taw kidimin, pathian khat ka hi na ci hi. Tuipite kiim uum kumpi tokhum tungah pathian khat bangin ka to hi, na ci hi. Nang sia pathian khat bangin kiheang hikale te, tuabang hi ngawl ni hi, thithei ni hi, pathian pianzia na nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma sia Daniel sangin ciim zaw kisa ni hi, tuaciang nang heak zawk ngawl tu in thuku om thei ngawl tu in na um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ciimna le na thiamnate in khamh le ngunnte taw hong hausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma in sumvawt thiamnate taw summeet na vawt tan hi. Na hauna suangin bangza in kiphasak ni ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang tu in hi sia, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka ci ahi hi: pathian khat bangin ciim kisa na hikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />cizat a nei ngawl ngalte kong paisak tu a, kong simsak tu hi. Na ciimna le na thiamna taw na kholsa na pha theampo amate in susia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in nang hong thatlum in, tui taw kidim thaan ah hong puak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in nang thatlum tu in hong kuan ciangin pathian khat ka hi na ci ngam lai tu ziam? Hong thatlum tute na maingat ciang, nang sia a thithei na hi tu a, pathianzia a nei na hi bua het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian sel ngamdangmite khut sa taw ui thi in na thi tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in thupia zo khi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Tyre kumpipa tungah a tung tu a seesa thuaknate atu in khuangai in. Ama munah Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng son in: Khatvei lai in nang sia kicinna ii ettee pa na hi hi. Bangza in ciim in na mealpha ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian huan Eden ah na teang a, suang manpha namcin: ruby le diamond; topaz, beryl, carnelian le jasper; sapphire, emerald le garnet suangte taw na kizeam hi. Nang in khamh kizepna te na nei hi. Nang hong kibitphua ni in tuate sia nangma atu in a kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua munah nang hong cing tu in, a kiitakhuai vantunglalang khat ka koi hi. Ka mual thiangtho tungah na teang a, suangmanpha tee vakil te kawm ah na vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na ngamtatna sia nang hong bitphua ni pan kipan, a sia vawt tu na kipat dong paubanna a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang in vanh lei vanh zuakna taw na komla a, hite in ngoltol ngamtatna le mawna sung hong then hi. Tua ahikom ka mual thiangtho kong nusaisak a, vantunglalang, nang hong cing pa in suangmanpha tee vakil kawm pan nang hong not keak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na mealphat hu in na kiphasak a, tuaciang na minthanna in a mawmaw khat bangin hong diangsak hi. Hisia hu in nang sia lei denna in kong nei a, kumpi dangte kidop natu in kong nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vanh zuak vanh leina ah tua bang a sia na vawt hu in, na biakpiakna munte sia na siatsua hi. Tua ahikom tua khuapi sia a kaanghtum tu in ka hal hi. Nang hong ente theampo in tu in, vut le vai na sua hong mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang sia a tawntung bo in mangthang ni hi, tuaciang nang hong he ngei minamte theampo sia patau siat a, nang thuak sia bang a thuak lei tu lau uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, Sidon khuapi sia sonsia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate huvau, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng va son tan: Keima in na ngal ka hi hi, Sidon awng; nang tungah kong vawtte hu in mihingte in kei hong pok tu uh hi. Na sungah a teangte daan pia a, kei bangza in thiangtho ka hi sia ka lak ciang, amate in Keima, Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang tungah natnate kong tungsak tu a, na lampi te ah chi ka luangsak tu hi. Mun theampo panin nang, hong kisim tu a, na mite kithatlum tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang Keima, Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel te nunau a, a zawnsak vawt kiim le paam ah minamte sia Israel te a na sak tu ling le lingkung te taw a kibang kik nawn buatu uh hi. Tuaciang amate in kei sia Vaanglianpipa Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Israel mite ka thethaang na ngamte panin ka ciapui kik tu a, tuaciang minamte theampo in Keima sia, a thiangtho ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi. Ka naseampa Jacob tungah ka piak ngam ahi amate ii ngam ma ah Israel mite teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua munah amate sia ngam muangin teang tu uh hi. Amate in inn sa in sapithuan vawt tu uh hi. Amate a zawnsak vawt a ngampaamte theampo sia daan ka pia tu a, Israel te sia ngam muangin om tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang amate in, Kei sia Topa, a Pathian ka hi sia hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sal ka tan zawk uh kum sawm kum, tha sawm le ni sawm le ni nii, ni in Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Egypt kumpipa sonsia in. Ama le Egypt ngam leitang theampo daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi thu Vaanglianpipa Topa ii Egypt kumpipa tungah a ci ahi hi: Ngun sungah a om awle pui awng, kei sia nangma ii ngal ka hi hi. Nile ngun sia nangma vawt sa hi a, nangma neisa hi na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kha ngu pailetin, thikkoai taw kong sun tu a, na ngun sungah a om ngasate nangma tungah kong belcipsak tu hi. Tua zawkciang na tungah hong bel ngasa theampo taw Nile ngun sung pan kong kaito tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sennealngam sungah tua ngasa theampo taw kong vawk khawm tu hi. Na luang sia lei ah kisial tu a, kiphum ngawlin kinusia tu hi. Vacimte le nganhingte an tu in na luang ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Egypt mite theampo in Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi. Topa in, “Israel te in no Egypt mite sia amate a hu tu in hong suang hi; ahihang note in ciangkang tak ngawl khat sangin na phazaw bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in nang hong neal ciang na taltan tu a, a lenuai sunlet in, a cingzaang na kithiaksak hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu in, Kei, Vaanglianpipa Topa in kong son a, namsau taw no kong simsak tu a, na mite le na nganhingte hong thalupsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt ngam sia a kolh ngamtongta suak tu hi. Tuasia ciang, Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi. “Nile ngun sia nangma vawt sa nangma neisa ci na hikom in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />keima in nang le na Nile ii ngalpa ka hi hi. Egypt ngam theampo saksang Migdol khuapi pan kipan thangsang Aswan khuapi ah, Ethiopia ngamngi dongin, ngamtongta ka suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing ahizong, nganhing ahizong, tua ngam kaantan in pai ngawl tu hi. Kum sawmli sung tua ngam ah kuama teang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Egypt ngam sia a kinusia cip, leitung bup a ngamkhing belin ka vawt tu hi. Kum sawmli sung Egypt ngam khuapite sia khuapi dang pawpo sangin a lalcip zaw suak tu hi. Egypt mite ngaltaite ka suaksak tu hi. Amate ngam theampo ah tai in midangte kawm ah teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Kum sawmli zawkciang Egypt mite ka thethaang na minamte kung panin ka kaikhawm kik tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Egypt ngam thang sang, amate ten cilna munah ka teangsak tu hi. Tua munah amate sia kumpi thazawm ngam khat hi tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kumpi ngam theampo sung pan a thazawmbel suak tu hi, amate in minam dangte uk kik ngei nawn ngawl tu uh hi. Ngam thupi ngawl mama in vawt tu ka hikom minam dang kuama zongh amate dei bangin zuisak zo ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel in Egypt sia suan le muan in nei kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi. Egypt ii thuakna in amate a suan a muan sia khial ahi hunlam, Israel a phawksak tu hi. Tuasia ciang Israel in Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ka hi hunlam hong phawk tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sal ih tan zawk kum kul le kum sali na, a tha masabel, ni khat ni in Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Tyre khua sim hi. A ngalkapte vanh ngit leilam a puaksak hu in, a sam uh zuukin a lutol a, a liangkote kokkeak hi, ahihang tua ngimna thaman a kumpipa le a ngalkapte in bangma leaplaw a nei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci khi hi: Egypt ngam leitang Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa pia khi hi. Ama in Egypt hauna theampo suttol in laaksak tu a, a ngalkaphonpi thasum tu in ciapui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Egypt ngam sia ama ii sepna thaman in ka pia hi; banghang ziam cile, a ngalkaphonpi in kei atu seam hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tua thu hong pian ciang Israel mite ka thahatsak tu hi, Ezekiel awng, ngual theampo ii hong zaak thei natu mun panin thu kong sonsak tu a, tuasia ciang keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in keima hong paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, kamsaang in a, Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng taangko in. Hi kammalte au in son in: A lauhuai ni hong tung tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ni hong nai zo hi, Topa ii a dian tu ni hong nai zo hi. Minamte atu in meeikaai ni le ngimna ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah ngal om tu a, Ethiopia ngam ah thinngimna lianpi om tu hi. Egypt ah om mite tam mama kithatlum tu hi: A ngam kisuttol in, A lal in kinusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tua ngal in Ethiopia, Lydia, Libya, Arabia, Kub ngamte pan a kicial ngalkapte, tuaciang, ka mite sung pan ngawngawnin a that tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in, “Saksang Migdol khua pan thangsang Aswan khua dong, Egypt ngam a huute theampo ngal sungah kithatlum tu hi. A kiphasak Egypt ngalkaphonpi kilalcipsak tu hi, Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ngam sia leitung ah a ngamtongtabel suak tu a, a khuapite theampo a lalcip sa in kinusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt mei taw ka hal a, ngam huute theampo a kithalup ciang, amate in keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua ni hong thengin Egypt ngam a siat ciang in, bangma khua phawk ngawlin a om Ethiopia mite a phawng tu in thupuakte teambaw taw ka paisak tu hi, amate sia liinglawngin lau mama tu uh hi. Tua ni hong theng tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar zanghin Egypt ii hauna ka bosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama le cizat nei ngawl a ngalkaphonpi sia, ngam susia tu in hong pai tu hi. Amate in namsau taw Egypt sim tu a, tua ngam sia mithiluang taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nile nguntui ka kangsak tu a, mi ngilote khutnuai ah Egypt ka koi tu hi. Ngamdangmite in tua ngam bup susia tu hi. Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Memphis ah a om milimte le pathian maan ngawl te ka susia tu hi. Egypt a uk tu kuama a om nawn buatu a, mihing theampo ka lausak vadil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Egypt thangsang teng ngamtongta ka suaksak tu a, saksang Zoan khuapi mei taw ka hal tu hi. Thebes khuapi daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt ii a kulh lian Pelusium khuapi in ka thin uukna ka he sak tu hi. Thebes ii nei le lamh teng ka siasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Egypt meitaw ka hal tu a, tua ciang Pelusium sia ngimna nasia thuak tu hi. Thebes luphung te kisiatham tu a, tua khuapi ah namthuam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heliopolis khuapi le Bubastis khuapi tangvalte ngal sungah thi tu a, a dang teng thongtaak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate ii kiphatsakpui Egypt vaangletna le thahatna ka bosak ciang, Tahpanhes khuapi sia khuazing tu hi. Meeikaai khat in Egypt tuam tu hi, tua ciang a khuapi teng theampo sungah mite thongtaak siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Egypt sia hi bangin daan ka piak ciang, amate in Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sal a ih om zawk kum sawm le kum khat na a tha masabel, ni sali ni in Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Egypt kumpipa khut ka thiaktan zo hi. A khut dam kik a, namsau a toai kik zawk natu in kuama in a khut tuamsak ngawlin, puan taw zong kuasak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu in hi sia Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci ahi hi: Egypt kumpipa ngal ka hi hi. A khutte ngeal — a dam lai sia le a talsa sia — ka thiatansak tu a, a khut sung pan namsau hong taak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Egypt te leitung mun theampo ah ka thethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Babylon kumpipa ii khut a tha ka hatsak tu a, ka namsau a khut sungah ka koi tu hi. Ahihang Egypt kumpipa khut ka thiaktan tu a, a ngalte mai ah tau in a thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi hi, ama ii tha ka kiamsak tu a, Babylon kumpipa ka thahatsak tu hi. Ka namsau ama ka pia a, ama in Egypt ngam sang a ngat tak ciang ngual theampo in Topa ka hi hunlam he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Egypt te leitung mun theampo ah ka thethaang tu hi. Tuasia hun ciang, Topa ka hi hunlam amate in hong he tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sal ih tan zawk kum sawm le kum khatna, a tha thum zawk ni masabel ni in Topa in keima hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Egypt kumpipa tung le a mite theampo tungah hi bangin son in: Bangza in thahat ni ziam! Nang bang taw hong teengat thei tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lebanon ngam a cedar thingkung taw na kibang hi. Tua thingkung ii baakte hoi a, a teete boai hi, Saang mama in van ah meeite banto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khangtosak tu tui om a, Tui a pia tu leinuai ngunte om hi. Tuate in a pona munah tui buak a, Duisung thing pona theampo ah luite puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui kham ahikom, thingkung dangte sangin saang zaw hi. A baakte ziing in sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vacim namcin in a baakte tungah a bute vawt uh hi; A lim nuai ah ngamsate in no nei uh hi; Leitung minamte in a lim bealhin tawlnga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangza ta in tua thingkung etlawm ziam — A kung saang mama in tuabang baak saute nei hi. A zungte in a thukna a, a luang tuite bansuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian huan sungah a om cedar thingkung taw kitee ngat thei ngawl hi. Tuabangin baak a nei taakthing om ngeingawl hi. Tuaciang tua bang a meang pha a nei thing ngil om ngawl hi. Pathian ii neisa huan sungah a hoi zaw dang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A et hoi tu in keima in a baakte ka zaamsak hi. Pathian ii huan Eden ah om thingkungte theampo ii du ngawk ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tu in Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in van ah meei a banto dongin a saang, tua thingkung tungah bang piang tu ziam kong son tu hi. Saangto vaial in khangto a, kiphasak vaial hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua ahikom, ama ka nial zo a, ngamdang kumpi khat in ka tangsak tu hi. Ama in a ngitlona taw kiphu in tua thingkung tungah vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cizat nei ngawl ngamdangmite in phuk in nusia tu hi. A baakte le a zikpi taltante sia ngamsung mual tung le kuam theampo ah taak tu hi. A lim nuai a bealh ngei minam theampo in paisan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vacimte tua a puksa thingkung tungah hong to tu a, ngamsate in a baakte tung tawn tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom, tu pan kipan bangza po in tui kham hikale thingkung khat zongh, tua tan a saang mama in khangto ngawl tu a, van ah meei kaanto in a dokto kik nawn buatu hi. A thithei mihingte bangin lalin thi siat tu a, mithi khua a zuansukte taw tonkhawm tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi sia in Vaanglianpipa Topa ci ahi hi: “Mithite khua ah tua thingkung a zot ciangin, heena lim lakna in leinuai tuite in ka tuamsak tu hi, Ngunte khak in luite tam ma ka luangsak nawn buatu hi. Thingkung thi zo ahikom Lebanon mualte tungah khua ka zingsak tu a, tua duisung ah a po thingkungte theampo ka vulsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mithi khua ah ka puaksuk ciang tua thingkung puksuk nging sia in minamte liingsak tu hi. Eden huan thingkung theampo le leinuai a theng sa tui pha tak a kibuak Lebanon thingkung deiteal theampo in ama ii puksuk hangin a lungdam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate sia mithi khua a zuan sate kungah ama taw paikhawm tu uh hi. Tuaciang tuasia ii limh nuai bealhin a nungta theampo minamte sungah kithethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua thingkung sia Egypt kumpipa le a ngammite theampo ahi hi. Eden huan sung thingkung ngawngawn amate bangin saangin thupisakhuai ngawl hi. Ahihang tu in Eden huan thingkungte bangma in mithi khua ah paisuk tu a, ngalsung a thite le Pathianzia a hi ngawlte taw omkhawm tu uh hi. Keima ka pau zo hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ih sal tan zawk kum sawm le kum nii kum, tha sawm le tha nii, a ni masabel ni in Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Egypt kumpipa tungah hi bangin a ciliap huai kidop natu thupia in. Keima thupuak sia son in: Minamte sungah tawpi khat bangin na diang a, ahizong nang sia ngun sungah a kipeak awle khat taw na kibang zaw hi. Na peangte taw tui na nusak ngawp a, ngunte na ninsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minam tam ma hong kikhop uh ciang, ka ngeen taw kong paai tu a, tua ngeen sia amate in vaalbo ah ka kaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lei ah nang kong vawk tu a, leitung vacimte le nganhingte theampo sia na sa ne tu in ka kaikhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mualte le zaangkuamte a muat sa na luang taw ka dimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mualte tungah kizel in luamte a dim dong na chisan ka buasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang kong lalsak ciang, van ka seal tu a, aksi te ka mitsak tu hi. Ni sia meei in ka liasak tu a, tha taang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantung ah khuavak taang theampo ka sumit tu a, na leitung sia khua ka zingsak ek tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in ka son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na zaak ngeingawl ngamte tungtawnin, na lalcip na thu ka thansak ciang, minam tam mama a thinngim tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang tung kong vawtnate hu in minam tam mama liinglawng tu uh hi. Ka namsau ka vik ciang kumpite lau in liing tu uh hi. Na puk ni ciangin tuate theampo in amate ii nuntak natu patau in liing tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in Egypt kumpipa tungah, “Babylon kumpipa namsau ngal na thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ngilo ngamte pan ngalkapte in a namsaute taw na mite theampo ka thatsak tu hi. Na mite theampo le na kiphatsak pui a dang nate theampo ka lalsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tui omna po ah a taa na ngannote kong ngawlupsak tu hi. Tui a nusak kik tu mihing le ngannote om nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tuite ka ciim sitsetsak tu a na ngunte thim takin ka luangsak tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa pau zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt ngam sia ngamtongta suaksak in, a sungah a teang theampo ka lal siatsak ciang Keima, Topa ka hi hunlam amate in hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi a ciliap huai kidop natu ka thu piak sia mithi vuina la suak tu hi. Ngam theampo pan numeite in Egypt le a mite theampo a tu a khuangaina a lakna in tua lasa tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in pau zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sal ih tan zawk kum sawm le kum ni kum a tha masabel ni sawm le ni nga ni in Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, a tam mama Egypt mi theampo atu in khuangai in na om in. Amate sia a thahat minamte taw mithi khua ah puaksuk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate tungah hi bangin va son tan: Ngualdang khat pawpo sangin na mealhoi zaw sa nu ziam? Mithi khua ah na tuaksuk tu uh a Pathianzia a he ngawlte sung tua mun ah na lum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ngal sungah a thite taw Egypt mite thi tu uh hi. Amate theampo a that tu in namsau khat kinging khol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngalhang belh te le Egypt te sang pan a dote in mithi khua pan Egypt te a muak uh hi. Amate in: ‘Pathianzia a he ngawl ngal sungah a kithatte hong paisuk in hi sungah lum uh hi!’ ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tua munah Assyria om a, a ngalkapte thaan in kiim uum hi. Amate ngal sungah kithat siat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />amate thaan sia mithi khua a thuk belna munah om hi. A ngalkapte theampo ngal sungah thi a, ama thaan sia ngalkapte thaan in kiim uum hi. Ahihang khatvei hunlai in amate in a nungtate ngam liinglawngsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua munah Elam om a, a ngalkapte thaan in kiim uum hi. Amate ngal sungah kithat siat a, vunteap at ngawl ma in mithi khua ah tuaksuk uh hi. A nuntak lai in ngual lauthawngsak a, ahihang tu in mindai in thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elam sia ngal sungah a thite taw lum a, a ngalkap thite thaan in kiim uum hi. Amate theampo vunteap ki at ngawlin ngal sungah a thite vive ahi uh hi. A nuntak lai in ngual lauthawngsak a, ahihang tu in amate thi in a maimawl in ngalsung a thite taw kisial khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tua munah Meshech le Tubal te om a, a ngalkapte thaan teng a kiim ah om uh hi. Amate theampo vunteap ki at ngawlin ngal sungah a thite vive ahi uh hi. Ahihang, khatvei hunlai in amate in a nungtate liinglawngsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate sia mithi khua ah ngalhiam kicing taw pai in a namsaute lukhamin kineisak a, a lumte a pum tungah a kikoi, taanghlai ngalhangte bangin zatakna taw kiphum ngawl hi. Hi ngalhangte sia khatvei hunlai in a nungtate a liinglawngsak khom tu in a tha uh hat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tuabangin Egypt te sia ngal sungah a kithat, vunteap at ngawlte sungah kisucip tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Edom sia a kumpite le a ukte taw tua munah om hi. Amate sia a thahat ngalkapte hi a, ahihang tu in ngal sungah a kithat, vunteap at ngawl ngalkapte taw mithi khua ah lum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Saksang kumpipa tate theampo tua munah om a, Sidon te zongh tua mun ma ah om uh hi. A thahatna in khatvei lai in ngual liinglawngin lausak ngei hi, ahihang tu in amate sia ngalsung a thite taw vunteap at ngawlin mindai in kiphum khawm uh hi. Amate in mithi khua ah a paisukte taw a kibangin mindaina thuak khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ngal sungah a kithatte a mu uh ciang Egypt kumpipa le a ngalkaphonpi in dik a sa tu uh hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“A nungta te liinglawngsak tu in Egypt kumpipa ka sawl ahi hi. Ahihang ama le a ngalkaphonpi theampo sia kithatlum tu a, ngal sungah a thi, vunteap at ngawlte theampo taw kisial tu hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in keima hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, ngam khat tungah ngal ka thetsak ciang bang suak tu ci thu na mite son in. Tua ngammite in amate sung pan ngalvil tu khat teal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngalte hong nai a mu ciang a kidop thei natu in ama in patau daak tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua sia za napi khat po in awlmawk ngawl a, ngalte hong pai in ama a that le ama ii thina sia ama ii mawna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama khialna hu in ama thi hi, banghang ziam cile a kidop natu patau daak sia thusim ngawl hi. Thusim hi ka pole ama suakta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong ngalvilpa in ngalte hong pai mu napi, patau daak a tum buale ngalte hong pai in tua mawneite that tu uh hi, ahihang mawneite thina sia ngalvilpa ka mawsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tu in, a thithei mihing awng, nang Israel minam ii ngalvilpa in kong koi hi. Nang tungah kidop natu thu kong piak pawpo sia amate zasak sawn tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihing ngilo khat a thi tu in ka taangko a, ahizong a nuntakna a ngup thei natu a ngamtatna kikhealin a kidop natu na son bua ahile, ama sia mimaw khat ma in a thi tu hi, tuaciang ama ii thina sia nang hang a hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing ngilo khat kidop natu thu na son a, ahihang a mawna kheal ngawlin mimaw khat ma in thi tu hi, ahihang nang nuntakna hong kikhoaikhe tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in keima hong paupui hi. Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel te tungah amate ci teng son kik in: ‘Eite ii ih vawtsa ih mawna le ih khialna vanhngit te ih pua hi. Ih tha bo hi, bangbang nungta thei tu hi ziam?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate tungah son in a, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma in, mawnei te a thi ka mu sia lungdamin ka nei bua hi. A mawna kikheal in a nuntak tu ka dei zaw hi. Israel awng, na tatsiatna pan kheal in. Banghang thi nuam ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, tu in Israel te tungah mihing pha khat in mawna khialna a vawt le a pha a sepnate in ama ngum zo ngawl tu hi. Mi ngilo khat in siatna a vawt nawn buale ama daan kipia ngawl tu a, mipha khat in mawna vawt tu a kipan le a nuntakna kikhoaikhe ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mipha khat po tungah nuntakna kamciam pia thei khi hi, ahihang ama in a pha a vawt sate kicing zo sa in, mawna a vawt le phatna a vawt sate peuma ka tepteesak nawn buatu hi. A mawnate hu in ama thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi ngilo khat po thi tu hi ci in a kidop natu sonkhol zo ka hihang, ama in mawna vawt nawn ngawlin a maan le a pha nate a vawt le —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />sonteena in, a sum pukthaak manin a laak vanhte pia kikin a nguk sa vanhte a pia kik le — mawna a vawt kheal in, nuntakna a pia thukhamte a zui le ama thi ngawl tu a, nungta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A vawt sa mawna khialna te ka maisak tu a, a maan le a pha a vawtte hu in ama nungta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tuaciang na mite in ka vawt sia maan ngawl hi hong ci hi! Hi ngawl hi, amate pai zia a maan ngawl hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thutang khat in a pha a vawt tawlnga in a sia a vawt le tua hu in ama thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi ngilo khat in a mawna kheal in, a maan le a pha a vawt le a nuntakna ngum zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang Israel te awng, ka vawt sate maan ngawl hi nong ci uh hi. Keima in na sepna bangin thu kong khen tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ih sal tan zawk kum sawm le kum nii kum a ni nga ni in, Jerusalem khua pan hong suakta khat in Jerusalem khuapi bo zo hi ci in hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama hong pai ma a zei nitakin, Topa ii nasia takin hong ompui na ka phawk hi. A zing ciang zingsang in tua pa hong thet ciang, Topa in kampau theina vaang hong pia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel ngam sungah a siacip sa khuapite sungah a teang mite in: ‘Abraham sia mihing khat bek hi a, ama tungah ngam bup kipia hi. Ei, mihing tam mama ih hiciang, tu in tua ngam sia eima ngam ahi hi,’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng amate son in: A chi thai ngawl lai sa na ne uh hi. Milimte na bia uh hi. Mihing na that uh hi. Hi leitang sia koma neisa hi ci in, bang in hong ngaisunsak ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na namsaute suang nu hi. Na ngamtatna uh thasiathuai hi. Mihing theampo in palngul mawna vawt nu hi. Hi leitang sia noma neisa hi ci in, bang in hong ngaisunsak ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma in, tua khuapi siacip sate sungah a teang mihingte kithat tu hi ci in a kidop natu thu ka piak sia son in. Ngam sungah a teang teng sia ngamsate in ne tu hi. Mualtung le suanghawng sungah a buu te natna taw thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima in tua ngam sia a kinusia ngamtongta ka suaksak tu a, a kiphatsak pui a vaangletna bo tu hi. Israel mualte sia dui thukpui suak tu a, kuama in khualhaw in kaantan thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihingte a mawna a khialna te hu in daan ka piak ciang le a ngam sia ngamtongta ka suasak ciang Topa ka hi hunlam amate in hong he tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in, “A thithei mihing awng, na mite in khuapi uumna pang hui ahibuale a inn kongbiangte ah a kisik uh ciang nangma thu son tu uh hi. Amate khat le khat ‘Tu in Topa kung pan bang kammal hong suak ziam, pai in ngai tawng,’ kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahikom, ka mite na son tu thu a ngai tu in a hon in hong pai uh hi, ahihang seam tu na sawlte a seam bua uh hi. Ki itna kamthumte pau ahihang a duhop ngei ma in duhop veve lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate atu in nang sia tengtongh tum a, lawmla a sasa zindo khat bang lel na hi hi. Na kampau theampo hong ngai napi kam khat beak zongh hong ni ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahizong, na kampau theampo hong taangtun ciang — hong taangtung takpi tu a, tuasia ciang kamsaang khat amate sungah om ahi hunlam amate in he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel ngam ukte sonsia in, kamsaanna taw, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii kong ci teng amate munah son in: No Israel ii tuucingte awng a lal na hi uh hi: Noma le noma na kikeam cing uh a, ahihang na tuute na keamcing ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in a noai taw kivaak in, a mul taw a kivawt puante silh a, a limcibel tuute ngoin a sa na ne uh hi. Ahihang tuute na keamcing ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note in tuu zawngkhalte na ou bua uh a, a ciinate bawl ngawl, a liamte a liamma tuamsak ngawl, a lampialte khoi kik ngawlin, ahibuale a bote na zong kik bua uh hi. Tuasia luangin na vawtsia lalai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuute sia a cing nei ngawl ahikom, peakkeak a, ngamsate in manin a sa ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tuute mualtung le mual bawk saang na munte ah a vakvai uh hi. Leitung theampo ah peakkeak a, kuama in amate zong ngawlin a kan bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tu in, no tuucingte awng, Topa ahi Keima ii son bang hong ngai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma, keima ii thuson nong ngai tu uh phazaw hi. Ngamsate in ka tuute manin, thatin a sa ne uh hi, banghang ziam cile tuucing om ngawl hi. Ka tuucingte in tuute kanin zong ngawl hi. Amate le amate kikeam a, tuute a keam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom, no tuucingte awng, ka thuson hong ngai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in note ngal ka hi na thu ka thangsak hi. Ka tuute noma khut sung pan ka la kik tu a, bangma hunin amate ii tuucingte kong hisak kik ngei buatu hi; noma le noma bekma a kikeam tu in kong koi kik ngei buatu hi. Noma khut sung pan ka tuute ka suatak tu a, no kong nesak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in kong ci na pan keima mama in ka tuute ka zong tu a, ka keam tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuucing khat in a kithethaang tuute kaikhawm in a kep bangma in ka tuute ka keam tu hi. Tua khuazing le a lauhuai tuasiatna ni in, a kithethaang na mun theampo panin amate ka khawm kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngamdang tuatuamte pan amate ka la tu a, kaikhawm in, a ngam leitang tungah ka ciapui kik tu hi. Israel ngam luite le mualte ah keima in lampui kikin, lo hingna ah an ka vaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel ngam lopa omna mualtung le ngamkuam te, tua ciang lohingna theampo ah amate ngam muang takin ka taasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in ka tuute a cing tuucingpa ka hi tu a, a tawlngak natu mun khat ka zonsak tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ka pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Keima in a bote ka zong tu a, a lampial te ka khoi kik tu hi, a liamte a liamma ka tuamsak tu a, a ciinate ka damsak tu hi; ahihang thau in a thahatte ka susia tu hi, banghang ziam cile keima in a maan in a ngamta tuucingpa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tu in no ka tuuhonte awng, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in kong cina pan, note khat sim tungah thu kong khen tu a, a pha le a sia, tuu le keal kong khen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note pawlkhat in lopa limcibel na neak uh taw lungkim zo ngawl a; na neak ngawl te ngawngawn na tuanhcil uh hi! Tui thiang na dawn uh a, na dawn ngawl teng na nusak uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka tuu dangte in na totcil lopate le na nutsaksa tuite ma a neak uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tua ahikom tu in Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in no a thahat tuute le a thazawm tuute kilaklaw ah thu kong khen tu hi, ci in kong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note in tuu a ciinate na kii uh taw na sii uh a, tuuhon sung pan na niil keak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahizong ka tuute ka suatak tu a, kuama in ka vawtsiasak nawn buatu hi. Ka tuute khat sim tungah thukhenin a sia le a pha ka doi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka naseampa David bang ahi kumpi khat amate ii khat bek ahi tuucing pa tu in ka pia tu a; amate a keam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima, Topa sia amate ii Pathian ka hi tu a, ka naseampa David bang ahi kumpi khat in amate a uk tu hi. Keima ka pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate thin muang hiithiat in a om natu in amate taw thuciamna khat ka vawt tu hi. Nganhing a kiitakhuaite theampo a ngamsung pan ka heam tu hi, tuasia in ka tuute ngammuang takin lote sungah nungta in, taam sungah a mut thei natu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Amate thupha ka pia tu a, ka mual thiangtho kiimkot ah ka teangsak tu hi. Tua munah a kisap hunin thupha nguatui ka zusak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thingkungte a nga nga tu a, lote pan an piangin, mihing theampo thinmuang takin a leitang tung tek ah a teang tu uh hi. Ka mite ii thikkol sutan in, a sila kaaina pan ka suut ciang Topa ka hi hunlam amate in he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian he ngawl minamte in amate ii neisate suttol nawn ngawl tu a, ngamsate in ne lum ngawl tu hi. Amate ngam muang takin teang tu a, kuama in lauthawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leipha leihoi lote ka pia tu a, a ngam sungah ngilkialna ka omsak buatu hi. Ngamdangte in selno ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mihing theampo in Israel te keima ii ka huuk hunlam le amate ka minam ahi hunlam he tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa pau zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“No, ka tuute, kong vaak sa tuuhon, keima mite na hi uh a, keima in note Pathian ka hi hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in keima hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Edom ngam sonsia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii son teng mipi te tungah son in: Edom mualte awng, Keima sia na ngal ka hi hi. Nangma sia a kinusia ngamtongta kong suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na khuapite lalcip in ka nusia tu a, Na ngam leitangte ngamtongta ka suaksak tu hi; Tua hun ciang Topa ka hi hunlam na he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nang sia Israel te ii ngal na hi tawntung a, a mawna a khialnate hu in a khakbelh daan a thuak hun, a tuasiat hun sungin Israel mite na thi mangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom — Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa sia a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma — thina sia na thuak tu ma hi a, suakta thei ngawl tu ni hi. Mihing that in maw na hikom, nang sia thalup tu in hong kizuizen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom mualtung ngam sia ngamtongta ka suaksak tu a, tua ngam kaantanin khual a haw pawpo ka thatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mualpite ahizong mualnote le kuam te ahizong ngalsung a kithat mithi luangte taw ka dimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tawntungin ngamtongta kong suaksak tu a, na khuapite sungah kuama teang kik ngawl tu hi. Tuasia ciang Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Keima Topa sia Judah le Israel ngamte ii Pathian hi napi, hi ngamte nii le leitangte sia nangma aa hi a ka neisa hi, na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa sia a nungta takpi Pathian ka hi bangma, ka mite tungah na thin uukna, na eenna le na ngaimawkna te kong thuk kik tu hi. Amate tungah na vawt nate hangin daan hong pia ka hi hunlam amate in he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciangin, nangma in, Israel mualte sia a ngamtongta suak a, ka siasak hial zong keima thu hi zo hi, ci in nomuna taw na paunate Keima Topa in za ka hi hunlam na he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei hong langpan in, kiphatsakna taw na kamham pauna te kong za zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Nang a ngamtongta mama khatin kong vawt tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima neisa Israel a lalcip ciang na lungdam bangma in leitung buppi in na kiamsuk sia a lungdam tu uh hi. Seir mualte bek dom ngawlin Edom ngam theampo ngamtongta suak tu hi. Tua hun ciang keima in Topa ka hi hunlam mihing theampo in he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel mualte tungah ka thupuak a ngai natu son in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka son tu thute hi bang hi: Israel ii a ngalte in eenna taw en in, ‘Tu in tua taanghlai mualte sia koma aa hi!’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang kamsaanna son in a, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng taangko in. A ngampaamte in Israel mualte la in, a sutol ciang, amate theampo in Israel te nunau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in, no, mualte, luamte le ngamkuamte, a lalsa in a kinusia munte, na kiimkot ngam theampo ii a sutol a nunau khuapite awng, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii son teng hong ngai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in, a kiimkot ngamte le a tuatuanin Edom ngam tungah ka thin uuk mama na taw thu ka son hi. Amate in zawnsakna le lawp toaina taw keima leitangte le nganthana munte hong laaksakin amate ii neisa sua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang Israel ngam tungah kamsaanna son in a; mualpite, mualnote, luamte, ngamkuamte sia minamte in selnoin a vaang bosak ahikom Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ka thin uukna taw kong ci teng son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in na kiimkot minamte vaang bosak tu khi hi, ci in a ciliap huai kamciam kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang, Israel ka mite awng, Israel mualte tungah nang atu in thingkung pote a tee boai in a nga nga kik tu hi. Hai ngawlin inn ah nong cia kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma sang kong pang hi, na leitang a kitho kik tu in ka vawt tu a, anciite kipoai kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na mite ka pungsak tu hi. Khuapite sungah na teang tu uh a, a kisia sate theampo na pua kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ngannote le mihingte kong pungsak tu hi. Nidang sangin na tamzaw tu uh a, ta tam mama na nei tu uh hi. Na teen ngei bangin tua munah kong teangsak tu a, nidang sangin na nuamsa zaw tu uh hi. Tua hun ciang Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />No Israel ka mite na leitang tungah teang kik tu in kong pui kik tu hi. Tua leitang sia noma ngam suak tu a, na tate pukthisak kik ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in ka ci hi: Mihingte in tua ngam sia mihing sa ne ngam hi ci a, a ngam sungah a tate kisuttol hi a ci uh sia thumaan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang tu pan kipan na tate hong suttol mihing sa ne khat hi nawn ngawl tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in pau zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hong selno ngamte ii thu na nadon kul nawn ngawl tu a, a mite ii hong nunauna zongh na mu nawn buatu uh hi. Tua ngam in hi minam ii tate suttol nawn ngawl tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa in ka pau zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel te a ngam sungah a teen lai in, a nuntakzia le a ngamtatna taw a ngam ninsak uh hi. Amate ngamtat luheak sia numei khat tha simin a nin nei hun sung bangin biakna taw kisai a thiangtho ngawlin ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a ngam sungah mihing a thalupnate le a biak milimte taw in a ngam a nitsak nate hu in, ka thin uuk tutna daan a thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate nuntakzia le a ngamtatnate ka mawsak a, ngamdang ah ka thethaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A paina pawpo ah ka min thiangtho mindaisak hi, banghang ziam cile mihingte in, ‘Hite in Topa mite hi napi Topa ngam a taisat uh kul hi,’ ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia in ka min thiangtho atu hong thintoisak hi, banghang ziam cile Israel mite in a paina theampo ah ka min daisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tu in Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii thupuak sia Israel mite tungah son in: ka vawt tu sia in no Israel te atu hi ngawl a, na thetna ngam theampo ah na daisak sa ka min thiangtho atu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minamte sungah na daisak uh ka min — ka min lian ii thiangthona amate tungah ka lak ciangin — keima sia Topa ka hi hunlam amate in hong he tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ka pau zo hi. Nangma hong zanghin minamte tungah a thiangtho ka hi sia ka lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minam theampo le ngam theampo pan kong la kik tu a, na ngam ah kong ciapui kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />No tuithiangtho kong the tu a, milimte le hong ninsak nadangte theampo pan kong thiangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungtang thak le thin thak kong pia tu hi. A thinpui na suang lungtang kong laaksak tu a, thu a ni lungtang kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thukhamte le ka thupiakte theampo na zui ka mu thei natu in ka thaa kong khum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua hun ciang, na taanghpupite tungah ka piaksa ngam ah na teang tu uh hi. Note in keima mite na hi tu uh a, Keima in noma Pathian ka hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hong ninsak nate theampo pan kong hun tu hi. No tungah kialpite hong tun nawn ngawl natu in an tam mama a pian natu thupia tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Minamte sungah kialpi hu in na mindai ngawl natu na thingnga kungte le na lote pan an tam mama ka piang thuasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na ngitlonate le khialna na vawtte na phawk tu a, na mawna le na khialna te uh hu in, noma le noma na kinunau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel awng, hi te theampo sia nang atu in a seam ka hi ngawl hunlam na heak tu ka dei hi. Na sep na vawtnate hu in na maizum in na maimawl tu ka dei hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in ka pau zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Na mawna theampo pan kong thiansua zawkciang na khuapite ah kong teangsak kik tu a, a lalcip sate theampo na pua kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na lo paam ah a pai pawpo in lopa in na lote khunel in duipui suak ahi hunlam mu tu uh hi, ahihang na lote kong thosak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mihingte theampo in hi lo duipui a sua ngei hang, tu in Eden Huan bang hi zo a, khuapite kisutham, kiphuulin a kisia sa in om ngei, hikale tu in mihing teang kik zo a, kulh taw ki uum zo hi ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A bo ngawl a taanglai na ngampaamte in Keima, Topa sia a kikhul sa lote ah an ciing kikin, a lalsa khuapite a pua kik Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi; Keima, Topa in hi teng vawt tu in kong kamciam zo a — ka vawt tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Israel te in ka tungah hu ka ngensak kik tu a, tuasia ciang tuuhon bangin amate ka pungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua hun ciang, tu laitakin a lalcip khuapite sia poai sungah sangaw biakpiakna in a nei tuute taw a kidim ngei Jerusalem khuapi bangin mihing taw kidim kik tu hi. Tuasia ciang Keima, Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa ii a vaanglian hong ompuina ka phawk a, ama thaa in mithi ngute taw kidim ngamkuam ah hong paipui a, tua munah hong koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ngamkuam sungah hong vapui kawkoai a, a ko sa mithi ngute tam mama ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, hi mithi ngute a nungta kik thei tu ziam?” hong ci hi. Keima in, “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, nangma bekma in zo thei tu ni hi,” ci in ka zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in, “Mithi ngute tungah kamsaanna pia in. Mithi ngu hite in Topa kammal ngaisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa ii ci teng son in: Keima in hu ka mop tu a, nuntakna ka pia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thangui le sazangte ka pia tu a, vun taw ka tuam tu hi. Hu ka mop tu a, ka nungtasak kik tu hi. Tua hun ciang Topa ka hi hunlam na he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom hong kison bangin kamsaanna ka pia hi. Ka thuson laitak mama in, awnging siasua ka za a, mithi ngute kipee tu in kipan hon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mu tang mama in, mithi ngute thangui le sazangte taw kituam a, tua zawkciang vun in tuam hi. Ahihang a pumpi sungah nuntakna hu a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei tungah Pathian in, “A thithei mihing awng, vui sungah kamsaanna pia in. Vui sia mun theampo pan hong pai natu, mithi luang hite sungah hu a khum natu le nuntakna a piak kik natu in, Vaanglianpipa Topa in thu ka pia hi ci sia vui kungah va son ta'n,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hong kisawlna bangin kamsaanna ka pia hi. Pumpite sungah nuntakna hu tum a, nungta in hong dingto hi. Ngalkaphonpi khat a pha zo tu za in a tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel mite sia hi mithi ngute taw kibang hi. Amate in ka ngu uh tei zo a, maisang bangma muanmawkna nei nawn ngawl khu hi, a ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom Israel ka mite tungah Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in a thaankhukte ka honsak tu hi ci in kamsaanna pia in. Keima in amate ka lakeak tu a, Israel ngam ah ka pui kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite kiphumna thaante hongin amate ka laakkeak ciang, Topa ka hi hunlam amate in hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hu ka mop tu a, nungtasak kik in, a ngam ah ka teangsak kik tu hi. Tuasia ciang amate in kei sia Topa ka hi hunlam he tu uh hi. Tusia vawt tu in kamciam ka pia zo a — ka vawt tu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, thing ciangkhut khat la in a tungah ‘Judah kumpi ngam’ ci in at in. Tua zawkciang a dang khat la in ‘Israel kumpi ngam’ ci in a tungah at in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a mong veve situa in a, ciangkhut khat bek bangin na khut sungah toai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na mipuite in a khiakna bang ziam ci in hong dok ciang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in, Israel taang ahiciangkhut sia la in a, Judah taang ahiciangkhut sia taw ka koikhop tu sia amate son in. Ciangkhutte ngeal sia khat ka sua tu a, ka khut sungah ka toai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ciangkhutte ngeal sia na khut sungah toai in a, mihingte musak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in a paina ngam theampo panin, ka mite theampo kaikhawm in amate ngam leitang tungah ka ciapui kik tu sia amate tungah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel ngam mualte tungah amate, minam khat in ka ngawm tu hi. Kumpi khat bek in amate uk tu a, minam nii ahizong, kumpi ngam nii ahizong kikhen nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kiihuai milimte taw amate le amate kininsak nawn ngawl tu a, mawna taw kilalsak nawn ngawl tu hi. Amate sia kei hong melsiatna mawna le hong leeheakna lampite theampo pan ka suaktasak tu hi. Amate ka thiansua tu hi; amate sia keima mite hi tu a, Keima in amate ii Pathian ka hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka naseampa David taw a kibang kumpi khat sia amate kumpi hi tu hi. Ngamuk khat ii khutnuai ah amate teng kilomkhat tu a, thumaan takin ka thukhamte a zui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka naseampa Jacob tungah ka piaksa a taanghpupite teenna ngam ah teang tu uh hi. Tua munah a tate le a suan a paal te theampo, a tawntungin teang tu uh hi. Ka naseampa David bang ahi kumpi khat in amate a tawntungin uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate a tawntung ngammuangin a omsak thuciamna khat amate taw ka vawt tu hi. Amate ka kipsak tu a, a mite pungsakin, ka Biakinnpi sia a ngam sungah a tawntung a om tu in ka koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate taw tua munah ka teang khawm tu hi; keima in amate ii Pathian ka hi tu a, amate in keima mite ahi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka Biakinnpi sia amate sungah a tawntung atu ka phu ciang, minamte in Keima, Topa in Israel sia keima mi in ka teal hunlam hong he tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in kei hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “A thithei mihing awng, Magog ngam sungah om Mesheh le Tubal ngam ukpipa Gog sonsia in. Ama sonsia in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa sia ama ii ngal ka hi hunlam ama tungah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama heak zazaan in a, a kha ngu sia thikkoai bulin ama le ama ii ngalkapte theampo ka kaikeak tu hi. Ama ngalkaphonpi sia a siphute le a kibang puan a silh siphu tungtote taw, tam mama a, ngalkapte theampo in lum le namsau khat tek toai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Persia, Ethiopia le Libya pan mite sia ama sang pangin lum le thik lukhute nei siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saksang Gomer ngam le Beth Togarmah ngamte pan, ngalsim mite theampo le a dang ngam tam ma pan ngalkapte in ama panpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama a kingin khol natu son in a, a thupiak bangin, a ngalkapte theampo kinging kholsa in omsak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kum tam mama zawkciang, ngam theampo pan a cia kik, ngal muang sa in a om mihingte teenna ngam sim tu in ama ka sawl tu hi. Ama in ngei mama a kinusia sa hi a, ngamtongta ahihang tu in mihingte theampo ngammuang takin a teenna mun Israel mualte sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama le a ngalkapte le ama taw kipawl ngam tam mamate in vuipi bangin sim tu a, meei bangin a ngamsung a tuamcip tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi sia in Vaanglianpipa Topa ii Gog tungah a son ahi hi: “Tua hun hong thet ciangin nang in thusia tupna khat na ngaisun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang in a mite thinmuang takin a teenna, a khuate ngaldalna kulh taw a ki uum ngawl, a hung tu om ngawl ngam khat sim tu in na khensat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lal ngeisa khuapite sungah a teang mite ii neisate suttol in na laaksak tu hi. Amate sia minamte sung pan kikaikhawm a, tu in vul le khoai, nei le lamh hong nei a, leitung lamkaa bomte ah a teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sheba le Dedan mite le Spain ngam khuate pan sum vawtte in, ‘Na ngalkaphonpite ngual neisate suttol tu le a sim tu in na khawm zo ziam? Ngunn le khamh, vul le khoaite le a neisa a lamh sate laaksak siatin, tua vanhte theampo ciapui tu na sawm ziam?’ ci in nang hong dongh tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Vaanglianpipa Topa in ama ci teng Gog tungah a son tu in kei hong paisak hi: “Tu in Israel ka mite thin muang in a teen laitakin nangma in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a khualana saksang mun na laakna panin, ngam tam mama pan a thahat le a tam mama siphu ngalkapte lampui in na kuan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vuipi suangval sia ngamsung kaantan in a vak bangin Israel ka mite na sim tu hi. A hun hong thet ciang, nang tungtawnin ka sep sia taw ka thianthona le keima akua ka hi sia minamte in hong heak natu ka lakna in ka ngam sim tu in nangma kong paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka naseam Israel kamsaangte tungtawnin, a ni a hun hong thet ciang Israel te a sim tu khat kong puak tu hi ci a nidang pek pan ka taangko sia nangma na hi hi.” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Israel mite Gog ii a sim ni in ka thinso tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thin uuk mama hu in tua ni ciang Israel ngam ah nasia takin zinliing tu hi ci in ka thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngasa le vacim theampo, nganhing a lian a no theampo le leitung ah a om mihing theampo in kei hong kiita in a liing tu uh hi. Mualte le liangte cim tu a, luphung theampo puk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gog mite tuasiatna namcin taw ka lausak tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa in son zo khi hi. Ama ii mihingte khat le khat namsau taw kisaat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chisan luanna le natna taw ama daan ka pia tu hi. Nguapi le ngialtang, meikuang le kaan, ama le a ngalkaphonpi tung le ama taw kipawl minam tam mamate tungah buasuk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi bangin keima letna le ka thiantho na sia minam theampo ka lak tu hi. Tua hun ciang amate in Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “A thithei mihing awng, Meshech le Tubal ngamte ukpi pa Gog sonsia in a, keima sia a ngal ka hi hunlam ama tungah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in ama sia lam thak khat ah ka heak tu a, saksang pek panin, Israel ngam mualte a thet dong lam ka pui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a khut veisang ah a toai thal le a khut ziatsang ah a toai thaltangte ka bekkeaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gog le a ngalkaphonpite, a kipawlpuite Israel mualte tungah thi tu uh a, a mithi luangte sia ngamsate le vacimte an ka suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate lozau sungah thi tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ka pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Magog ngam le thinmuang takin a mite teenna tuipi dung theampo mei taw ka hal tu hi, tuaciang mite theampo in, Keima, Topa ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel ka mite in ka min thiangtho ka hesak takpi tu a, ka min a kidaisak nawn buatu hi. Tuasia ciang, minamte in Keima, Topa sia Israel ii Thiangtho Pathian ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “A thu ka sonsa ni sia hong tung takpi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel khuapite ah a teang mite pai in, a kinusia ngalhiamte thingthu tu in khawm tu uh hi. Lumte, thalte, thaltangte, teite le molte thingin thut tu a, kum sali sung khom tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in lo sung pan thing tom tu le duisung pan thing phuk tu kul ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile amate in ngalhiam nusiatte a thut tu in nei uh hi. A ngalte ii a suttol a laaksak vanhte, amate in suttol a, laaksak tu hi,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Hi thu teng hong pian ciang, Gog kiphumna tu mun khat sia Tuipi Thi ii nisuana sang Israel ngam Khualhawte Ngamkuam sungah ka pia tu hi. Gog le a ngalkapte theampo tua munah kiphum tu a, tua kuam sia ‘Gog ii Ngalkaphonpi Kuam’ kici tu hi.,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel mite in mithi luangte theampo a phum natu le a leitang thiangthosak kik natu in tha sali hun bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngamsung a teang mihingte theampo in mithi phumpui tu hi, tua ahiciang ka ngal zaw ni in amate minphatna kipia tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa in ka son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tha sali a bo zawkciang leitang a thianthosak thei natu in, ngamsung theampo ah khualhaw in mithi luang a kiphum ngawl lai theampo a zong tu le a phum tu pasalte kiteal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate sia ngamsung suk le to ah vak kawkoai in, mithi ngu khat a mu simin, tua ii hui ah tepteena khat vawt tu hi, tua hile thaankhuk tote pai in Gog ii Ngalkaphonpi Kuam sungah phum thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Tua mun taw a kinai na ah ngalkaphonpi ii min a kitap khua khat om tu hi) Tuabangin a leitang kithiangthosak kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, amate atu ka vawt sangaw biakpiakna sate ne tu in, kiim le paam theampo pan vacim le nganhingte theampo hong pai natu in sam in. Tua in Israel mual tungah poaipi khat hi tu a, tua munah sa ne in chi dawn thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuate in tuutalte ahibuale, tuunote ahibuale kealte ahibuale, khuital thaute bangin a kithatlum ngalkapte ii luangte ne in, leitung ngamukte ii chi dawn tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sangaw biakpiaknate bangin hi mihingte ka thalup ciangin, vacimte le nganhingte in a chi le a thaute theampo a kham dongin ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima sabuai tungah tuate in siphute le a tungtote, ngalkapte le ngalsim mihingte ii sa a neak zawk zaza ne tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Minamte in ka vaangletna ka musak tu hi, tuaciang a maan a thu ka khensat natu in bangbangin ka vaangletna zangh khi ziam ci sia ka lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel te in tua hun pan kipan Keima sia Topa a Pathian ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minamte in kei tungah mawna khialna hong vawt nate hangin Israel te sal tang a hina thu a tel tu uh hi. Amate nungngat in a ngalte in ka zosak a, ngal sungah ka thatlumsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate a ninnoi na le a seksol nate taw a kilawm bangin ka thuaksak a, amate ka nungngat hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Ahihang tu in Jacob suan le paal Israel mite ka hesuak tu a, ka nuamsasak kik tu hi. Ka min thiangtho ka sungsia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate kuama in tawng nawn ngawlin, a ngam sungah ngammuangin khatvei a teen kik ciangin, keima hong leeheak hu in, bangbangin a mindai ci sia a mangil thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima thiangtho ka hi hunlam sia minam tampi ka lak natu in, a ngalte teenna ngam theampo panin ka mite ka pui kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua hun ciangin, ka minamte in Keima, Topa a Pathian ka hi hunlam hong he tu uh hi. Hi thu amate ii a tel theina sia, keima in amate matsa in ka puak a, tu in khawm kikin, khat zongh kikhe ngawlin, a ngam ah ka puak kik hu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel mite tungah ka thaa ka buak tu a, amate ka nungngat kik ngei buatu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in son zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun sia ih sal tan zawk kum kul le kum nga kum, Jerusalem khua a kilaak zawk kum sawm le kum lina kumthak ni sawm ni hi. Tua ni in Topa ii nasia tak hong ompui hunlam ka phawk a, ama in mundang ah hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mukholna khat sungah Pathian in Israel ngam sungah hong paipui a, mualsaang khat tungah hong koi hi. Ka mai ah khuapi khat taw a kibang inn honkhat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a nai zaw in hong neaksak a, tuaciang taau bangin a taang mihing khat ka mu hi. Ama in puanneal pikhau khat le piciang khat toai in kongpi hui khat ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in “A thithei mihing awng, en in. Pha takin hong ngai ta'n a kong lak na theampo nasia takin kin vawt in, banghang ziam cile nang sia hi thu huvau in hi sungah hong kipuak hi. Na mu theampo Israel mite tungah na son tu ahi hi,” kei tungah hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mu sia Biakinnpi hi a, a kiimkot ah luphung khat om hi. Tua pa in metre thum a sau ama piciang la in tua luphung tee hi. Tua sia metre thum saang a, metre thum saa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang nisuana sang a maingat kongpi vangah ama pai hi. Keallei tungah ama kaato in a dawn ah a tumna tee a; metre thum thuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ngal khat ah lamzin khat om a, a cingte inndoi thum veu a lang veve ah om hi. Tua inndoite in a kikim king li tek nei a, a pangh sia metre thum veu sau hi, a inndoite kilaklaw pangte metre nii le lang saa hi. A cingte inndoite ngal ah metre thum a sau lamzin khat om a, Biakinnpi a maingat sungtanna inndoi paina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in hi inndoi tee a, metre lithuk hi. Tua inndoi sia Biakinnpi taw a kinaibel kongpi vang tawpna hi a, a mongbel ah pangte sia metre khat saa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(Hi a cingte inndoi lamzin lang le lang ah a omte sia a letna kikim linlian siat a, a kilaklaw pangte zongh a saana kibang siat hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua pa in kongpi vang sung lamzin ii zaina tee hi. Tuasia a kingawm in metre luk le lang pha a, a kihong kongpite kilaklaw sia metre nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A cingte inndoi sim ii mai ah pang a niam, centimetre sawm nga a saang le centimetre sawm nga a saa khat om hi. (A inndoi kiimkot pangte ii pangh khat sia metre thum veu pha hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, inndoi khat ii a nung pang pan a langkhat lamzin kaantan in inndoi ii nungsang pang dong ama in tee a, metre sawm le nii le a lang pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Inndoi mong khakbel sia suumsung paina hi. Tua inndoi sia ama in tee a, metre sawm zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kongpi vang sauna sia a puasang pang pan a khakbel inndoi ii pangh dong sia a kingawm in metre kul le nga sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pusuana suazoai note sia a inndoi theampo ii a puasang pangte sung le inndoite kilaklaw a sungsang pangte zongh ah om siat hi. Lamzin a maingat a sungsang pangte tungah palm kung limte kisuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua pa in suum puanung ah kongpi vang zui in hong paipui hi. Tua munah a puasang pangte nealin inndoi sawmthum kivawt a, tuate mai ah suang kipha hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />suum puanung kiimkot dongah kipha hi. Hi suum puanung sia suum sungnung sangin niam zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A suumsung nung pai natu in kongpi vang khat a saang zawna munah om hi. Tua pa in kongpi vangte nii kilaklaw pitee a, metre 50 kikhuala hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua pa in suum puanung paina a saksang kongpi vang tee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A cinna inndoi thum, lamzin lang le lang ah a omte, a kilaklaw a om pangte le sungtanna inndoi theampo sia nisuana kongpivang sang a omte bang linlian veu ahi hi. Kongpivang ii sauna bup sia metre 25 hi a, a zaina sia metre 12.5 hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sungtanna innkhan, khelkite le palm lim kisuaite sia nisuana kongpi ah a omte taw kibang hi. Kongpi dong kal sali kisuan a, sungtanna inndoi sia suumsung sang maingat in a mong ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Suumsung langkhat ah hi a saksang kongpi vang pan suum sungnung paina a dang kongpi vang khat om a, nisuana sangah a omte bangma ahi hi. Tua pa in kongpivangte nii kilaklaw tee a, metre 50 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua pa in thang sangah hong paipui a, tua munah kongpivang dang khat ka mu uh hi. Ama in a sungsang pangte le a sungtanna inndoi tee a, a dangte taw ma kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi kongpivang ii inndoite sungah a dangte sung bangma in khelkite om hi. Kongpivang ii sauna a vekpi metre 25 pha a, metre 12.5 zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kal sali suan ciang kongpivang kitheng a, sungtanna inndoi zongh suumsung maingatin a mong ah om hi. Pusuana lampi a maingat a sungnung pangte tungah palm kungte lim kisuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi lai zongh ah suum sungnung paina kongpivang om hi. Tua pa in hi a niina kongpi dong tee a, metre 50 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua pa in thangsang kongpivang kaantan in suum sungnung ah hong tumpui hi. Ama in kongpi vang tee a, a puasang pangh ah a om kongpivangte taw kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A cingte inndoi, sungtanna inndoi le a sungnung pangte sia a dang kongpivangte ah a omte taw kibang hi. Hi kongpivang ii inndoite ah khelkite zongh om hi. A sauna bup sia metre 25 hi a, metre 12.5 zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sungtanna inndoi sia suumsung dang khat sang nga a, palm kung limte sia lamzin dung pangte tungah kisuai hi. Hi kongpi dong kal liat kisuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua pa in nisuana kongpivang zui in suum sungnung ah hong tumpui hi. Ama in kongpi tee a, a dangte taw kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A cingte innkhan, sungtanna inndoi le a sungnung pangte sia a dang kongpivang ah a omte taw kikim hi. A kiimkot khelki om kawkoai a, sung tumna inndoi sung zongh ah om hi. A sauna vekpi sia metre 25 hi a, metre 12.5 zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sungtanna inndoi in suum puanung maingat hi. Palm limte sia lamzin dung pangte tungah kisuai hi. Hi kongpi dong kal liat kisuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua pa in saksang kongpivang ah hong paipui hi. Ama in tuasia tee a, a dangte taw in kikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuate bangma in tuasia in a cingte inndoite, a kizeam sungnung pangte, sungtanna inndoi le a kiimkot theampo ah khelkite nei hi. A sauna vekpi sia metre 25 hi a, a zaina sia metre 12.5 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Sungtanna inndoi in a suum puanung maingat hi. Palm kungte lim lamzin dung pangte tungah kisuai hi. Hi kongpi dong kal liat pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Suum puanung ah saksang sungnung kongpi vang taw kipee in a kipeam inndoi khat om hi. Suum sung a maingat sungtanna inndoi dong kihong a, tualai ah sangaw biakpiakna in a kihal tu nganhing luangte amate in tui taw sil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hi sungtanna inndoi sungah sabuai li om a, a lang le lang ah ni veve kikoi hi. Hi sabuaite tungah amate in sangaw biakpiakna in a nei nganhingte, a pum bupin kihal tu ahizong mawna le khialna hang a biakna ah piak tu nganhingte ahizong ngo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Inndoi pua sangah a kibang sabuai li om a, saksang kongpi tumna lang le lang ah nii veve kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Biakpiakna nganhingte a tungah a kingawlup thei natu in a vekpi in sabuai liat om a: sabuai li sia a inndoi sung sangah a dang li sia a suum pua ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Innpeam sungah a om pum bup meihal biakpiakna vawt natu in a kizangh sabuai li te sia a ki attan suangtum taw a kivawt ahi hi. Tuate sia centimetre 50 saang a, a dawn kiimkot a kikim pangh li te sia centimetre 25 veu pha hi. Sangaw biakpiakna ah ngan ngawna a zak vanh teng tua sabuaite tungah kikeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Sabuaite mong kiimkot ah millimetre 25 a zai khinte a paisuak in om hi. Sabuaite tungah biakpiakna nganhing sate theampo kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a suum sungnung ah hong tumpui hi. Suum sungnung sangah a nga inndoi nii om a, khat in saksang kongpivang hui pan thangsang maingat a, khat in thangsang kongpivang hui pan saksang maingat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua pa in thangsang a nga inndoi sia Biakinnpi ah a seam thiampite atu hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />saksang a nga inndoi sia biaknatau ah a seam thiampite atu hi hong ci hi. Thiampi theampo sia Zadok ii suan le paalte hi a; amate sia Topa omna munah ama naseam tu in a kipaisak Levi minamte bek ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua pa in suum sungnung tee a, a pangh li khat simin metre 50 veu pha hi. Nitumna sangah Biakinnpi om a, tua ii mai ah biaknatau om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in Biakinnpi sung tumna inndoi ah kei hong tumpui hi. Sungtanna teng ama in tee a; metre 2.5 thuk a, metre zai in, metre 6.5 a saa pangte a lang le lang ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Sungtanna inndoi sia metre 10 zai in, metre 6 thuk a, tua mun thet natu in keallei kithung hi. A sung tumna a lang le a lang ah khuam khat veve om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, tua pa in A Thiangtho Mun, a laizang inndoi sungah hong paipui hi. Ama in tuasung tumna lamzin sia tee a: metre thum thuk in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />metre nga zai a, a lang le a lang pangte metre nii le lang veu saa hi. Ama in tua inndoi mama tee a: metre kul sau in metre sawm zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang ama sia a sungnung khakbel inndoi ah pai hi. Ama in tuasung tumna lamzin tee a: metre 1 thukin metre 3 zai hi, a lang le a lang pangte metre 3.5 veve saa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in tua inndoi mama tee a, a pang simin metre 10 veu pha hi. Hi inndoi sia a laizang inndoi ii ngalkhat ah om hi. Ama in kei tungah “Hi sia a Thiangtho Bel Mun hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua pa in Biakinn ii sungnung pang saana tee a, metre 3 pha hi. Biakinnpi kiimkot ah hi pang nealin, metre 2 veu a zai inndoi note a kipee in kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi inndoite dawl thum pha a, dawl khat simin inndoi sawmthum om hi. Biakinnpi ii a dawl simin a puasang pang sia a nuaidawl pang sangin pa zaw hi, tuabangin a tung inndoite pang tungah kilh kul ngawlin kinga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakinn pangte a puasang pan et ciang, a vekpi in a dawn dong a saana a kikim bangin kimu hi. Biakinnpi ii puanung pang nealin inndoite pua sangah a zai keallei ni kidaw a, tuabangin a nuaidawl pan a lai dawl le a tungnungbel dawlte ah kikaato thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi inndoite ii puasang pang sia metre 2.5 saa a; Biakinnpi saksang inndoite tumna innkha khat om a, thangsang inndoite tumna innkha khat om hi. Biakinnpi kiimkot ah metre 2.5 a zai a cial khat ka mu a; lei pan metre 3 saang hi, Biakinn pangte kungah a om inndoite tawdap taw kikim hi. Tua a cial le thiampite zak innte kilaklaw ah metre 10 a sau mun awng khat, Biakinnpi ii panghte ii dung tengah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mun awngthong ii mongbel, Biakinnpi ii nitumna sangah metre 45 a sau metre 35 a zai inn khat om a; a kiimkot pang sia metre 2.5 saa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Biakinnpi puasang teng tua pa in tee a, metre 50 sau hi. Biakinnpi nungsang pan mun awngna kaantan in nitumna innpangh dong zongh metre 50 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biakinnpi mai, a lang le lang ah a om mun awngthong a kihel sia zongh metre 50 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nitumna sang inn sia ii sauna ama in tee a, a lang le a lang ah a om dawtuam a kihel in metre 50 ma pha hi. Biakinnpi sungtanna innkhan, a Thiangtho Mun le A Thiangtho Bel Mun teng theampo sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />suat pan khelki dong thing taw ki uum hi. Hi khelkite sia kituam thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Biakinnpi pang sungsangte tung, innkhate tung sia a saangna dong ah, palm le cherubim lim kisuai te taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Inndoi sung theampo ah palm kung le cherubim limte a kithekin kisuai hi. Cherub simin maitang nii veu nei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a langkhat ah palm kung sang a maingat mihing maitang khat om a, a langkhat ah thingkung sang a maingat tawpi maitang khat om hi. Tuasia pang tung theampo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />suat pan innkhate tung dong kibang siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A Thiangtho Mun ii innkha khuamte sia a saanna le a zaina, a pangh li teng kikim hi. A Thiangtho Bel Mun tumna ii mai ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />thing biaknatau taw kibang na khat om hi. Tuasia sia metre 1.5 saang a, metre 1 zai hi. A king khuamte, a bul le a pangh theampo thing taw kivawt hi. Tua pa in kei tungah, “Hi sabuai sia Topa ompuina ah a ding sia ahi hi.” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A Thiangtho Mun paina lamzin tawpna ah innkha khat om a, a Thiangtho Bel Mun paina lamzin ah a dang khat zongh om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuate sia a lai pan a kihong thei kongkha kithuapte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pangte tungah a kisuai bangin a Thiangtho Mun kongkhate tungah palm kung le cherub te lim kisuai hi. Sungtanna inndoi ii innkha puasang sia thing taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi inndoi panghte ah khelkite om a, a pangte sia palm kung limte taw a kizeam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua pa in suum puanung sungah hong tumpui a Biakinnpi saksang ah hong paipui hi, tuaciang Biakinnpi saksang ah a om inn khat ah hong paipui hi, tua inn sia Biakinnpi nitumna sang a mong ah a om inn taw kikhuala ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi inn sia metre 50 sau a, metre 25 zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inn pangh khat in Biakinnpi dung ah a om metre 10 a zai mun awng sia maingat a, a pangh khat in suum puanung ah suang kipha lam sia maingat hi. Tua inn sia dawl thum in kivawt a, a tung dawlte sim sia a nuaidawl sangin nungsang neak zaw in kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi inn ii saksang pangh dungah metre 5 a zai, metre 50 a sau lamzin khat le sung tumna kongte om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A dawl tungnung inndoite sia a lai le a nuaidawl a omte sangin ciak zaw hi, banghang ziam cile a nungsang neak zaw in a kivawt hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A dawl thum sung theampo ah a inndoite sia, a cialte tungah om a, suum sungah a om inn dangte bangin khuam nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nuaidawl ah inn puanung pang sia metre 225 pha a, a sauna ii lang ahi hi; a taanglai metre 25 sungah inndoite om hi. A dawl tungbel ah innpi a dung sauna bup zui in a sungah inndoite om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi inndoite nii nuai, nisuana sang inn mong, suumsung pang kipatna munah, suum puanung tumna kongkha khat om hi, Biakinnpi thang sangah Biakinnpi nitumna mong, innpi taw a kikhuala ngawlna ah a kibang linlian inn khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inndoite mai ah saksang a om sia taw a kibang lamzin khat om hi. A zaina le a sauna kikim a, a vawtzia le sung tumnate zongh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A inn ii thangsang nisuana mong, a pang kipatna inndoite nuai ah kongkha khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua pa in keima tungah hong ci hi, “Hi innte ngeal thiangtho hi. A sungsang Topa ompuina ah a tum thiampite in a thiangthobel biakpiakna ante ne uh hi. A inndoite thiangtho ahi manin thiampite in a thiangthobel biakpiaknate: antang biakpiaknate, mawna hang sangaw biakpiaknate, ahibuale mawphel biakpiaknate tua munah koi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thiampite in Biakinnpi sung a tum zawkciang le a suum puanung ah a pai nop ciang, hi inndoite sungah Topa atu na a sep laitak, a silh puan thiangthote a nusiat kul hi. Ama te sia mipite kikhop na ah a pai ma in puan dang a sil uh kul tu hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakinnpi mun sung teng tua pa in a tee zawkciang, ama in nisuana kongpi pan hong pusua pui a, a mun puasang teng tee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in piciang la in, nisuana sang teng tee a, metre 250 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in saksang, thangsang le nitumna sang teng tee a; a sauna kibangin metre 250 tek pha hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuabangin a pang ii lang le lang ah a pangh li teng a kikim, pangh khat in metre 250 a pha khat tek uum hi. Tua pang sia a thiangtho mun le a thiangtho ngawl mun a kidaakna hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua pa in nisuana sang a nga kongpi ah kei hong paipui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tualai ah Israel te ii Pathian ii ompuina ahi khuavak taang velvol khat nisuana sang pan hong pai ka mu hi. Tui kihual nging bangin, Pathian aw nging a, khuavak taang velvol sia in leitung taangsak hemhom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi mukholna in Pathian ii Jerusalem khua siasak tu hong pai lai in ka mu sia le Chebar ngunhui ah ka mu mukholna khat taw kibang hi. Tuaciang, keima le keima ka khup lamin lei ah ka bok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuavak taang velvol sia in nisuana kongpi kaantan a, Biakinnpi sungah tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa ii thaa in kei hong laamto in, a suum sungnung ah hong paipui a, tua munah Biakinnpi sia Topa vaangletna taw kidim ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua munah tua pa sia ka kungah hong ding a, Biakinn sung pan Topa hong paupui ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“A thithei mihing awng, hi lai ah ka kumpi tokhum om hi. Hi lai Israel mite sungah teangin, amate a tawntung ka uk tu hi. Israel mite le a kumpite in pathian dangte biakna taw ahizong, a kumpite luang hi munah phumna taw ahizong, ka min thiangtho daisak kik nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpite in a kumpi inn kongkha khuamte le a saamkiilte sia ka Biakinnpi kongkha le kongkha saamkiilte nealin vawt a, tua ahikom ka kilaklaw uh pang khat bek in daa hi. Amate in a kiihuai a sep nate theampo taw ka min thiangtho daisak ahikom, ka thin uukna taw amate ka lalcipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in amate sia pathian dangte bia nawn ngawl tu a, a kumpite ii luangte heam tu uh hi. Tuabang a ngamta le, amate sungah ka teang tawntung tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in a pau zom a, “A thithei mihing awng, Israel mite tungah Biakinnpi thu son in a, a kivawt ngealnate amate kansak in. Khialna mawna a vawtte hangin amate maizumsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A vawt sate hu in a mai uh a zum le, Biakinnpi sak tu ngealnate amate thiangson in: a vawt tu lim, a sung tumna le pusuana, a pung, na theampo vawt tu zia le a zui tu thute le ngeinate theampo son in. Hi thute theampo amate atu in at in, tua hile na theampo bangbang kingeal ci sia mu thei tu a, ngeina zeksa theampo vawt thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi thu sia Biakinnpi thukham ahi hi: Biakinnpi omna mualdawn le a kiimkot mun theampo sia ciliaphuai in thiangtho hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hite sia biaknatau teenate ahi hi. Biakinnpi teena ah a kizangh piciang pikhaute ma kizangh hi. Biakinnpi ii a bul kiimkot ah centimetre 50 a thuk, centimetre 50 a zai, a ngong nei tuiluanna khat om a, a puasang mong ah centimetre 25 saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biaknatau nuainungbel khen sia a dawn pan a bul metre 1 saang hi. A khen kik sia a kiil pan a nungah centimetre 50 zai in a kiimkot ah kivawt a, metre 2 saang hi. A khen zom kik sia zongh a kiil pan a nungah centimetre 50 zai in a kiimkot ah kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tungbel dawl biakpiaknate halna sia zongh metre 2 saang hi. A king li tungah a dokte sia a dawn dangte saangin saangzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Biaknatau dawn sia a kikim pangh li nei hi a, pangh khat sia metre 6 veu pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A laizang khen zongh a dung a vai kikim a, pangh khat metre 7 veu hi a, a pua sang mong ah centimetre 25 a saang a ngong tuamna nei hi. (Tui luanna sia centimetre 50 zai hi.) Nisuana sangah biaknatau tung kaatona kealleite om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, kong sonte hong ngai ta'n. Biaknatau a kisak ciangin, meihal biakpiakna le sangaw biakpiakna ah a kingo nganhingte ii chi a tungah the in aapna vawt tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zadok suan le paal ahi Levi minam thiampite bek in keima ompuina ah hong pai in ka na seam tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in hi thu kong pia hi. Amate tungah mawphel sangaw biakpiak natu in, khuital moi khat na pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang in a chi pawlkhat na la tu a, biaknatau dawn king li tung a dokte le a lai khen biaknatau kingte tung le a mong kiimkot theampo ah na koi tu hi. Hi bangin biaknatau na thiansua tu uh a na aap tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiakna in a kipia khuital sia nang in na la tu a, biakinn mun ii a puasang, a kiciangtan sa munah na hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zing ciangin a mealhem ngawl kealtal khat kengin mawphel biakpiakna in pia tu ni hi. Biaknatau sia khuital chi taw na thiansua bangma in, kealtal chi taw thiansua in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua teng na man zawkciang, a nii ngealin a mealhem ngawl khuital moi khat le tuutal moi khat kengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />keima kungah hong paipui ta'n. Thiampite in tua cherub te tungah ci al the tu a, keima hong biakpiakna in hal tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sali sung ni simin mawphel biakpiakna in keal khat, khuital khat le tuutal khat pia tu nu hi. A vekpi in a mealhem ngawl het te hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni sali sung thiampite in biaknatau aap tu a, zak thei tu in kinging kholsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua nipi kaal a bo zawkciang thiampite in meihal biakpiakna le mite kipawlkhop biakpiaknate biaknatau tungah a piak kipan tu uh hi. Tua hun ciang note theampo tungah ka lungdam tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa pau zo khi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua pa in biakinn mun nisuana sangah a om a puasang kongpi ah hong paipui hi. Kongpi kikhak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Hi kongpi kikhak top tu a, kihong kik ngeingawl tu hi. Mihing kuama in kizanghsak ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile, Keima, Israel Topa Pathian in tua kongpi kaantanin ka tum zo hi. Hi kongpi kikhak top tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngamukpa ahile keima omna ah a thiangtho an ne tu in pai thei tu hi. Ama in kongpi vang pan sungtanna inndoi lian sia tawn a, tum in pusuak tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang tua pa in saksang kongpi tawnin Biakinnpi mai ah kei hong paipui hi. Ka et ciang Topa Biakinnpi sia ama ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia taw kidim ka mu hi. Keima le keima lei ah ka boksuk hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciang Topa in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, na mu theampo le na zaak theampo pha takin ngaisun in. Biakinnpi taw kisai zui tu thute le ngeinate kong son tu hi. Biakinnpi sungah a kitumsak tu a kipusuaksak tu mihingte le a tum ngawl tu a pusuak ngawl tu mihingte pha takin ciamtee in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Israel mi kei hong langpante tungah, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in a kiihuai amate ngamtatnate thuak zo nawn ngawl tu khi hi ci sia son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima sangaw biakpiakna ii a thau le a chi hong kipiak ciangin amate in ka thu a ni ngawl, vunteap at ngawl ngamdangmite sia Biakinnpi sungah a tumsak hu in ka Biakinnpi ninsak uh hi. Tua ahikom a kiihuai a ngamtatnate taw ka mite in ka thuciamna paltan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka Biakinnpi sungah a zeksa a thiangtho biakpiaknate ah amate in uk ngawlin ngamdangmite in uksak zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in vunteap at ngawl ngamdangmi, ka thu hong ni ngawl peuma, Israel mite taw a teang khawm ngamdangmi khat ngawngawn ka Biakinnpi sungah tum thei ngawl tu hi, ci thu ka thangsak hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Israel midangte taw kei hong taisan khawm a, milim a bia Levi mite daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in ka Biakinnpi sungah kongpite cingin Biakinnpi nasepte seamin keima na a seam thei tu uh hi. Amate in mihingte ii meihal le sangaw biakpiakna ah a piak nganhing te ngo thei tu a, mihingte kisapnate sepsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang amate in Israel mite atu in milim biakna vawtsak a, tuabangin mite mawna sungah paipui ahikom, Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in, amate daan piak kul tu hi, ci in ciliap huai kiciamna ka vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in thiampite bangin keima ii na seam ngawl tu hi, kei atu a thiangtho khat pawpo ii a nai neak ngawl tu, ahibuale Thiangthobel Mun ah tum ngawl tu hi. Hite in a kiihuai a ngamtatnate hu in daan piakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungah nasep nawno teng sia amate sep tu in ka see tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Tua Levi minam Zadok ii suan le paal thiampite ahile Israel midangte ii kei hong taisat zawkciang, Biakinnpi sungah thumaan takin ka na seam suak uh hi. Tua ahiciang tu in amate sia ka na seam a, ka omna ah hong pai in sangaw biakpiakna a thau le a chi taw biakpiakna hong nei tute ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate bekma ka Biakinnpi sung tum in biaknatau ah seam tu a, biakinn sungah biakna vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate Biakinnpi suum sungnung paina kongpi vang a tum ciangin puanneal silh tu uh hi. Biakinnpi suum sungnung, ahibuale Biakinnpi sungah na a sep laitakin amate in samul taw kivawt khat pawpo silh ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A khua ul ngawl natu in amate in puanneal dial khim tu a, puanneal ngoaipuan tual teangin, kawngkhau sawm ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihonpite omna suum puanung ah a pai ma in, amate in Biakinnpi sung a nasepna ah a silh puante sut tu a, a thiangtho inndoite sungah nusiat kul tu hi. A thiangtho biakpiakna puante ii mite ngim a piak ngawl natu in amate in puan dang silh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Thiampite in a sam meettol ngawl tu a, a sam sausak ngawl tu uh hi. Amate in a sam a pha bekin hoai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thiampite in suum sungnung ah a pai ma in, sapittui ne ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thiampi khat in a kikhul sa numei khat teenpui ngawl tu hi; Israel numei thiangtho khat ahibuale thiampi dang khat ii zi, meingong nu bek taw teang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thiampite in ka mite tungah biakna taw kisai a thiangtho le a thiangtho ngawlte kilamdanna le a zeksa ngeina thiangtho le a thiangtho ngawlte hil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thukhen tu thu khat a pian ciang, thiampite in keima thukhamte bangin thukhen tu hi. Amate in biakna poaite sia a zui tu ka piak thute le ngeinate bangin vawt tu a, ka Sabbath thiangthosak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Thiampi khat sia mithi luang a thamna taw in zeksa ngeina taw in nin tu hi, ahihang a thi sia ama ii a nu a pa khat, a tate khat ahibuale a suapui pa khat ahibuale pasal nei ngawl lai a suapuinu khat ahile a nin suak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama a thiantho kik zawkciang, ni sali sung ngak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tuaciang Biakinnpi suum sungnung ah pai in, a kithiansua natu in sangaw biakpiakna pia tu hi, tua hile ama in Biakinnpi sungah na seam kik thei tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ka pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Israel tungah ka piaksa khang khat pan khang dangkhat ah a ki aap susuk tu thiampiza sia thiampite ii a saan tel ahi hi. Israel ngam ah thiampite in nei le lamh nei ngawl tu a; amate kisap theampo sia keima ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Antang taw biakpiakna, mawna le khialna kiphel natu biakpiakna le kitatna in a kipia biakpiakna theampo sia thiampite an hi tu a, Israel ngam ah keima atu in a kipia tuam theampo amate nga tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thiampite in anpal teng sung pan a limci belte le kei tungah a dang hong kipia theampo tang tu uh hi. Mihingte in anluum a em simin, a em maksakbel sia biakpiakna in thiampite tungah pia tu uh hi, tuasia ciang amate inn sungah ka thupha tung tu hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama thu in a thi thawthong vacim le nganhing ii sa ahibuale nganhing dang khat ii thalup sia ii sa thiampite in ne ngawl tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minam sim tungah piak tu leitang khenin a kihawm ciang, khen khat sia Topa tungah ki aap tu hi. Tuasia kilometre 12.5 sau in kilometre 10 zai tu hi. Hi mun bup sia thiangtho tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi munah Biakinnpi atu a pangh a kikim king li nei khen khat om tu a, a pangh sim in metre 250 pha tu hi, a kiimkot ah metre 25 a zai mun awng khat om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi mun ii lang, kilometre 12.5 a sau, kilometre 5 a zai khen khat kitee tu a; a vekpi sung pan a thiangthobel mun ahi Biakinnpi om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ngam ii a thiangthona mun khat hi tu a, Topa Biakinnpi ah a seam thiampite atu a kikoituam mun ahi hi. Tua ii sungah amate innte le Biakinnpi mun atu leitang om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A dang a mun lang teng sia Biakinnpi ah a seam Levi te neisa in kikoituam tu hi. Tua munah amate teenna tu khuate om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thiangtho mun ii zom ah kilometre 12.5 a sau, kilometre 2.5 a zai khen dang khat sia Israel mi pawpo teen thei natu mun, khuapi khat atu in kikoituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa atu leitang zongh kikoituam tu hi. Mun thiangtho ii nitumna ngamngi pan nitumna sang Mediterranean tuipi dong; nisuana ngamngi pan nisuana sang ngam mong dong hi tu a, Israel minamte atu a kipia mun khat ii a sauna za in sau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi mun sia kumpipa ii nga tu Israel ngam leitang hi tu hi, tua ahikom ama in mite zawthawk vawt nawn ngawl tu a, ahihang a om lai ngam theampo sia Israel minamte neisa hisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “No Israel ngamukte awng, mawna khialna na vawt uh khuangei lei zo hi! Na ngoltolna uh le ngual na zawthawk vawtnate tawlnga vun. A pha le a maan bek vawt vun. Ka minamte a ngam uh pan hawlkeak kik ngeingawl tu nu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in hi teng kong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mihing sim in a ngit teena maan le teena maante a zak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“A ko teena ephahs sia a tui teena bath taw kibang tu hi. Homer sia zak maanbel teena ahi hi. Teenate a nuai a bang ahi hi: 1 homer = 10 ephahs = 10 baths
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A ngit teenate a nuai a bang hi tu hi: 20 gerahs = 1 shekel 60 shekels = 1 mina
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Hite doppha in na biakpiaknate na pia tu uh hi: Zungtaang: a piang theampo sung pan 1/60 Mangtaang: a piang theampo sung pan 1/60 Olive thau: a kungte pan a piang theampo sung pan 1/100 (Bath taw teena: 10 baths = 1 homer = 1 kor ) Tuu: Israel lo hingna te pan a piangte 200 sung pan 1 “Antang taw biakpiakna, nganhing pum bup meihal biakpiakna, kipawlkhop biakpiakna atu nganhingte nong paipui tu uh hi, tua hile noma mawna khialnate hong kimaisak tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in thu kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ngamsung mite theampo in hi biakpiaknate Israel ngamukpa kungah paipui nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in Israel minam bup ii Thadet Poaite, Sabbath te le a dang poaite theampo atu in nganhing pum bup meihal biakpiak natu nganhingte, antang biakpiakna le sapittui biakpiaknate a piak tu sia ama vaipuak ahi hi. Ama in mawphel biakpiakna, antang biakpiakna, nganhing pum bup meihal biakpiakna le kipawlkhop biakpiaknate sia Israel mite ii mawna khialnate kiphel natu in pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Tha masabel thadet ni in noma in khuital mealhem ngawl khat taw sangaw biakpiakna taw Biakinnpi thiansua tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thiampipa in mawphel biakpiakna pan a chi pawlkhat la tu a, Biakinnpi innkha khuamte tung, biaknatau king li te tung le suum sungnung kongpi vang khuamte tungah koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tha sim ni sali ni in, a heak ngawl hu in ahibuale a ngaisut khol ngawl bulin mawna a vawt khat pawpo luangin tuasia a kibangin na vawt tu uh hi. Hi bangin Biakinnpi na thiangthosak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tha masabel ni sawm le ni li ni in noma in Paisan poai vawt tu in na kipan tu uh hi. mi simin ni sali sung teng tol saw ngawl anluum ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Poai ii ni masabel ni in ngamukpa in khuital khat sia ama mawna khialnate le a mite theampo ii mawna khialnate atu in mawphel biakpiakna in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in ni sali sung ni simin a mealhem ngawl khuital sali le tuutal salite Topa tungah a pum bupin meihal biakpiakna in pia tu hi. Ama in ni simin kealtal khat taw zong mawphel biakpiakna nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khuital khat le tuutal khat sangaw biakpiakna in a kingaw simin antang taw biakpiak natu in antang litre sawm le sali le a lang le olive thau litre thum pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tha sali tha ni sawm le ni nga ni a kipan Buk Poai atu sia a kibang ma in mawphel biakpiakna, a pum bup meihal biakpiakna le antang le olive thau taw biakpiaknate ni sali sung ni simin ngamukpa in pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Suum sungnung tumna nisuana sang kongpi vang sia, ni luk nasep sung kikhak tu a, ahihang Sabbath le Thadet Poai ah kihong tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa sia suum puanung pan kongpi vang tawnin sungtanna inndoi sungah pai tu a, thiampite in ama ii pum bup sangaw biakpiaknate le kipawlkhop biakpiakna a vawt hun sung teng kongpi khuamte hui ah ding tu hi. Tua mun kongpi ah ama in biakna a vawt kul tu a tua zawkciang pusuak kik tu hi. Kongpi sia nitak dong kikhak ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sabbath sim le Thadet Poai simin, mihingte theampo zongh in kunin kongpi mai ah Topa bia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sabbath ni in kumpipa in Topa tungah a mealhem ngawl tuuno luk le tuutal khat, pum bup meihal biakpiak natu in paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in tuutal khat simin antang litre sawm le sali le a lang biakpiakna in paipui tu a, tuaciang tuuno khat sim atu in a piak nop pawpo paipui tu hi. Tuabang antang biakpiakna a nei simin olive thau litre thum veu ama in paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thadet Poai sungah a mealhem ngawl khuital moi khat, tuuno luk le tuutal khat ama in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuital khat le tuutal khat a piak simin, antang litre sawm le sali le a lang pia tu a, tuaciang tuuno khat a piak simin kumpipa in a piak nop po taw pia khawm tu hi. Tuabang antang biakpiakna a piak simin olive thau litre thum pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in kongpi vang ii sungtanna inndoi sia a nusiat ciang a tumna lampi sia ma zui in a pusua kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Poai khat pawpo ah mihingte in Topa bia tu hong pai ciang, saksang kongpi pan a tumte in, biakna a vawt zawkciang, thangsang kongpi pan pusuak tu a, thangsang kongpi pan a tumte in saksang kongpi pan pusuak tu hi. Kuama in a tumna lampi pan pusuak thei ngawl tu a, a kingalsai kongpi pan pusuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa sia mihingte pai ciang tum tu a, mihingte pusua ciangin pusuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Poai vawt nite le Poaite ah khuital, ahibuale tuutal khat a piak simin antang litre sawm le sali le a lang taw pia tu a, tuuno khat a piak simin biakpiakna a vawt pa in a piak nop pawpo pia tu hi. Olive thau litre thum sia tuabang antang biakpiakna taw veu pia khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kumpipa in Topa tungah a thinzaw za biakpiakna sia pum bup meihal biakpiakna taw ahizong, kipawlkhop biakpiakna taw ahizong, a nei nop ciang suum sungnung paina nisuana sang kongpi kihon tu hi. Ama in Sabbath ni a biakpiakna a vawt bangin biakpiakna vawt tu a, kongpi sia ama pusua kik zawkciang kikhak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Zing simin, a mealhem ngawl kum khat a pha tuuno khat sia Topa tungah a pum bup biakpiakna in hal tu hi. Hi biakpiakna sia ni simin kinei nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zing sim biakpiakna ah zungtaang vui kilogramme 2 le tua taw hel tu in olive thau litre khat taw zong pia khawm tu hi. Topa tungah hi biakpiakna ngeinate sia a tawntungin zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuuno, zungtaang vui le olive thaute sia Topa tungah zing sim a tawntungin biakpiakna in piak tu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in thupia hi: “Kumpipa in a neisa leitang mun khat pawpo a tapate khat tungah letsongin a pia le tua tapa in tang tu a, a innkuan ii neisa khat bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa in a neisa leitang khat pawpo sia a naseam khat po tungah a pia le Puakik Kum a thet ciang, kumpipa ii neisa suak kik tu hi. Tua leitang sia ama ii neisa hi a, ama le a tapate bek in a tawntungin nei thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa in a mite ii neisa te peuma laaksak ngawl tu hi. Ama in a tapate tungah a piak leitang khat pawpo sia ama atu a kikoisia sung pan bek hi tu a, tua hile, ama in ka mite khat pawpo sia amate leitang laaksakna taw zothaw ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, tua pa in saksang a ngaa, suum sungnung thangsang kongpi mai ah a om inndoite tumna ah kei hong paipui hi. Hite sia thiampite atu a thiangtho inndoite ahi uh hi. Inndoite ii nitumna sang mun khat ama in kawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaciang “Hi mun sia thiampite ii mawphel sangaw biakpiakna sate huan natu mun, ahibuale kitat natu biakpiakna le biakpiakna anvuite em natu mun ahi hi, tuabangin a thiangtho na khat pawpo mihingte ngim a piak thei natu mun suum puanung ah kipaipui ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a suum puanung ah kei hong paipui a, a king li sim ah suum nozaw metre 20 a sau metre 15 a zai khat tek a om sia hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuate khat sim sia suang pang taw ki um a, pang bealhin meikhukte kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua pa in kei tungah, “Hite sia mite piak sangaw biakpiakna a sate biakinn ah naseamte ii a huanna mun anbukte ahi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua pa in Biakinnpi sung tumna ah hong heakpui kik hi. Tua tumna nuai pan tui hong phul a, Biakinnpi maingatna nisuana sangah luang hi. Tuasia biakinn thangsang a nuai pan biaknatau thangsang tawnin luangsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang tua pa in saksang kongpi lam tawnin biakinn mun pua sangah kei hong paipui a, nisuana sang a ngaa kongpi ah hong paipui kawkoai hi. Luino khat sia kongpi thang sangah luang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua pa in a piciang taw nisuana sang luidung zuisuk in metre 590 tee a, tuaciang ama in tuak ah luitui tan tu in hong sawl hi. Tui sia ka siakmit ciang bek pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a dang metre 500 tee a, tuaciang tui sia ka khup ciang pha hi. A dang metre 500 tee suk lai a, tui sia ka kawng ciang dong pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in metre 500 tee thua a, tualai ah tuithuk mama ahikom tui ka tan zo bua hi. Tui thuk lei ahikom tui op ngawlin kikaantan zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in kei tungah, “A thithei mihing awng, hi thu theampo pha takin ciamtee in,” hong ci hi. Tua zawkciang tua pa in ngunvaal ah hong heakpui kik a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua mun ka thet ciang, thingkung tam mama ngunvaal lang le lang ah a om ka mu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in kei tungah, “Hi tui sia nisuana sang tawnin Jordan Kuam le Tuipi Thi dongah luang suk hi. Tuipi Thi sungah a tum suk ciang, tua tuipi tui al sia tuithiang taw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Luitui luanna mun theampo ah nganhing namcin le ngasa namcinte om tu hi. Hi luitui in Tuipi Thi sungah tuite thiangsak tu a, tuaciang a luanna mun po ah nuntakna piangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engedi Cik tuite panin Eneglaim Ciktuite dong tuipi vaalbo tungah ngasa mante om tu a, tua munah a ngeente a ko tu in phalh tu uh hi. Mediterranean Tuipi sungah ngasa namcin tam mama a om bangma in hi luitui sungah ngasa namcin tam mama om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang vaalbo dungah a om buannawngte le tuicing note sungah tuite kithiangsak ngawl tu hi. Tua tuite ci al pian natu in tua munah om tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lui lang le lang vaalbo tungah an tu in thingkung namcinte po tu hi. A teete vul ngeingawl tu a, a nga pangh ngeingawlin nga tawntung tu hi. Tha simin tuate in nga thakte nga tu hi, banghang ziam cile Biakinnpi pan a luang luitui in tui pia hi. A thingkungte in an piangsak tu a, tuaciang a teete sia mihingte ciidamsak kik natu in kizangh tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Hite in minam sawm le nii te sungah leitang a kihawm tute ii ngamngite hi a, Joseph minam in ngamkhen nii nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in na taanghpupite tungah hi ngam piak tu in a ciliaphuai takin ka kamciamsa hi; tu in noma sungah a kikim in hawm diimdiam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saksang ngamngi sia Mediterranean Tuipi pan nisuana sangah pai a, Hethlon khuapi, Hamath Ciangh tawnin Zedad khuapi ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Berothah le Sibraim khuapite (Tua khuapite sia Damascus kumpi ngam le Hamath kumpi ngam kilaklaw ah om hi), tuaciang Ticon khuapi dong (Hauran ngamkhen ngamngi hui ah om) hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom saksang ngamngi sia Mediterranean pan nisuana sang Enon khuapi, a saksang pan Damascus le Hamath ngamkhente dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nisuana sang ngamngi sia Damascus le Hauran ngam kilaklaw mun khat pan thang sangah paisuk a, nitumna sang Israel ngam le nisuana sang Gilead ngam kilaklaw ngamngi ahi Jordan ngun taw. Tuipi Thi hui ah a om Tamar dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Thangsang ngamngi sia Tamar pan nitumna thangsang ah pai in Kadesh Meribah ciktui ah, tua zawkciang nitumna saksang Egypt ngamngi dung, Mediterranean Tuipi dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Nitumna ngamngi sia Mediterranean hi a, saksang ah pai in Hamath Ciangh ii nitumna mun khat dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hi leitang sia na minamte sungah hawm vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tua sia a tawntungin noma neisa hi tu hi. Ngamdangmi noma taw a teang khawm te le hi lai munah a suak a tate zongh in leitang na hawm uh ciang a nga tu bang hawmtel saang tu uh hi. Amate sia Israel ngammi tatakte bangma in kivawt tu a, Israel minamte taw a kihawmna meetang sawk khawmin leitang nga tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngamdangmi hong teang khat simin a teen khoppui Israel minamte taw a kibangin ama ii tel nga tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ka pau zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saksang ngamngi sia Mediterranean tuipi pan nisuana sang ah pai a, Hethlon khuapi, Hamath Ciangh, Enon khuapi, Damascus le Hamath kumpi ngamte kilaklaw ngamngi dong ahi hi. Minam khat simin leitang khen khat tek, nisuana ngamngi pan nitumna sang Mediterranean Tuipi dong, a nuai a kingual bangin sak pan thang dong nga tu hi. Dan Asher Naphtali Manasseh Ephraim Reuben Judah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zom leitang khen sia a zak tuam tu in kituam koi tu hi. Hi sia saksang pan thangsang dong kilometre 12.5 zai a, a minamte leikhen a kipiak bangma in nisuana pan nitumna dong a sauna kibang tu hi. A Biakinnpi sia hi leikhen sungah om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi leikhen ii laisaan ah kilometre 12.5 a sau, kilometre 10 a zai muntuam khat sia Topa atu in kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi a thiangtho mun ii leikhawk khat sia thiampite ii neisa hi tu hi. Amate ii leikhawk sia nisuana pan nitumna ah kilometre 12:5, sak pan thang kilometre 5 pha tu hi. Topa ii Biakinnpi sia hi mun ii a laizang santak a kikoi tu hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi mun thiangtho sia Zadok suan le paal thiampite atu ahi hi. Amate in ka na thumaan takin hong sepsak a, Israel dangte ii ngamtat khialnate ah Levi minam sung pan a dangte kihel bangin amate kihel ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in Levi te leitang neina mun taw kizomin muntuam khat nei tu a, tuasia a thiangthobel mun hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levi te zongh in muntuam khat nei tu a, thiampite leikhawk ii thangsang hi tu hi. Hi mun zongh nisuana pan nitumna dong kilometre 12.5 hi tu a, saksang pan thangsang dong kilometre 5 hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa tungah a ki aapna mun sia leitang a phabelna mun hi a, hi mun sia midang khat pawpo tungah kizuak thei ngawl, kitheak thei ngawl, kikhiin thei ngawl tu hi. Tua mun sia thiangtho a, Topa neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A taanglai a tuam vilvel mun sia kilometre 12.5 sau in kilometre 2.5 zai a, a thiangtho mun ahi ngawl hang mite ii a dei bangin a zak tu ahi hi. Tua munah amate teangin leitangte zangh thei tu hi. A khuapi sia a laizang ah om tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua pangh li teng kikim in, a pangh khat sim metre 2,250 hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuapi kiimkot sia a pangh simin metre 125 a zai mun awng khat veu om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuapi a kisaat zawkciang mun awng lai leitang, mun thiangtho ii thangsang lian mun khat — kilometre 5 kilometre 2.5 a pha nisuana sang mun le kilometre 5 kilometre 2.5 a pha nitumna sang mun sia ah khuapi sung a teang mite in longam in zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuapi sungah a teang pawpo akua minam ahizong tua munah lotho thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahiciang a khen laizang ah a kikoituam mun buppi sia pangh li nei tu a, pangh khat sim kilometre 12.5 pha tu hi, tua ii sungah khuapi mun zongh kihel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biakinnpi omna mun ii nisuana sang le nitumna sang ah thiampite leitang, Levi te leitang le khuapi a taanglai leitang teng sia ngamukpa ii neisa ahi hi. Tuasia in nisuana sang ah nisuana ngamngi dong, nitumna sang ah Mediterranean Tuipi dong, saksang pan Judah ngamkhen le thangsang pan Benjamin ngam khen dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi muntuam ii thangsang, a taanglai Israel minamte in leitang khen khat tek, nisuana sang ngamngi pan nitumna sang Mediterranean Tuipi dong, saksang pan thangsang dong a nuai a bangin nga tu hi. Benjamin Simeon Issachar Zebulun Gad
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gad minam a piakna mun ii thangsang ngamngi sia Tamar pan nitumna thangsang Kadesh Ciktui dong, tua zawkciang Egypt ngamngi dung pan nitumna saksang Mediterranean Tuipi dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Tuabangin Israel minamte ii tan tu in a ngam leitang sia a khen, a khen in kihawm tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jerusalem khuapi sung tumna sawm le nii om hi. Pang li te sung pan pang khat simin metre 2,250 pha a, tuate khat sim in kongpi thum tek nei in kongpi khat sim minam khat ii min veu kivaw hi. Saksang pang a kongpite ii minte sia Reuben, Judah, le Levi hi a; nisuana sang pang a kongpite sia Joseph, Benjamin le Dan hi a; thangsang pang a kongpite sia Simeon, Issachar le Zebulun te hi a; nitumna sang pang a kongpite sia Gad, Asher le Naphtali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khuapi ii pangh li teng a kiim uum pang sia ii sauna kingawm sia metre 9,000 pha hi. Tu pan kipan tua khuapi ii min sia, ‘Hi munah Topa om hi!’ “Jehovah Shammah” hi tu hi.
  </para>
</usx>
